rs/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/981fa227ccc361fca25c426aceb0eadf9755a295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:20:12Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:20:12Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"docs: add architecture walkthrough video script (PT)\n\nROTEIRO_VIDEO_ARQUITETURA.md — a step-by-step, screencast-style script (Portuguese) narrating HOW the\narchitecture was reasoned out: problem & constraint, product questions (pay-before-driver), the swappable-\nseam insight, the depth-vs-breadth debate, service decomposition, async + the orchestrated saga, polyglot\npersistence, real-time (SignalR), the bugs the E2E surfaced (outbox flush; MassTransit 9 license → 8), and\nthe one-command license-free result. Includes per-scene VISUAL/NARRATION/on-screen-text, timecodes, a b-roll\ncapture list, and a teleprompter pass. Linked from the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78f7486cde3c7acd189338c6c836e9c744d6a250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/78f7486cde3c7acd189338c6c836e9c744d6a250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/981fa227ccc361fca25c426aceb0eadf9755a295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu