ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/5b741876c50c1da6c45cec70b83c682412a2c7b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:15:57Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:15:57Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"docs: add consolidated SYSTEM_DESIGN.md (SDD)\n\nA single system design document gathering: overview & goals, C4 (context/container/component) + runtime\nsequence, services & responsibilities, polyglot data, messaging + the order saga (with compensation),\ncross-cutting NFRs (idempotency, outbox, real-time, swappable seams, observability), quality/scaling notes,\ndeployment topology, testing strategy, limitations, and the ADR index. References _techspec.md for\nimplementation-level detail rather than duplicating it. Linked from the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9beecae293c88fdbfc2938530af85913aafdfbeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/9beecae293c88fdbfc2938530af85913aafdfbeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/5b741876c50c1da6c45cec70b83c682412a2c7b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}",