pi.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/3ab7241e7512695542f76c7e954c0683cce98b31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:11:32Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:11:32Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"docs(readme): reflect license-free MassTransit 8 stack\n\nFull-stack `docker compose up` no longer needs MT_LICENSE; note the verified end-to-end journey and\nupdate Known limitations (MassTransit 8.5.10 / Apache-2.0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f7c9942b8af11d8044e0afd5b821c718cb993c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/4f7c9942b8af11d8044e0afd5b821c718cb993c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/3ab7241e7512695542f76c7e954c0683cce98b31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/3ab7241e7512695542f76c7e954c0683cce98b31","node_id":"C_kwDOSyNnitoAKDNhYjcyNDFlNzUxMjY5NTU0MmY3NmM3ZTk1NGMwNjgzY2NlOThiMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c","sha":"5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c"}],"sha":"3ab7241e7512695542f76c7e954c0683cce98b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/3ab7241e7512695542f76c7e954c0683cce98b31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:10:41Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:10:41Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"refactor(messaging): downgrade MassTransit 9.1.2 -> 8.5.10 (Apache-2.0, license-free runtime)\n\nMassTransit 9''s RabbitMQ transport is commercially licensed and refuses to start the bus without\nMT_LICENSE. Moving to MassTransit 8.5.10 (Apache-2.0) removes that requirement entirely, so the full\nstack runs with `docker compose up` and no license. The v8<->v9 API was source-compatible for our\nusage — the solution builds clean (0/0) with no code changes to the services.\n\n- All MassTransit/MassTransit.RabbitMQ/MassTransit.EntityFrameworkCore refs: 9.1.2 -> 8.5.10 (12 csproj).\n\nTest determinism (v8''s in-memory harness + a test-double bug surfaced flakiness under load):\n- InMemoryTrackingStore now does an atomic, monotonic save (AddOrUpdate keeping the greater stage),\n  matching production RedisTrackingStore''s Lua compare-and-set. The naive last-write-wins double raced\n  when the harness delivered same-order events concurrently (e.g. OrderRefunded then OrderPlaced left\n  stage 1). This was the real cause of the intermittent Tracking failures.\n- TrackingConsumerHarnessTests: wait for every published event to be consumed, stop the bus gracefully,\n  and don''t dispose the provider (avoids the v8 in-memory harness teardown race).\n- tests/Directory.Build.props + SharedTestConfig.cs: disable xunit parallelization across all test\n  projects; coverlet.runsettings runs one assembly at a time (MaxCpuCount=1) — deterministic runs.\n- ComposeManifestTests: assert the 5 infrastructure services are present (compose now also has the app\n  tier) instead of an exact set.\n\nVerification (MT_LICENSE unset): build 0/0; all unit suites green (Tracking 15x clean); Platform\nreal-RabbitMQ integration 1/1; full-stack E2E 5/5; `docker compose up` brings all 14 containers healthy\nand a live journey through the gateway (place -> settle -> accept -> ready -> pickup -> deliver) reaches\ntracking stage 5 (Delivered) — all license-free.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ff0930a7579151aac6e5b07786557de305fd00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/4ff0930a7579151aac6e5b07786557de305fd00c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c","node_id":"C_kwDOSyNnitoAKDUxODQyODZlYTNiMmZkMmVjNGI1OTc4MTk0MzUzMDQ1NTJmNWUyM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c","sha":"f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c"}],"sha":"5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/5184286ea3b2fd2ec4b597819435304552f5e23c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:19:41Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:19:41Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"docs: high-level C4 diagrams in README + DESIGN_SYSTEM.md\n\n- README: rework into a full project README with C4 diagrams (Mermaid) at Context, Container, and\n  Component (Order service) levels, plus a runtime sequence (happy path + compensation); services table,\n  full-stack run (docker compose + MT_LICENSE note), build/test, layout, quality, known limitations.\n- DESIGN_SYSTEM.md: the Angular SPA design language grounded in src/Web/src/styles.scss — color/typography/\n  shape/elevation tokens, components (buttons, card, role switcher, cart pill, the 5-stage tracking bar with\n  its dot states, connection badge, refund banner), states & motion, accessibility, and the consumer-rich vs\n  restaurant/driver functional-clean treatment (ADR-002).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a67be16d9cbce023935c7100d73fc348f750169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/1a67be16d9cbce023935c7100d73fc348f750169"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c","node_id":"C_kwDOSyNnitoAKGY3MGUyZjE5OTA4NTFiODJkN2E0NGRmY2IyN2E1YzE4OGZkNzBjOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/81295338e08969c7cff92905f093a1a0a4a7af5a","sha":"81295338e08969c7cff92905f093a1a0a4a7af5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/81295338e08969c7cff92905f093a1a0a4a7af5a"}],"sha":"f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f70e2f1990851b82d7a44dfcb27a5c188fd70c8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/81295338e08969c7cff92905f093a1a0a4a7af5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:15:53Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:15:53Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"chore(docker): containerize all services + gateway + web for one-command full-stack run\n\n- Single parameterized repo-root Dockerfile (PROJECT + APP_DLL build args) for the 7 .NET services\n  + gateway; src/Web/Dockerfile (node build -> nginx) for the Angular SPA; .dockerignore.\n- docker-compose.yml extended: 7 services + YARP gateway (host 8080) + web (host 4200), each with\n  env-injected connection strings (infra by service name, bus rabbitmq://rabbitmq), /health\n  healthchecks, and depends_on: service_healthy. Gateway YARP destinations set via __ env vars.\n- infra/postgres-init creates the separate `order` and `payment` databases on first init.\n- Angular apiBase -> http://localhost:8080 (the gateway''s host port).\n\nVerification: `docker compose config` valid; `docker compose build` builds all 9 images (0 errors);\ninfra healthy; services connect to Postgres/Mongo/Redis/Elasticsearch/RabbitMQ and configure\nendpoints; order/payment DBs created; the web container serves the SPA on :4200.\n\nKNOWN LIMITATION: the services use MassTransit 9.1.2, whose RabbitMQ transport is COMMERCIALLY\nLICENSED and refuses to start the bus without MT_LICENSE/MT_LICENSE_PATH (the test suites pass\nbecause they use the unlicensed in-memory harness). Compose passes MT_LICENSE through (default\nempty); provide a key to bring the full stack up — no .NET code change required. Alternatively,\ndowngrade to MassTransit 8 (Apache-2.0/free) to remove the dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de0d6e8280488fc26984667470df706d10758385","url":"htt