), tested with Jest:\n- Shell + role switcher (X-Demo-Role HttpInterceptor); talks only to the gateway (environment.apiBase)\n- Consumer journey: search → restaurant/menu → cart (running total) → checkout (places order then\n  settles payment via the mock callback) → live 5-stage tracking bar\n- Real-time: @microsoft/signalr to /hubs/orders (Subscribe + OrderStatusChanged), monotonic stage\n  advance, reconnect resync from GET /api/orders/{id}/status (ADR-007)\n- Restaurant/driver routes are placeholders (task_16)\n\nVerification: ng build clean (0 errors); Jest 72 passed / 15 suites; line coverage 96.73%.\n(node_modules/ and dist/ are gitignored.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"842079b973a92b3526fffe82a6ce55ebbb3d075d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/842079b973a92b3526fffe82a6ce55ebbb3d075d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/5ad3b665dc6f382783e18a2389bdd3cf00c8209e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/5ad3b665dc6f382783e18a2389bdd3cf00c8209e","node_id":"C_kwDOSyNnitoAKDVhZDNiNjY1ZGM2ZjM4Mjc4M2UxOGEyMzg5YmRkM2NmMDBjODIwOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef","sha":"f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef"}],"sha":"5ad3b665dc6f382783e18a2389bdd3cf00c8209e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/5ad3b665dc6f382783e18a2389bdd3cf00c8209e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T00:33:15Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T00:33:15Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"feat(gateway): API Gateway/BFF + SignalR hub + full-stack E2E; fix Order outbox flush (task_14)\n\ntask_14 — the integration capstone:\n- src/Gateway (YARP): routes the client-facing API to Search/Catalog/Order/Payment/Tracking;\n  X-Demo-Role role switcher (pre-seeded identities, no auth); SignalR hub /hubs/orders that consumes\n  order lifecycle events off the bus and pushes OrderStatusChanged to per-order groups; reconnect\n  resync proxied to Tracking''s status read.\n- tests/E2E.Tests: 22 gateway unit/config tests + a full-stack happy-path E2E that hosts\n  Order/Payment/Dispatch/Tracking/Gateway in-process over a REAL RabbitMQ + Postgres/Redis\n  (Testcontainers) and drives the journey THROUGH THE GATEWAY with a real SignalR client. Gateway\n  coverage 94.66%.\n\nBug fix surfaced by the E2E: the Order accept/ready/pickup/deliver endpoints published to the EF bus\noutbox but never called SaveChangesAsync, so the events were never delivered in production (the\nper-service tests masked it via the in-memory harness). Added the outbox flush in RestaurantOrderService\nand DriverOrderService; the E2E now drives the real endpoints end-to-end (no workaround).\n\nAdded `public partial class Program;` to Order/Payment/Dispatch/Tracking for WebApplicationFactory hosting.\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); Order 46/0; Gateway unit/config 22/0; full-stack E2E 5/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6424a37e83595b0dcd41e3358e3bdc11e274c03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/6424a37e83595b0dcd41e3358e3bdc11e274c03c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef","node_id":"C_kwDOSyNnitoAKGYzYTJkYWE0YmEwZjMyN2VlNTdlZGY4YmRmYjE3MGM5NTU2OTg0ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commit/4b80287b6fa2d09d9fea0393f7d4e0c388b02534","sha":"4b80287b6fa2d09d9fea0393f7d4e0c388b02534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/4b80287b6fa2d09d9fea0393f7d4e0c388b02534"}],"sha":"f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/f3a2daa4ba0f327ee57edf8bdfb170c9556984ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/4b80287b6fa2d09d9fea0393f7d4e0c388b02534/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:12:36Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:12:36Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"feat(services): Tracking service + restaurant/driver flows + compensation (tasks 12, 08, 10, 11)\n\nParallel wave 4 — Tracking (new, disjoint service) built concurrently with the Order extensions.\n\ntask_12 Tracking (src/Services/Tracking, Redis):\n- Consumes order lifecycle events, projects a 5-stage view (monotonic, rebuildable from events)\n- GET /api/orders/{id}/status for reconnect resync; atomic Lua compare-and-set in Redis\n- 36 tests (projector, stage mapping, consumer harness, status endpoint, Redis Testcontainers); coverage 100%\n\ntask_08 Restaurant flow (Order): POST /orders/{id}/accept|ready publish OrderAccepted/OrderReady;\n  GET /restaurant/orders queue (New/In-Progress/Ready); 409 guards.\ntask_10 Driver flow (Order): POST /orders/{id}/pickup|deliver publish OrderPickedUp/OrderDelivered;\n  GET /driver/assignments; 409 guards.\ntask_11 Compensation (Order saga): DriverUnavailable in AwaitingDriver -> publish RefundPayment +\n  OrderRefunded -> terminal NoDriverRefunded; exactly one compensation, idempotent.\n  (OrderRefunded added during integration so Tracking/Notification/consumer reflect the refund.)\n- Order: 46 tests (29 existing + 17 new), coverage 96.96%.\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); solution-wide unit 10/10 projects (0 failures);\nOrder 46/0 (96.96%) incl. Postgres; Tracking 36/0 (100%) incl. Redis. compozy tasks validate: ok.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7520001041a033fa147cdd2dcf18eaa08d3d1a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/7520001041a033fa147cdd2dcf18eaa08d3d1a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/4b80287b6fa2d09d9fea0393f7d4e0c388b02534","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"http