on Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T17:14:34Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"feat(services): add Search and Order+saga services (tasks 05 + 06)\n\nParallel wave 3 — Search and the core Order orchestration saga, implemented concurrently.\n\ntask_05 Search (src/Services/Search, Elasticsearch):\n- Consumes RestaurantPublished and indexes into ES (behind IRestaurantIndex); idempotent\n- GET /api/restaurants?q= (multi_match name/cuisine; blank browses all; no match -> empty 200)\n- 7 tests (endpoint, consumer harness, ES Testcontainers); coverage 89.83%\n\ntask_06 Order + saga (src/Services/Order, PostgreSQL):\n- Order aggregate + MassTransit orchestration saga (EF Core saga repository + transactional outbox)\n- POST /api/orders (publishes OrderPlaced), GET /api/orders/{id} (maps saga state -> OrderStatus)\n- Full happy-path saga: OrderPlaced->CapturePayment->AwaitingPayment; PaymentSettled->Paid;\n  OrderAccepted->Preparing; OrderReady->DriverRequested->AwaitingDriver; DriverAssigned->PickedUp->Delivered\n- Idempotent (structural + OnUnhandledEvent Ignore); 29 tests (saga harness + Postgres); coverage 97.31%\n\nIntegration fix: the saga publishes the DriverRequested EVENT (consumed by Dispatch/task_09),\nreconciling the redundant RequestDriver-command vs DriverRequested-event pair in Contracts.\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); solution-wide unit 9/9 projects (0 failures);\nOrder 29/0 (97.31%), Search 7/0 (89.83%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7413e2e8046dec71e91c2dcdc86b1a29eb2c0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/c7413e2e8046dec71e91c2dcdc86b1a29eb2c0a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/5428d59f153e3ed4ee01a5edb3cbc04959d31c6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":