 + seeded drivers; nearest-available IDriverMatcher mock (swappable)\n- DriverRequested consumer -> publishes DriverAssigned or DriverUnavailable; idempotent\n- No-driver compensation path toggled by Dispatch:SeedDrivers=false\n- 13 tests (matcher, consumer-via-harness, seeder, + 2 Testcontainers-Redis integration); coverage 95.4%\n\ntask_13 Notification (src/Services/Notification):\n- INotificationPort fire-and-forget mock (accepted-for-delivery); stateless\n- Consumers for OrderPlaced/OrderReady/DriverAssigned/OrderDelivered/OrderRefunded; idempotent\n- 8 tests via the in-memory MassTransit harness; coverage 100%\n\nAlso adds coverlet.runsettings (excludes Program.cs composition roots from the coverage denominator).\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); solution-wide unit tests pass (no regression);\nDispatch 13/0 (95.4%), Notification 8/0 (100%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e11ff844106398362bf06804f18d450e26a080f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/9e11ff844106398362bf06804f18d450e26a080f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/e3190c196f54d89d283e4b82f1f1ef0521be7592","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use