.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/commits/b40ed846e80b3d7040a07c68b09fe842fb199056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T16:17:38Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T16:17:38Z","email":"rgarcia@otimize.io","name":"Robson Garcia"},"message":"feat(platform): add shared platform library — messaging, logging, correlation, health (task_03)\n\nImplements task_03 of .compozy/tasks/restaurant-delivery-mvp (status: completed).\n\n- New src/Shared/Platform (FrameworkReference Microsoft.AspNetCore.App):\n  - AddPlatformMessaging: MassTransit over RabbitMQ with immediate retry + endpoint configuration\n  - CorrelationIdMiddleware + CorrelationContext: read/generate X-Correlation-ID, echo it, and push\n    it onto the Serilog LogContext; AddPlatformSerilog configures Serilog (LogContext + console)\n  - AddPlatformHealthChecks / MapPlatformHealthChecks (/health); MassTransit bus check included\n  - IIdempotencyStore + InMemoryIdempotencyStore + IdempotencyKey.For(orderId, correlationId)\n    + RunOnceAsync helper\n  - AddPlatformCore / UsePlatform compose the standard service wiring\n- Tests (tests/Platform.Tests): correlation + idempotency unit tests, wiring tests, and a\n  Testcontainers RabbitMQ integration test asserting HealthCheckService reports Healthy once connected\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); Platform.Tests 8 passed / 0 failed; coverage 100%.\n\nNote: message-boundary correlation propagation (a MassTransit filter) is deferred; HTTP-boundary\ncorrelation + Serilog enrichment are implemented and tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4861b074980199339c2dbfd6bb423082655f1e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/a4861b074980199339c2dbfd6bb423082655f1e9"},"url":