ompleted).\n\n- .NET solution (RestaurantDelivery.slnx) with src/{Shared,Services,Gateway,Web} + tests/ layout\n- docker-compose.yml: RabbitMQ, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Elasticsearch, Redis with health checks;\n  one-command bootstrap via `docker compose up -d --wait`\n- global.json (SDK pin 10.0.300), .editorconfig, .gitignore, README\n- Bootstrap smoke-check helpers (TcpHealthCheck, ComposeManifest, SdkPin, InfraEndpoints) + tests\n- RabbitMQ host ports remapped to 5682/15682 to avoid a clash with another local broker\n  (internal port unchanged: services use rabbitmq:5672 on the Docker network)\n\nVerification: dotnet build clean (0/0); dotnet test 9 passed / 0 failed; coverage 93.44%;\ndocker compose stack reached healthy on all 5 services.\n\nAlso includes the upstream planning artifacts (_idea/_prd/_techspec/_tasks + adr-001..007)\nand task files task_01..16 produced by the Compozy pipeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7ce51baccf5361b8451f56d8b03bfb90f6fdbdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/trees/d7ce51baccf5361b8451f56d8b03bfb90f6fdbdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otimize-io/test-compozy-restaurant-delivery/git/commits/688d94a89c9af571f1bfcbee958ce202b5ade0b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13423577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobsonGarcia","id":13423577,"login":"RobsonGarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobsonGarcia/orgs","received