ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/commits/a6d3e5e406f3f115e0e8525cd7d834711c2f78c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:18:47Z","email":"thejasrao262003@gmail.com","name":"thejasrao262003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:18:47Z","email":"thejasrao262003@gmail.com","name":"thejasrao262003"},"message":"Narrated MP4 video keepsake\n\n- app/video/builder.py composites the illustrations into a portrait slideshow\n  (durations weighted by scene text) with the narration laid over it, using the\n  bundled ffmpeg (imageio-ffmpeg) — CPU only, no system ffmpeg needed.\n- Orchestrator builds the video after the PDF (best-effort: never fails the\n  story); StoryResult gains video_path.\n- Storybook tab gains a video player + a shareable-link line; handle_generate\n  uploads the MP4 to the Supabase ''Memory-Lantern'' bucket (best-effort) and shows\n  the public URL.\n- asset_store.save_video; tests for duration logic + a real render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26f8b7da5a0bc2143df646a75393f8379350f5bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/git/trees/26f8b7da5a0bc2143df646a75393f8379350f5bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/git/commits/a6d3e5e406f3f115e0e8525cd7d834711c2f78c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"http