_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/commits/d1c0e726feb159bc767da1ccbd408fadb358b247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:10:08Z","email":"thejasrao262003@gmail.com","name":"thejasrao262003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:10:08Z","email":"thejasrao262003@gmail.com","name":"thejasrao262003"},"message":"Phase 4: Supabase storage + feedback tab + adaptive loop\n\n- Storage moved to Supabase: Postgres reactions/stories tables (session_store)\n  and Supabase Storage for assets (asset_store), via a shared supabase_client\n  using the service-role key. SQL schema in docs/supabase_schema.sql.\n- Feedback tab wired: opening it shows each scene''s text; reaction buttons record\n  pending reactions; Save feedback persists them and refreshes the 7-day history.\n- Adaptive loop is now live end-to-end (reaction history -> MiniCPM5-1B weights\n  -> story prompt). Best-effort story-metadata insert after generation.\n- Config: add supabase, swap HF storage envs for SUPABASE_URL/SUPABASE_KEY,\n  update env check, STORAGE.md note. Tests for the store (client mocked).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09b05657122bd9ec621b71665c03b59e4d268823","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/git/trees/09b05657122bd9ec621b71665c03b59e4d268823"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thejasrao262003/Memory-Lantern/git/commits/d1c0e726feb159bc767da1ccbd408fadb358b247","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92736934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thejasrao262003/ev