om/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/30def261075207fa4cbaa828ab6877b52a6ded8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:53:38Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:53:38Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"signalk-container-helper: correct four review findings\n\nAll four verified against the 0.11.0 and manager 1.32.0 source; all\nfour were real, and two of them were worse than stale.\n\nThe named-volume safety claim was wrong in the dangerous direction.\nassertVolumeIsNotBroaderThanRequested runs only for the convenience\nfields signalkDataMount and signalkConfigRootMount; explicit\nconfig.volumes entries - which the resolveMount recipe produces - are\nconverted straight to whole-volume binds with no check on 1.32.0\neither. So the text steered readers off the guarded path onto the\nunguarded one while promising them the guard. Now states which fields\nare protected, that a non-empty subPath is a warning rather than\nisolation, and shows the caller rejecting the exposure.\n\nThe cancellation advice would have caused a regression: stop() takes no\narguments, so telling consumers to delete their AbortController removes\ntheir only way to interrupt a start''s manager or readiness wait on\nshutdown. Serialization and cancellation are now separated - drop the\nmutex, keep the controller, abort before stop().\n\nresolveEndpoint''s example omitted the required productName and the port\nthat managed mode throws invalid-option without, so it neither\ntypechecked nor ran. The schema example put externalUrl directly in\nproperties, where RJSF always renders it, making the hiding claim false\nfor the code shown; both variants are now spelled out with the\ndependencies wiring and WithExternalUrl.","tree":{"sha":"8462e0458bd9c343f8cdd06925b40eb527c85e89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/8462e0458bd9c343f8cdd06925b40eb527c85e89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/30def261075207fa4cbaa828ab6877b52a6ded8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/30def261075207fa4cbaa828ab6877b52a6ded8a","node_id":"C_kwDOSyn3etoAKDMwZGVmMjYxMDc1MjA3ZmE0Y2JhYTgyOGFiNjg3N2I1MmE2ZGVkOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/288005995816f4f36991a12bd9f971b9a48910e5","sha":"288005995816f4f36991a12bd9f971b9a48910e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/288005995816f4f36991a12bd9f971b9a48910e5"}],"sha":"30def261075207fa4cbaa828ab6877b52a6ded8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/30def261075207fa4cbaa828ab6877b52a6ded8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/288005995816f4f36991a12bd9f971b9a48910e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:33:16Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:33:16Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"signalk-container-helper: modernize for v0.11.0\n\nThe skill was verified against v0.2.1 (July 2026); the library is now\n0.11.0 and the manager 1.32.x. Nine minor versions of drift had turned\nparts of it from stale into wrong.\n\nCorrected two false claims. `signalkDataMount` was described as the\nplugin''s data dir and used that way in the example — it is\nsignalk-container''s OWN dir, structurally incapable of varying per\nplugin, which was filed as helper #35 and fixed in 0.6.0. The example\nnow uses resolveMount(), with the 1.32.0 named-volume scope rule that\nsilently over-mounts below that version. Node floor is >=22, not >=24.\n\nAdded what 0.3-0.11 introduced: the managed/self-hosted endpoint switch\n(resolveEndpoint plus the ./schema entry point, including why it emits\nplain JSON Schema rather than TypeBox and the two traps - undefined\nmeans managed, managed mode does not imply a container instance); the\ncancellable serialized lifecycle from 0.4.0, including that\ncancellation is cooperative rather than pre-emptive; the full 12 error\ncodes, up from 6.\n\nReframed section 1 from \"two shapes, two classes\" to three seams, since\nthe endpoint switch is a config-level choice over the same transport\nrather than a third class.\n\nEvery export, floor and behaviour claim re-verified against the\ninstalled 0.11.0 source rather than its README.","tree":{"sha":"d32fc8776facce06dee43b33907ecef9819a17e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/d32fc8776facce06dee43b33907ecef9819a17e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/288005995816f4f36991a12bd9f971b9a48910e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following