ea5865f9d6d093","node_id":"C_kwDOSyn3etoAKGQ3YzZhMjE5MWQzOWYyNzUzY2M0YzZkNDJhZWE1ODY1ZjlkNmQwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/32c84349095145783fb4cd814bcb1ebe6d6b616e","sha":"32c84349095145783fb4cd814bcb1ebe6d6b616e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/32c84349095145783fb4cd814bcb1ebe6d6b616e"}],"sha":"d7c6a2191d39f2753cc4c6d42aea5865f9d6d093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/d7c6a2191d39f2753cc4c6d42aea5865f9d6d093"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/32c84349095145783fb4cd814bcb1ebe6d6b616e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:14:04Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:47:54Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"Add pre-pr-review skill\n\nThe review workflow before opening a PR: self-audit the change like an\nadversarial auditor (not the author) — hunt teardown/lifecycle races,\nstale/divergent state, every-raise-needs-a-clear, boundary inputs; verify\na finding reproduces before fixing it — then run a CodeRabbit CLI review,\nand only open the PR once both are clean plus tests/lint green.\n\nCovers the cr CLI mechanics that bite: reviews committed changes only\n(commit first), is rate-limited so always tee the output to a file\n(--agent for structured findings; no --plain flag — plain is the\ndefault), and ''cr review findings'' re-reads the last run without spending\na new one.\n\nname+description-only SKILL.md; adds marketplace.json entry and README\nsection.","tree":{"sha":"b8f0b69d9138faf77ca6dae4e60181a28f7a7567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/b8f0b69d9138faf77ca6dae4e60181a28f7a7567"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/32c84349095145783fb4cd814bcb1ebe6d6b616e","verification