r}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clarkbw","id":2134,"login":"clarkbw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/ec353af8a2424606702f2ec1c860683d3e8624f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T13:36:57Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T13:36:57Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"message":"signalk-registry: add Check 8 for companion plugins (requires/recommends)\n\nThe skill scored screenshots/changelog/audit/CI but never checked the App\nStore companion-plugin fields. A plugin can name a companion in its README\nprose yet omit signalk.recommends/requires, so the \"Works well with\" /\n\"Required plugins\" cards never render (this happened to signalk-dsc, which\ndescribed the Logbook plugin in its README but left recommends unset).\n\nCheck 8 reads both fields, cross-references the README for named SignalK\ncompanions, and verifies each entry is a real published npm name (e.g. the\nLogbook plugin is the scoped @meri-imperiumi/signalk-logbook).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"839f3fa3ccc2c7d25a8d0f2d7b2b3829797e292c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/839f3fa3ccc2c7d25a8d0f2d7b2b3829797e292c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/ec353af8a2424