pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/bfd2981ba48165f6352cfac44cf411115803e28a","node_id":"C_kwDOSyn3etoAKGJmZDI5ODFiYTQ4MTY1ZjYzNTJjZmFjNDRjZjQxMTExNTgwM2UyOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066","sha":"f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066"}],"sha":"bfd2981ba48165f6352cfac44cf411115803e28a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/bfd2981ba48165f6352cfac44cf411115803e28a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clarkbw","id":2134,"login":"clarkbw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T20:45:13Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T20:45:13Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"message":"feat(signalk-registry): check live score + plugin-CI pin\n\nThe skill previously only previewed the locally-evaluable criteria and\nassumed the rest, so it reported an ''expected 100'' while the published\nscore was 90 — it had no knowledge of the registry''s -10 plugin-CI\npenalty. Now it:\n\n- fetches the actual published registry JSON (composite, badges, harness\n  booleans, plugin_ci status) as the ground truth, first\n- adds the plugin-CI criterion (-10) to the rubric and a check that the\n  reusable workflow is present AND pinned to a current signalk-server\n  release SHA (flags @master or a stale pin)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a3037ba7f43d142e34f3c2e213464fc54f4c83b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/4a3037ba7f43d142e34f3c2e213464fc54f4c83b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clarkbw","id":2134,"login":"clarkbw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066","node_id":"C_kwDOSyn3etoAKGY5YjIzZThjOWIyNTA3YzlhZmNlMWJmYmExZWY1ZjMwNGY1OTMwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/e2305b1bc31f009a8d1929d7608dd619ae48af59","sha":"e2305b1bc31f009a8d1929d7608dd619ae48af59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/e2305b1bc31f009a8d1929d7608dd619ae48af59"}],"sha":"f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/f9b23e8c9b2507c9afce1bfba1ef5f304f593066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clarkbw","id":2134,"login":"clarkbw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commits/e2305b1bc31f009a8d1929d7608dd619ae48af59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:18:37Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:18:37Z","email":"clarkbw@gmail.com","name":"Bryan Clark"},"message":"fix(signalk-registry): audit runtime deps only, handle no-lockfile\n\nCheck 3 ran plain `npm audit`, which (1) counted dev-toolchain advisories\n(an esbuild/vitest critical dropped a clean plugin to 80, though it never\nships) and (2) failed with ENOLOCK on zero-dep plugins that have no\nlockfile. Now: create a lockfile if absent, then `npm audit --omit=dev`,\nmatching what the registry actually scores (the installed plugin).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88883e9e4b03ddc5ccff4e11546d2fe3a42b5a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/trees/88883e9e4b03ddc5ccff4e11546d2fe3a42b5a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/git/commits/e2305b1bc31f009a8d1929d7608dd619ae48af59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clarkbw","id":2134,"login":"clarkbw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkbw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sailingnaturali/claude-skills/commit/e2305b1bc31f0