ve with\nconfirm dialog then refresh. Approve is the only action (no bulk, no\nreject). 9 new component tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f50bde0bd42862ad575a2c34704f0a6bb689fe00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/f50bde0bd42862ad575a2c34704f0a6bb689fe00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/1445a0667239f7b031322d0c329d2586b170e4d9","verification":{"payload":"tree f50bde0bd42862ad575a2c34704f0a6bb689fe00\nparent 09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1783369124 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783369124 +0800\n\nfeat(#433): Incoming drafts surface (External Dreamer ED-2) (#19)\n\n* feat(#433): draft types + routes in the contract\n\nSkillDraft / ListDraftsResponse / ApproveDraftResponse schemas and the\nlistDrafts / approveDraft route entries (ED-2, review-gated intake).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(#433): BFF proxies for incoming drafts list + approve\n\nGET /drafts and POST /drafts/:versionId/approve proxy to the platform\nadmin API using the BFF''s existing credential config; both flow through\nthe authorize/audit/respondError machinery (fail-closed authz default).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(#433): Incoming drafts tab — list, provenance, approve\n\nPending drafts surface in the SkillStudio shell: skill/version/source/\nsubmitted_at + copyable provenance session ids, per-row Approve with\nconfirm dialog then refresh. Approve is the only action (no bulk, no\nreject). 9 new component tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEG