Dk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commit/09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054","sha":"09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054"}],"sha":"1445a0667239f7b031322d0c329d2586b170e4d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/1445a0667239f7b031322d0c329d2586b170e4d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T05:51:16Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T05:51:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: SDK 0.22.0 (apiKey catalog/tools) + drop eager catalog preload (#18)\n\nResolves the two on-load 500s on the skill page for off-box (apiKey) BFFs:\n\n- bump @baobox/sdk → ^0.22.0 across the monorepo. SDK 0.22.0 routes\n  catalog.list()/tools.list() through the apiKey-compatible request path; the\n  backend now exposes the tool list to a tenant apiKey (own + global). The BFF\n  re-publishes (0.8.0) so deployed tenants pick up the fix.\n- web: stop eagerly fetching the global model catalog on the skill page. The\n  integration-first picker provides per-integration models + paramProfiles, and\n  the bundled static catalog covers the fallback — one fewer request per page\n  and no more /models 500.\n- root: the `overrides[\"@baobox/sdk\"]` was still pinned to ^0.18.0, silently\n  capping the SDK across ALL workspaces regardless of each package''s range\n  (a clean install resolved 0.18.0, not 0.22.0). Bumped the override to\n  ^0.22.0; clean install now resolves a single 0.22.0 with no nested copies.\n\nVersions: contract 0.7.0, bff 0.8.0, web 0.7.0 (all @baobox/sdk ^0.22.0).\nClean-install parity verified (rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json && npm\ninstall → single sdk@0.22.0); contract 57 + bff 92 + web 58 tests, build +\ntypecheck + biome clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9452fb63983f8b02ace199988af0e44dc516e77c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/9452fb63983f8b02ace199988af0e44dc516e77c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/09b2d5f8423ccea638d065d7462d36cd6848a054","verification":{"payload":"tree 9452fb63983f8b02ace199988af0e44dc516e77c\nparent c683231915d7802c2e008f1ff9ceee0876cbac96\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1781934676 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781934676 +0800\n\nfix: SDK 0.22.0 (apiKey catalog/tools) + drop eager catalog preload (#18)\n\nResolves the two on-load 500s on the skill page for off-box (apiKey) BFFs:\n\n- bump @baobox/sdk → ^0.22.0 across the monorepo. SDK 0.22.0 routes\n  catalog.list()/tools.list() through the apiKey-compatible request path; the\n  backend now exposes the tool list to a tenant apiKey (own + global). The BFF\n  re-publishes (0.8.0) so deployed tenants pick up the fix.\n- web: stop eagerly fetching the global model catalog on the skill page. The\n  integration-first picker provides per-integration models + paramProfiles, and\n  the bundled static catalog covers the fallback — one fewer request per page\n  and no more /models 500.\n- root: the `overrides[\"@baobox/sdk\"]` was still pinned to ^0.18.0, silently\n  capping the SDK across ALL workspaces regardless of each package''s range\n  (a clean install resolved 0.18.0, not 0.22.0). Bumped the override to\n  ^0.22.0; clean install now resolves a single 0.22.0 with no nested copies.\n\nVersions: contract 0.7.0, bff 0.8.0, web 0.7.0 (all @baobox/sdk ^0.22.0).\nClean-install parity verified (rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json && npm\ninstall → single sdk@0.22.0); contract 57 + bff 92 + web 58 tests, build +\ntypecheck + biome clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNipUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV8YQAAilwlWgzvacZ3zmNI2ZKtz6\nHIst1D9HV7Rg5eJ5Ccypc3yE0MXHhH46h51ErlIiDTjds91Zz36guGoo175a3m4D\n1CTL2UlcS7TG3lGDXnjlECYpQAVRKaB94NjZrQ7fcOzN8x7qo6ospBBsTbXmOkBd\n3n4QEiXlyk6sGLroESrD5gDJkyWsaZ/9Dq3Lqi8UNsu6M46u7BIRckkqjkjyVDRy\nf5L1lCZhxtRSUwCmmK0VgR79y2IRXdiPqHUCENLc53RM2x+zqymg+50cNVEbJw+S\nyOXcP+zDKHBpXN86RWtua7B1wWKSCcdxzJEcvOa4m6MWwFD+vG+42brWVUcrpT/d\nxLd3NWKeidXjVso1/3E1z29M9wUPPhgoQ6RVl4B2d4oQYy9hSC+stWstpZa8/V8h\nQ4OZQAkqDIFFNfGVyDNXf5os2y7KJskyqiEXk3NLyAXmnOjB0MtP9m+StorHug6k\nbhn19VYC1IFUBH2ZFrrJSquYTWbes9v/+Yt6wcXHD3KgI48SMeLYB+W/2fSKjiML\nO6LwI0X1SAWGu13PdeHRAxoreL9o2XGSCIbhjbfGkPGXKcj005qTCmHCL+UT/P9a\nWfcKc9MPkeyGNqm59tmhvNw7P2P6S54hShM110ITgeQgSBjiCzW1a5lnjwfCw+dt\nOdVqn77oaWnZNUAzH89R\n=KVI1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T05:51:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_u