://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/c683231915d7802c2e008f1ff9ceee0876cbac96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T02:04:56Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T02:04:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(#330): integration-first model picker — tenant LLM integration → model → save (#17)\n\nAdds GET /llm-integrations and GET /llm-integrations/:id/models to the BFF and\ncontract, wires the integration-first picker in the Studio web component, and\nbumps all three packages to sdk ^0.21.0 (which adds client.llmIntegrations).\n\n- contract 0.5.0 → 0.6.0: new routes, llmIntegrationId/llmSource in structural\n  update schema, LlmIntegration + IntegrationModelsViewResponse re-exports,\n  compile-time SDK drift guards\n- bff 0.6.0 → 0.7.0: GET /llm-integrations + GET /llm-integrations/:id/models\n  handlers with authz/audit, 13 new tests (fail-closed, SDK error, audit)\n- web 0.5.0 → 0.6.0: IntegrationModelPicker component (integration select →\n  model select), graceful fallback to free-text catalog input when no\n  integrations configured, changedFields includes llmIntegrationId/llmSource,\n  8 new API tests, 6 new component integration tests (disabled-state guard,\n  pick→save, clear→tenant_default, providerListError soft note)\n- SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md: documents new routes, request/response shapes,\n  save payload, and landing note in What''s next\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24f4070671544a2a8b115779d0365b704df908af",