7f09682a2eeee43debdae62f717aba0759a"}],"sha":"c683231915d7802c2e008f1ff9ceee0876cbac96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/c683231915d7802c2e008f1ff9ceee0876cbac96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/eaf7d7f09682a2eeee43debdae62f717aba0759a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T16:32:38Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T16:32:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: gitignore local agent tooling (.claude/, .omc/) (#16)\n\n* feat(#328): per-role guard model config + fallback editor (PR-3)\n\nBrings Studio to parity with the portal''s \"Per-role models & fallback\" card.\n\n## Contract (0.4.0 → 0.5.0)\n- Re-exports ModelRole / SkillRoleModel / RoleModelChainEntry / SkillRoleModelsMap\n  from @baobox/sdk (single source of truth; no re-declarations).\n- Adds MODEL_ROLES const tuple + modelRoleSchema + putRoleModelsRequestSchema\n  (role ∈ MODEL_ROLES, chain max 4, .strict()).\n- Adds compile-time drift guard: MODEL_ROLES satisfies readonly ModelRole[].\n- Adds routes: GET /skills/:id/role-models (getRoleModels) +\n  PUT /skills/:id/role-models (putRoleModels) with encoded build() helpers.\n- Bumps @baobox/sdk dep to ^0.19.0.\n\n## BFF (0.5.0 → 0.6.0)\n- Adds getRoleModels to SkillStudioReadOp, putRoleModels to SkillStudioMutationOp.\n- GET /skills/:id/role-models: authz → client.skills.roleModels.get → audit.\n- PUT /skills/:id/role-models: authz → schema validate → client.skills.roleModels.put\n  → notifyMutation → audit. Validation errors use the stable validation_error code.\n- Bumps @baobox/sdk to ^0.19.0 and contract dep to ^0.5.0.\n\n## Web (0.4.0 → 0.5.0)\n- api.ts: getRoleModels() + putRoleModels() on SkillStudioApi + createApi().\n- packages/web/src/roleModels.tsx: new PerRoleModelPanel Preact component.\n  preflight_guard + postflight_guard: PRIMARY + optional BACKUP catalog selects.\n  main: BACKUP only (primary is the skill''s main model).\n  Each role saves independently via PUT { role, chain }. Catalog-driven selects\n  (no free-text; no integration picker — Studio scope decision).\n  Loading / empty / error states; inherits existing palette + ui helpers.\n- detail.tsx: mounts PerRoleModelPanel after ParametersPanel in EditableSkill,\n  passing the already-loaded live catalog.\n- Bumps contract dep to ^0.5.0.\n\n## Tests\n- Contract: +12 tests (MODEL_ROLES drift guard, route builders, schema validation).\n- BFF: +12 tests (GET/PUT round-trip, authz, fail-closed, audit, onMutation,\n  validation rejection, chain-length enforcement).\n- Web component stub: extended with getRoleModels/putRoleModels defaults.\n\n## CI gates\n- typecheck (3) clean, lint clean, build (3) clean, tests 181 passed / 0 failed,\n  npm publish --dry-run (3) passed. Clean install (rm -rf node_modules + npm i)\n  verified no stale-dep break.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: gitignore local agent tooling (.claude/, .omc/)\n\nNeither was tracked; add preventively so Claude Code / OMC local state never\nlands in this public repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"edd5cff3249e86c6456def71d2f2aa1addfc8004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/edd5cff3249e86c6456def71d2f2aa1addfc8004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/eaf7d7f09682a2eeee43debdae62f717aba0759a","verification":{"payload":"tree edd5cff3249e86c6456def71d2f2aa1addfc8004\nparent 957dcd68ddffa7ea827741d7fcd32a64227ccf4c\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1781886758 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781886758 +0800\n\nchore: gitignore local agent tooling (.claude/, .omc/) (#16)\n\n* feat(#328): per-role guard model config + fallback editor (PR-3)\n\nBrings Studio to parity with the portal''s \"Per-role models & fallback\" card.\n\n## Contract (0.4.0 → 0.5.0)\n- Re-exports ModelRole / SkillRoleModel / RoleModelChainEntry / SkillRoleModelsMap\n  from @baobox/sdk (single source of truth; no re-declarations).\n- Adds MODEL_ROLES const tuple + modelRoleSchema + putRoleModelsRequestSchema\n  (role ∈ MODEL_ROLES, chain max 4, .strict()).\n- Adds compile-time drift guard: MODEL_ROLES satisfies readonly ModelRole[].\n- Adds routes: GET /skills/:id/role-models (getRoleModels) +\n  PUT /skills/:id/role-models (putRoleModels) with encoded build() helpers.\n- Bumps @baobox/sdk dep to ^0.19.0.\n\n## BFF (0.5.0 → 0.6.0)\n- Adds getRoleModels to SkillStudioReadOp, putRoleModels to SkillStudioMutationOp.\n- GET /skills/:id/role-models: authz → client.skills.roleModels.get → audit.\n- PUT /skills/:id/role-models: authz → schema validate → client.skills.roleModels.put\n  → notifyMutation → audit. Validation errors use the stable validation_error code.\n- Bumps @baobox/sdk to ^0.19.0 and contract dep to ^0.5.0.\n\n## Web (0.4.0 