atalog entries;\n  contract dep tightened to ^0.2.1.\n\nbff (0.3.0) is unchanged by #11 and its `^0.2.0` contract range still accepts\n0.2.1, so it is not re-released here. build + typecheck + tests green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08535e29bde9530ee7502571b10bb6dab39caa6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/08535e29bde9530ee7502571b10bb6dab39caa6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/cc349855cbf78e520d983dff5cd1bd52f117eb0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 08535e29bde9530ee7502571b10bb6dab39caa6b\nparent 94a734053239bb26f51438ac31453dbd1e6fe8f5\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1781363981 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781363981 +0800\n\nrelease: skill-builder-contract 0.2.1 + skill-builder (web) 0.2.1 — model-aware reasoning effort (#11/#302) (#12)\n\n#11 widened the reasoning-effort set and made the web picker model-aware but\ndidn''t bump versions, so the published contract (0.2.0) / web (0.2.0) don''t\ncarry those changes. Bump both to 0.2.1 so they can be tagged + published:\n\n- contract 0.2.0 → 0.2.1: full OpenAI-SDK effort set in REASONING_EFFORT_VALUES\n  (none|minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh). Additive, drift guard intact.\n- web 0.2.0 → 0.2.1: model-aware effort picker + gpt-5.4/5.5 catalog entries;\n  contract dep tightened to ^0.2.1.\n\nbff (0.3.0) is unchanged by #11 and its `^0.2.0` contract range still accepts\n0.2.1, so it is not re-released here. build + typecheck + tests green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLXUNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3OkQAFeSU0nNph6n0xqlz8A4dA52\nhbU2+GOsZ90fyg6JIN4ok/Jdj7upbwg03/pkj/CwnFmmNkssB2oOEz7DwDmkS/t/\nggr38j6W9xmrDxaf8e933+tfoJ/6wq6XHXR/PIaxFy+yrclFgdWhE1k1UggwJ1qz\nuq0BbSpZGVIGNSIJTOTtTd0oPz1wlV/mU3naqDaEOl+b0TSDC0GdTmmIsXyed3a1\nhYE6DPX6UZS+9kQUqtXKZ2dyUxazzG9TaNKfL9BUmyv4e0