7eb0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/cc349855cbf78e520d983dff5cd1bd52f117eb0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/94a734053239bb26f51438ac31453dbd1e6fe8f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:06:27Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:06:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(302): catalog-fed model picker + family-aware param panel (#11)\n\n* feat(302): add reasoningEffort to contract — additive optional field\n\nAdd `ReasoningEffort = \"minimal\" | \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"` union, a\n`reasoningEffortSchema` Zod enum, and wire it into:\n- `skillDetailSchema` (optional field, non-breaking for SDK drift guards)\n- `skillUpdateRequestSchema` (optional, passes single-field refine)\n- `SkillDetail` type extended as `SkillWithFiles & { reasoningEffort? }`\n- `EditableSkillFields` drift guard updated with a comment explaining why\n  reasoningEffort lives in the contract not the SDK\n\nExtend contract.test.ts: +7 cases covering all four effort tiers,\ninvalid values, and skillDetailSchema with/without the field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(302): catalog-fed model picker + family-aware param panel in Skill Studio\n\nAdd a static model catalog (modelCatalog.ts) covering MiniMax (sampling),\nOpenAI gpt-5/o-series (reasoning), and Anthropic claude-* (sampling).\nEach model is tagged with a `family` (\"reasoning\" | \"sampling\") that drives\nthe parameter panel.\n\nSkillStudio.tsx:\n- Replace the free-text `model` display with a <ModelPicker> combobox\n  backed by a <datalist> so catalog models are suggested while arbitrary\n  strings remain valid (fallback free-text entry).\n- Add <ModelParamPanel>: shows `reasoningEffort` selector and hides\n  temperature/maxTokens for reasoning models; shows temperature+maxTokens\n  and hides reasoningEffort for sampling/unknown models.\n- Per-field \"Save X\" buttons appear only when the draft value differs from\n  the loaded detail (single-field Phase 1 contract).\n\nAdd 7 new component tests covering: model input rendering, sampling panel\nvisibility, reasoning panel visibility (gpt-5), free-text fallback to\nsampling params, and catalog shape assertions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(#302): widen reasoning-effort values + model-aware effort selector\n\n- Contract: expand REASONING_EFFORT_VALUES to full OpenAI set\n  [\"none\",\"minimal\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\",\"xhigh\"]; ReasoningEffort and\n  reasoningEffortSchema derived automatically — stays additive, drift\n  guard intact.\n\n- Catalog: add gpt-5.4 and gpt-5.5 (reasoning family); add per-model\n  reasoningEfforts field: gpt-5/mini/nano get [\"minimal\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\"],\n  gpt-5.4/gpt-5.5 get [\"none\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\",\"xhigh\"]; o-series\n  inherits the gpt-5 set. Add getReasoningEfforts(modelId) helper that\n  returns the model-specific set, undefined for sampling models, and the\n  full 6-value set for unknown free-text models.\n\n- Editor: ModelParamPanel now accepts model prop and drives the effort\n  <select> options via getReasoningEfforts() instead of a hardcoded list.\n\n- Tests: update contract test for 6-tier array; add component tests\n  asserting gpt-5 offers minimal but not xhigh/none, gpt-5.5 offers\n  xhigh/none but not minimal, sampling returns undefined, free-text\n  returns full set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6e281caaba3bd22a779ebf58394bdbdd9c6f6b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/b6e281caaba3bd22a779ebf58394bdbdd9c6f6b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/94a734053239bb26f51438ac31453dbd1e6fe8f5","verification":{"payload":"tree b6e281caaba3bd22a779ebf58394bdbdd9c6f6b9\nparent 2a6989bc6163f6924e88ae765003b536ebdb5e5e\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1781363187 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781363187 +0800\n\nfeat(302): catalog-fed model picker + family-aware param panel (#11)\n\n* feat(302): add reasoningEffort to contract — additive optional field\n\nAdd `ReasoningEffort = \"minimal\" | \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"` union, a\n`reasoningEffortSchema` Zod enum, and wire it into:\n- `skillDetailSchema` (optional field, non-breaking for SDK drift guards)\n- `skillUpdateRequestSchema` (optional, passes single-field refine)\n- `SkillDetail` type extended as `SkillWithFiles & { reasoningEffort? }`\n- `EditableSkillFields` drift guard updated with a comment explaining why\n  reasoningEffort lives in the contract not the SDK\n\nExtend contract.test.ts: +7 cases covering all four effort tiers,\ninvalid values, and skillDetailSchema with/without the field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(302): catalog-fed model picker + family-aware param panel in Skill Studio\n\nAdd a static model catalog (modelCatalog.ts) covering MiniMax (sampling),\nOpenAI gpt-5/o-series (reasoning), and Anthropic claude-* (sampling).\nEach model is tagged with a `family` (\"reasoning\" | \"sampling\") that drives\nthe parameter panel.\n\nSkillStudio.tsx:\n- Replace the free-text `model` display with a <ModelPicker> combobox\n  backed by a <datalist> so catalog models are suggested while arbitrary\n  strings remain valid (fallback free-text entry).\n- Add <ModelParamPanel>: shows `reasoningEffort` selector and hides\n  temperature/maxTokens for reasoning models; shows temperature+maxTokens\n  and hides reasoningEffort for sampling/unknown models.\n- Per-field \"Save X\" buttons appear only when the draft value differs from\n  the loaded detail (single-field Phase 1 contract).\n\nAdd 7 new component tests covering: model input rendering, sampling panel\nvisibility, reasoning panel visibility (gpt-5), free-text fallback to\nsampling params, and catalog shape assertions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(#302): widen reasoning-effort values + model-aware effort selector\n\n- Contract: expand REASONING_EFFORT_VALUES to full OpenAI set\n  [\"none\",\"minimal\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\",\"xhigh\"]; ReasoningEffort and\n  reasoningEffortSchema derived automatically — stays additive, drift\n  guard intact.\n\n- Catalog: add gpt-5.4 and gpt-5.5 (reasoning family); add per-model\n  reasoningEfforts field: gpt-5/mini/nano get [\"minimal\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\"],\n  gpt-5.4/gpt-5.5 get [\"none\",\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\",\"xhigh\"]; o-series\n  inherits the gpt-5 set. Add getReasoningEfforts(modelId) helper that\n  returns the model-specific set, undefined for sampling models, and the\n  full 6-value set for unknown free-text models.\n\n- Editor: ModelParamPanel now accepts model prop and drives the effort\n  <select> options via getReasoningEfforts() instead of a hardcoded list.\n\n- Tests: update contract test for 6-tier array; add component tests\n  asserting gpt-5 offers minimal but not xhigh/none, gpt-5.5 offers\n  xhigh/none but not minimal, sampling returns undefined, free-text\n  returns full set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLXHzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7oYQAA74u78vA3oo6AqxdgyneX4g\nbVbewy+ykhVZJVh1+BWGlnatLHkMEinZ+1Zvv8tchuXmKcnSXcTnRP9TQSDrGog1\njpbqD/ig9X1QxQrzL8l7wOtXJZcQNITTYOi+Gf2+lPvKb+kzPGgtVL4XYav1Q9tY\nJAysWjR69wKSck+znBuIJteOSVlBVNfOnyGrdssE5QYNXEni6U6FC/VmcaPp4Mxx\n67R1gjjT7PyiRxzU1NqR0/BaMoCoPrKlvcJghzOJVQVSxHFoWfagrZKxMnDbQNma\nxYzIu874uxn5swfGemha8tcSDG8C9Op0GXtUiRjneVrbWWOtLoJmfLdNbJAGbjfV\nxhMV7rhmQ5xj39pu9nL93xxMSq4xXx2dkfCdg0pEDl96R5CEgx0D0tomgQRcuPI2\nZk9zBOdAOxVBcQxYZcJtX1p5UVeZZbAKLuJXZbl0qxA+ND84hY4PxlvNyawpyCiJ\ngwkUtB4AGTGatAbrt0MFMRjJFlh2SAIiYei4Hx9XLGZkJ9/vWk9ARle9e9GFeCEP\nY4gY5txvYuIN3ZI/OGx7hj7XtCG6wnQGLsHNhJ0SjUIqpL7cnsNgln5L9t80wOkF\nsQXyuMxlIpt7h4z9uXn4U/nNW/ITW1uTBsrYuuq8B4pGu6zvgdvaphHnzXUdEsup\nCcqbaiabbMbsAQlDjLU9\n=l1iE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-13T15:06:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"htt