ail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T09:39:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(261): Phase-2 authoring in SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md (#10)\n\nDocument the full Phase-2 surface in the tenant integration guide:\n\n- All new BFF endpoints with request/response JSON (POST create → 201,\n  PUT structural, attached-skills GET/POST/DELETE, tools GET/POST/DELETE,\n  parameters GET/PUT) + the stable contract error envelope and code table\n  (validation_error, cycle_detected, tool_not_allowed, forbidden,\n  not_found, conflict, upstream_error, internal_error).\n- The per-tenant apiKey grant model (#257): three permission namespaces —\n  skill-id allowlist, ns:verb action grants (skills:read/write/create/\n  attach/tools), and the tool:<id> allowlist — enforced server-side; the\n  tool allowlist has no enumeration endpoint (attach-by-id only).\n- The onMutation git-truth hook (post-commit, best-effort, default no-op;\n  before/after semantics).\n- Per-tenant parameters host store incl. the \"empty secret value = keep\"\n  convention the store MUST honor, with a reference set() implementation.\n- Web theming via --bb-* CSS custom properties + theme=\"dark\".\n- Version compatibility set: sdk 0.16 / contract 0.2 / bff 0.3 / web 0.2.\n- Replaced the Phase-1 \"out of scope\" notes with a Phase-2 E2E checklist\n  and a \"What''s next\" pointer (NexionOps #255, UAT #262).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0639a039aaa55c273c630c08e025b808cd7930a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/d0639a039aaa55c273c630c08e025b808cd7930a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/2a6989bc6163f6924e88ae765003b536ebdb5e5e","verification":{"payload":"tree d0639a039aaa55c273c630c08e025b808cd7930a\nparent ce7f939cf7bf6a15ea782e284f551465ec6e1b5f\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1780825140 +0800\ncom