80?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/ce7f939cf7bf6a15ea782e284f551465ec6e1b5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:24:45Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:24:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(260): full orchestrator authoring Web Component + #264 read-only/clone — web 0.2.0 (#9)\n\n* feat(260): full orchestrator authoring Web Component + #264 read-only/clone — web 0.2.0\n\nPhase-2 authoring UI for <baobox-skill-builder>, all via api-base (the BFF) only\n— still same-origin, never calls BaoBox, never imports @baobox/sdk, holds no\ncredential.\n\n- api.ts: full Phase-2 client (createSkill, updateSkillStructural, list/attach/\n  detach sub-skills, list/attach/detach tools, get/set parameters) built from the\n  contract route descriptors.\n- Create-skill wizard → navigates to the new skill''s detail.\n- Structural editor (name/description/systemPrompt/model/temperature/maxTokens),\n  sends only changed fields via PUT.\n- Sub-skill DAG view with attach/detach + cycle-rejection UX (contract\n  cycle_detected → \"would create a cycle\").\n- Tool attach/detach (lean {id,name,description}); off-allowlist attach rejected\n  server-side (tool_not_allowed) and surfaced.\n- Per-tenant parameters editor; secret values arrive masked and are write-only.\n- BaoBox#264 Defect B: a system skill (isSystem) renders READ-ONLY with no edit\n  form; when cloneable, \"Copy as my own\" creates a tenant-owned copy and opens it.\n  isSystem/cloneable ride through as additive runtime wire fields (SDK/BFF pass\n  unknown response fields through) — no contract release required.\n- Theming depth: colors are CSS custom properties (--bb-*) on :host (+ dark\n  override), injected into the shadow root; a host brands it from its own CSS.\n- Dev harness mock extended to the full Phase-2 surface (+ a system skill).\n- Bumped contract dep ^0.2.0; web → 0.2.0.\n\nTests: 26 (api client URL/method/body for every Phase-2 method + cycle code;\ncomponent: list, structural save of changed fields, create-wizard flow, system\nread-only + clone + non-cloneable, cycle UX, tool allowlist UX, parameters).\n\nNote: the contract has no allowlist-enumeration endpoint, so the tool picker is\nattach-by-id with server-enforced allowlist + rejection UX; a future\n\"list attachable tools\" contract endpoint could pre-populate it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(260): secret-keep convention + numeric validation (Codex review)\n\n- MEDIUM: a masked secret loaded from the BFF (blank value) is no longer\n  re-sent as a destructive blank. A `secret:true` row with an empty value is the\n  documented \"keep current value\" signal; the loaded-secret flag is local-only\n  (stripped from the PUT). Typing replaces the secret; removing the row deletes\n  it. Dev mock honors the keep signal.\n- LOW: structural editor validates numeric fields (temperature 0–2, positive\n  integer max-tokens), shows an inline error, and blocks save on invalid input.\n- LOW: parameter tests now assert the EXACT PUT payload (keep-secret blank,\n  replace-on-type) + a temperature-out-of-range save-block test.\n\n28 web tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5b6bf3049d2b870ed6f8c0191f6aa2b7985d6c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/c5b6bf3049d2b870ed6f8c0191f6aa2b7985d6c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/ce7f939cf7bf6a15ea782e284f551465ec6e1b5f","verification":{"payload":"tree c5b6bf3049d2b870ed6f8c0191f6aa2b7985d6c0\nparent 023fb4576ce024396fd0a490135fd20d8ad4f85d\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1780820685 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780820685 +0800\n\nfeat(260): full orchestrator authoring Web Component + #264 read-only/clone — web 0.2.0 (#9)\n\n* feat(260): full orchestrator authoring Web Component + #264 read-only/clone — web 0.2.0\n\nPhase-2 authoring UI for <baobox-skill-builder>, all via api-base (the BFF) only\n— still same-origin, never calls BaoBox, never imports @baobox/sdk, holds no\ncredential.\n\n- api.ts: full Phase-2 client (createSkill, updateSkillStructural, list/attach/\n  detach sub-skills, list/attach/detach tools, get/set parameters) built from the\n  contract route descriptors.\n- Create-skill wizard → navigates to the new skill''s detail.\n- Structural editor (name/description/systemPrompt/model/temperature/maxTokens),\n  sends only changed fields via PUT.\n- Sub-skill DAG view with attach/detach + cycle-rejection UX (contract\n  cycle_detected → \"would create a cycle\").\n- Tool attach/detach (lean {id,name,description}); off-allowlist attach rejected\n  server-side (tool_not_allowed) and surfaced.\n- Per-tenant parameters editor; secret values arrive masked and are write-only.\n- BaoBox#264 Defect B: a system skill (isSystem) renders READ-ONLY with no edit\n  form; when cloneable, \"Copy as my own\" creates a tenant-owned copy and opens it.\n  isSystem/cloneable ride through as additive runtime wire fields (SDK/BFF pass\n  unknown response fields through) — no contract release required.\n- Theming depth: colors are CSS custom properties (--bb-*) on :host (+ dark\n  override), injected into the shadow root; a host brands it from its own CSS.\n- Dev harness mock extended to the full Phase-2 surface (+ a system skill).\n- Bumped contract dep ^0.2.0; web → 0.2.0.\n\nTests: 26 (api client URL/method/body for every Phase-2 method + cycle code;\ncomponent: list, structural save of changed fields, create-wizard flow, system\nread-only + clone + non-cloneable, cycle UX, tool allowlist UX, parameters).\n\nNote: the contract has no allowlist-enumeration endpoint, so the tool picker is\nattach-by-id with server-enforced allowlist + rejection UX; a future\n\"list attachable tools\" contract endpoint could pre-populate it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(260): secret-keep convention + numeric validation (Codex review)\n\n- MEDIUM: a masked secret loaded from the BFF (blank value) is no longer\n  re-sent as a destructive blank. A `secret:true` row with an empty value is the\n  documented \"keep current value\" signal; the loaded-secret flag is local-only\n  (stripped from the PUT). Typing replaces the secret; removing the row deletes\n  it. Dev mock honors the keep signal.\n- LOW: structural editor validates numeric fields (temperature 0–2, positive\n  integer max-tokens), shows an inline error, and blocks save on invalid input.\n- LOW: parameter tests now assert the EXACT PUT payload (keep-secret blank,\n  replace-on-type) + a temperature-out-of-range save-block test.\n\n28 web tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"--