com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/f94e8d4cda3e0dd49667d94af198dfef3b4c1092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:45:01Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:45:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(254): per-tenant apiKey credential for the BFF (AC1) — bff 0.2.0 (#6)\n\n#254 AC1 — the Skill Studio BFF can now authenticate to BaoBox with a per-tenant\n`apiKey` (recommended) instead of the cross-tenant `adminSecret`, so a breached\nBFF can never reach another tenant''s skills.\n\n- `SkillStudioBffConfig.apiKey?` added; `adminSecret?` is now optional. Provide\n  EXACTLY ONE (construction throws otherwise; injected test `client` exempt).\n  Whitespace-only values count as absent.\n- redact() backstop now scrubs BOTH credentials from every outgoing error string.\n- `@baobox/sdk` bumped to ^0.15.0 (apiKey auth on skills.list/get/update).\n- tenant scoping (#247), fail-closed authz (#254 AC2), and the contract surface\n  are unchanged.\n- README + CHANGELOG + SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md updated to recommend the\n  per-tenant apiKey; version 0.1.0 → 0.2.0.\n\nTests: +6 (26 total) — apiKey accepted; both/neither/whitespace rejected;\nadminSecret-only back-compat; apiKey redacted from errors. typecheck + build +\ntests green. Codex-reviewed (whitespace edge fixed).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44646ffebd9d8fba716e942667920904073d0884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/44646ffebd9d8fba716e942667920904073d0884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/f94e8d4cda3e0dd49667d94af198dfef3b4c1092","verification":{"payload":"tree 44646ffebd9d8fba716e942667920904073d0884\nparent 42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1780749901 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780749901 +0800\n\nfeat(254): per-tenant apiKey credential for the BFF (AC1) — bff 0.2.0 (#6)\n\n#254 AC1 — the Skill Studio BFF can now authenticate to BaoBox with a per-tenant\n`apiKey` (recommended) instead of the cross-tenant `adminSecret`, so a breached\nBFF can never reach another tenant''s skills.\n\n- `SkillStudioBffConfig.apiKey?` added; `adminSecret?` is now optional. Provide\n  EXACTLY ONE (construction throws otherwise; injected test `client` exempt).\n  Whitespace-only values count as absent.\n- redact() backstop now scrubs BOTH credentials from every outgoing error string.\n- `@baobox/sdk` bumped to ^0.15.0 (apiKey auth on skills.list/get/update).\n- tenant scoping (#247), fail-closed authz (#254 AC2), and the contract surface\n  are unchanged.\n- README + CHANGELOG + SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md updated to recommend the\n  per-tenant apiKey; version 0.1.0 → 0.2.0.\n\nTests: +6 (26 total) — apiKey accepted; both/neither/whitespace rejected;\nadminSecret-only back-compat; apiKey redacted from errors. typecheck + build +\ntests green. Codex-reviewed (whitespace edge fixed).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJBZNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH9kQAKDCfXnqidG1IzoTkKabvMH4\nZO9INXzghGOKTZvTqWjTR2rXqC2wLkVa7ny/mX2sbDfk9IbVNd10wPxzTX7O/84P\nay2WVIdnaTdv6DSb94boG+V8rGu13+YZPocbwB/Ow4VHmovJe3t38aSE7AI1uboV\nRcDSaRfOkAwpJUC+YoHLtpalDiUb7wHMDEjS0TZJ9bmLMz0FcN1x8oq0kIjInEx6\nqK7yqDOWw3uAGuNqH2lJaNxwuVy9R69EMTnzvVhOkOKessGMvIkuTEFsq10Cz9dT\niHTTHPRjCbGTlvAUdYbkj4Wq/WHT0cVO4fwuJG4+xMXAPyZ1jBrBOkApLHNwhAJK\nTlLdyOd9R/MBzkGAE0YCivvMB/rQkcg0h5wDqG6keYoVkqyzVmEHQJTiR90ixD46\nn448htV/DJvI0iWqjiB3u46OKThkCChBOy92WKFbHSz+IWZclpXUefyrg/ryZazw\nBic7GrbKK8Omns7lzaxNmZCwjqLGgc1epLUn3ywk1+UG4K5CBmL6q6yP5Ipk8Wm0\nax4c9LyhYNH6U/I8TpNDS1Doc0UdbiDYyfHf2ZrD1e9hTqALFJrm+jO5MuSZ1sI1\nwSrrieYCkwMfU7ucNwDuS016sheep5nPYtqBVYJx8KIdXLZ1fjzd9r/4uc/JDqoK\nG0Zl2inig1RiEXms00dc\n=sd7H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-06T12:45:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commit/f94e8d4cda3e0dd49667d94af198dfef3b4c1092","node_id":"C_kwDOSypr6NoAKGY5NGU4ZDRjZGEzZTBkZDQ5NjY3ZDk0YWYxOThkZmVmM2I0YzEwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commit/42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69","sha":"42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69"}],"sha":"f94e8d4cda3e0dd49667d94af198dfef3b4c1092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/f94e8d4cda3e0dd49667d94af198dfef3b4c1092"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T10:02:36Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T10:02:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(254): fail-closed BFF authz default + supply-chain hardening docs (#5)\n\nAddresses the actionable items of the #254 pre-prod security gate:\n\n- AC2 — fail-closed BFF. @baobox/skill-builder-bff previously defaulted\n  fail-OPEN (`if (!hooks.authz) return;`). Now: with no authz hook every request\n  is DENIED (403) and a warning is logged at mount; opting out requires an\n  explicit `allowUnauthenticated: true`. A forgotten hook can never silently\n  expose skill read/write. +4 tests (deny on list/get/update + no SDK call;\n  explicit opt-out; provided authz still governs).\n- AC3 — supply-chain guidance in SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md: pin exact bundle\n  version, Subresource Integrity, CSP script-src/connect-src allowlist, npm\n  --provenance, and the per-tenant-credential production gate.\n- Clarified the credentials model in the guide: the element uses\n  `credentials: \"same-origin\"` so the tenant session reaches a same-origin BFF\n  for authz, never cross-origin, never BaoBox (the browser holds no BaoBox\n  credentials). (The web component change itself lands in #249.)\n\nAC1 (per-tenant credential to replace the cross-tenant adminSecret) needs a new\nworker capability — documented as a gate, not implemented here. AC4 (secret\nscanning + push protection) enabled on the repo separately.\n\nRefs #254.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"a3e0de2e2626f8994a6e81988c99fa2cda630587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/a3e0de2e2626f8994a6e81988c99fa2cda630587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/42a912e59fb3f7410872d13ed2ff8271f996fe69","verification":{"payload":"tree a3e0de2e2626f8994a6e81988c99fa2cda630587\nparent cca5c9bfcecd3aafe13d6691dbc26d09a1ab0945\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1780740156 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780740156 +0800\n\nfeat(254): fail-closed BFF authz default + supply-chain hardening docs (#5)\n\nAddresses the actionable items of the #254 pre-prod security gate:\n\n- AC2 — fail-closed BFF. @baobox/skill-builder-bff previously defaulted\n  fail-OPEN (`if (!hooks.authz) return;`). Now: with no authz hook every request\n  is DENIED (403) and a warning is logged at mount; opting out requires an\n  explicit `allowUnauthenticated: true`. A forgotten hook can never silently\n  expose skill read/write. +4 tests (deny on list/get/update + no SDK call;\n  explicit opt-out; provided authz still governs).\n- AC3 — supply-chain guidance in SKILL_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md: pin exact bundle\n  version, Subresource Integrity, CSP script-src/connect-src allowlist, npm\n  --provenance, and the per-tenant-credential production gate.\n- Clarified the credentials model in the guide: the element uses\n  `credentials: \"same-origin\"` so the tenant session reaches a same-origin BFF\n  for authz, never cross-origin, never BaoBox (the browser holds no BaoBox\n  credentials). (The web component change itself lands in #249.)\n\nAC1 (per-tenant credential to replace the cross-tenant adminSecret) needs a new\nworker capability — documented as a gate, not implemented here. AC4 (secret\nscanning + push protection) enabled on the repo separately.\n\nRefs #254.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqI/A8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqtsQAIcAfD0rzIROR/ZLOpzy37pk\n3C3Gyf5vBiig1AjQJSP2gNEi8HH6UTeRPJ4yeFGY4hhHWzm/GbL3hq54AlgR+1FI\n5L/Jt2VnChbs7hUOOfn/9ACBXIbmRxH9Q52mUHGH3/IQH7A4C4sQFQisOB8rxJ2a\nsPLVbVLbQZlCBSNVir4VLZkSRnpUor2ERWxdL1Z40bwNPJY6HQqpvLu19QF54mWX\nS85uGPCrIfi3lMiJBOYZFPZf9DKKUdhHzu67GmSPfBE1MeOWYDSv6drmYlaDfCm0\nrhE0Lzso2hNdU3oxGe/Xq5YAlIE4O1UXNivMfOg8JOWf3/q7ShHVhbMIsFfIe/Nl\nJ/ngNUCvk9Eoeh8lXpQdeEz8NGv9MBcioIS99iwFd5ahPuA9+ptzhMM7fEmyc5aD\nrrIIfNCoI/gkehUN/DEfrUUkX2hbvFwWdoNSSekARFVckRVSNqxMpGII4IUoP7hd\nfEEHincB02TUZQrG9xcNUNAXULhLq0HEERxxl3INbqTAgTXlqXHbQSoMOfFGpRCj\nEzltb4mCzsGM74U4k7T1ghbahM5rLDHWa+aTvsSRJh0awpLEfuilckOQ+gQ+CiJF\ntZgIDiMwhoCaxwKyUArTZ/qG7ks2fSQcA1L4wh3Bz5G4s21Iv6GjJP10SEAgv7MA\nfidcKYq/8X9GVysPWDXo\n=yYei\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026