ttps://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/cca5c9bfcecd3aafe13d6691dbc26d09a1ab0945/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T10:01:59Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"BrightQi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T10:01:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(249): @baobox/skill-builder — <baobox-skill-builder> web component (#3)\n\n* feat(249): @baobox/skill-builder — <baobox-skill-builder> web component\n\nThe Phase-1 embeddable MFE for the Skill Studio (Epic baobox#244, ν1.4). A\nframework-agnostic custom element (Preact, shadow DOM) rendering the\nlist + detail + edit-one-field slice, reading ALL data from a configurable\n`api-base` (the tenant BFF) via @baobox/skill-builder-contract.\n\nHard rules honoured:\n- Never imports @baobox/sdk; never talks to BaoBox directly.\n- No cookie/session: the API client sends `credentials: \"omit\"` (not merely\n  \"don''t include\"), and refuses an empty api-base rather than falling back to\n  the embedding origin.\n\nIncludes:\n- `<baobox-skill-builder api-base theme>` custom element (idempotent register,\n  shadow-DOM render/teardown, re-render on attribute change).\n- createApi(apiBase): configurable-base, contract-typed, cookie-less client.\n- A prebuilt standalone Vite lib bundle (Preact inlined, self-registering) at\n  dist/standalone/baobox-skill-builder.js for <script type=module>.\n- Thin typed React wrapper @baobox/skill-builder/react → <SkillBuilder/>.\n- Dev harness (npm run dev) mounting the element against an in-memory mock BFF.\n- 12 tests (api: URL/method/body, credentials:omit, empty-base guard, error\n  mapping; component: list render, open detail, single-field save, error+retry,\n  empty-base config error with no fetch; element registration).\n\nAdds publish-web.yml (web-v* → npm) and the contract-first build order (shared\nwith #248; identical change merges cleanly).\n\nCodex-reviewed: credentials:omit, empty-base rejection, list stale-guard, and\nthe React className fix all addressed and re-confirmed.\n\nCloses #249.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n* fix(249,254): use credentials:\"same-origin\" so the BFF can authorize\n\ncredentials:\"omit\" sent NO session to the BFF, leaving the fail-closed authz\nhook (#254) with nothing to authorize against in the recommended same-origin\nsetup. Switch to \"same-origin\": the host''s tenant session reaches a same-origin\nBFF for authz, but the browser still never sends cookies cross-origin and never\ncalls BaoBox. Cross-origin BFF deployments use a non-cookie auth path.\n\nUpdates the api-client comment, README, and the test assertion\n(credentials === \"same-origin\").\n\nRefs #254.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94d3ed8a60c2010e54f950af7a20165cef57797a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/94d3ed8a60c2010e54f950af7a20165cef57797a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/cca5c9bfcecd3aafe13d6691dbc26d09a1ab0945","verification":{"payload":"tree 94d3ed8a60c2010e54f950af7a20165cef57797a\nparent 87cb0887e71229006b3aa16acdeb15a63f59a26a\nauthor BrightQi <brightq@gmail.com> 1780740119 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780740119 +0800\n\nfeat(249): @baobox/skill-builder — <baobox-skill-builder> web component (#3)\n\n* feat(249): @baobox/skill-builder — <baobox-skill-builder> web component\n\nThe Phase-1 embeddable MFE for the Skill Studio (Epic baobox#244, ν1.4). A\nframework-agnostic custom element (Preact, shadow DOM) rendering the\nlist + detail + edit-one-field slice, reading ALL data from a configurable\n`api-base` (the tenant BFF) via @baobox/skill-builder-contract.\n\nHard rules honoured:\n- Never imports @baobox/sdk; never talks to BaoBox directly.\n- No cookie/session: the API client sends `credentials: \"omit\"` (not merely\n  \"don''t include\"), and refuses an empty api-base rather than falling back to\n  the embedding origin.\n\nIncludes:\n- `<baobox-skill-builder api-base theme>` custom element (idempotent register,\n  shadow-DOM render/teardown, re-render on attribute change).\n- createApi(apiBase): configurable-base, contract-typed, cookie-less client.\n- A prebuilt standalone Vite lib bundle (Preact inlined, self-registering) at\n  dist/standalone/baobox-skill-builder.js for <script type=module>.\n- Thin typed React wrapper @baobox/skill-builder/react → <SkillBuilder/>.\n- Dev harness (npm run dev) mounting the element against an in-memory mock BFF.\n- 12 tests (api: URL/method/body, credentials:omit, empty-base guard, error\n  mapping; component: list render, open detail, single-field save, error+retry,\n  empty-base config error with no fetch; element registration).\n\nAdds publish-web.yml (web-v* → npm) and the contract-first build order (shared\nwith #248; identical change merges cleanly).\n\nCodex-reviewed: credentials:omit, empty-base rejection, list stale-guard, and\nthe React className fix all addressed and re-confirmed.\n\nCloses #249.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n* fix(249,254): use credentials:\"same-origin\" so the BFF can authorize\n\ncredentials:\"omit\" sent NO session to the BFF, leaving the fail-closed authz\nhook (#254) with nothing to authorize against in the recommended same-origin\nsetup. Switch to \"same-origin\": the host''s tenant session reaches a same-origin\nBFF for authz, but the browser still never sends cookies cross-origin and never\ncalls BaoBox. Cross-origin BFF deployments use a non-cookie auth path.\n\nUpdates the api-client comment, README, and the test assertion\n(credentials === \"same-origin\").\n\nRefs #254.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqI/AXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQS0QAAeCttDWPZx/D15Xc/dg7jWq\nRlYjgq80hH2psdREHsU7TaUx1l0SmwHjFXSWM9ZP/ASE3nxV4P8ZbK+8rz/Kh9/g\n/eBjloSQdvQS7cflr/c9fLWrky7CRPDcJwuGSKiFifGMFib7LarJ/9z4h6uCeKlo\nA5PzzVt+3Jco4wr+se+p+OGpy+IAWMGf3Dd2+aXeDlyosKOE0L+aZFogaSyZWkZc\npt9Fc6X0gyZSPluWJF0YiN/ONmm71X9b74XaW4HrJw5L72Gkoxp4ArRyx2QBCYbo\n6znyHE+kya0lV9U90dWbeTyZ5BQJtYx2KPG6x8HjWoDGYs90lTiEEKRWGr69Gn9l\nUQacirSLrvRDpMB3DXK0EbsGdmUAipzT/E+YtiJBZ4unaKViJ+JZe4czTWGSedV4\nQAtZgEMAOOOLkqNAnBev5LZSEFplFTjLWZsZuDsoq0nhACj2K7ke+J/3APdO8Tfc\nbnXWYseUqy5bJJRrkS385QuBDjkbPau4Wq+PmxrkFHDCdtPZRlObgFNvGJZcIJrN\ngClC5FRi3AqLtvrejAInytFC+/PrenvefDYOSk0fdMg9ZEHpE5KE5hOZYnj6dhFJ\nAWnXXRhdkadnCE9Q2g3Udmxtelv2S0xpMvNL+6TAI4clqk0jcfaZ2KPK4QJi/efS\n3GShLvC/6AJCzMkAdDQS\n=h2xM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-06T10:01:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com