"}],"sha":"b21327f85b5f18e45313b43fe160a491378bf92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/b21327f85b5f18e45313b43fe160a491378bf92c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/6459c0ba28d99e08469e169e2f9dd854237f8ad5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:12:20Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:14:28Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"message":"fix(ci): build the contract before dependents (clean-checkout order)\n\nThe BFF resolves @baobox/skill-builder-contract''s types from its emitted dist,\nso on a clean checkout the contract must be built first. Fixes:\n- root `build` builds @baobox/skill-builder-contract first, then all workspaces\n  (order-independent of the glob, so adding more packages needs no change here).\n- CI runs `build` before `typecheck`/`test`; publish-bff builds all workspaces\n  before the bff steps.\n\nReproduced the clean-checkout failure locally (rm dist → bff built first → TS2307)\nand confirmed the ordered build now passes typecheck + 13+16 tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df9bd149be75010cb3dbb2d54df644427b855bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/df9bd149be75010cb3dbb2d54df644427b855bfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/6459c0ba28d99e08469e169e2f9dd854237f8ad5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commit/6459c0ba28d99e08469e169e2f9dd854237f8ad5","node_id":"C_kwDOSypr6NoAKDY0NTljMGJhMjhkOTllMDg0NjllMTY5ZTJmOWRkODU0MjM3ZjhhZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commit/deb941c10732c9c61d730747661493dc3a4a1f0f","sha":"deb941c10732c9c61d730747661493dc3a4a1f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/deb941c10732c9c61d730747661493dc3a4a1f0f"}],"sha":"6459c0ba28d99e08469e169e2f9dd854237f8ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/6459c0ba28d99e08469e169e2f9dd854237f8ad5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/deb941c10732c9c61d730747661493dc3a4a1f0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:08:49Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:08:49Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"message":"feat(248): @baobox/skill-builder-bff — mountable Hono BFF router\n\nThe Phase-1 Backend-for-Frontend for the Skill Studio (Epic baobox#244, ν1.3).\nThe tenant''s backend mounts this Hono router; the embedded web component (#249)\ncalls it (never BaoBox). It is the only thing that calls BaoBox — through\n@baobox/sdk (adminSecret), server-side, scoped to one tenant.\n\n- createSkillBuilderBff({ endpoint, adminSecret, tenantId, hooks }) → mountable\n  Hono router implementing the @baobox/skill-builder-contract Phase-1 surface\n  (GET /skills, GET /skills/:id, PATCH /skills/:id).\n- Calls @baobox/sdk skills.list/get/update scoped to tenantId (#247); PATCH\n  validates the single-field body via the contract schema, then re-fetches the\n  detail (SDK update returns no files).\n- Hooks with no-op defaults: authz (deny via false OR throw → 403, before any\n  BaoBox call), audit (best-effort; never fails the request; \"denied\" only for\n  local authz rejection), sourceOfTruth (optional list/detail overrides).\n- adminSecret never appears in any response/error: status/code mapping, raw\n  upstream body dropped, and the secret value redacted from message/code/\n  requestId as a backstop.\n- 16 unit tests with a stubbed @baobox/sdk: list/get/update round-trip,\n  validation (empty/multi-field/unknown-key → 400), authz false + authz throw →\n  403 (no SDK call), audit records, error mapping, secret hygiene, sourceOfTruth.\n\nAdds publish-bff.yml (bff-v* → npm, provenance). typecheck + tests + build green.\n\nCodex-reviewed (authz-throw→403, full-field redaction, audit outcome semantics\nall addressed and re-confirmed).\n\nCloses #248.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"d4eb109dfad32b347c65e9d50d95ec82364cca91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/d4eb109dfad32b347c65e9d50d95ec82364cca91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/deb941c10732c9c61d730747661493dc3a4a1f0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node