fa459838696aa6a6fdc67c2a8df885b81cf7a76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/commits/1ff194b16c00ecb3219540c8522824ce1f8e1fca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:10:39Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:10:39Z","email":"brightq@gmail.com","name":"Bright Qi"},"message":"feat(246): @baobox/skill-builder-contract — shared BFF↔MFE contract\n\nThe Phase-1 BFF↔MFE HTTP contract for the Skill Studio (Epic baobox#244,\nν1.1). The embedded <baobox-skill-builder> Web Component (#249) fetches this\nsurface from the tenant''s own BFF (#248) — it is NOT the BaoBox API, and the\nWeb Component never imports @baobox/sdk.\n\nPayload shapes REUSE @baobox/sdk''s skill types so server and browser share one\nsource of truth:\n- SkillSummary — lean list projection of @baobox/sdk Skill (+ toSkillSummary).\n- SkillDetail — re-export of @baobox/sdk SkillWithFiles (+ skillDetailSchema,\n  non-strict so additive SDK fields don''t break a server-produced response).\n- SkillUpdateRequest — .strict(), exactly one editable field (Phase 1 is a\n  single-field edit); unknown keys (id/tenantId) rejected.\n- Response envelopes + route descriptors (GET /skills, GET /skills/:id,\n  PATCH /skills/:id).\n- Compile-time drift guards pinning every contract shape to @baobox/sdk\n  (bidirectional for detail; assignability for the editable update fields).\n\nVersioned 0.1.0, published via tag-driven CI (contract-v* → npm). 13 tests,\ntypecheck + build green.\n\nCodex-reviewed: single-field enforcement, bidirectional drift guard, update\ndrift guard, and the strict-request/lax-response asymmetry all confirmed.\n\nCloses #246.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"8b6dcfc2476a007d679a7752cd6fcc9744b73356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/trees/8b6dcfc2476a007d679a7752cd6fcc9744b73356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobox-ai/baobox-skill-studio/git/commits/1ff194b16c00ecb3219540c8522824ce1f8e1fca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3533280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brightq","id":3533280,"login":"brightq","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzMyODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brightq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h