cbf7908d31508a540f085cea","node_id":"C_kwDOSzEWKdoAKDJjNjc0YTUxYTRiNTgzMDBjYmY3OTA4ZDMxNTA4YTU0MGYwODVjZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/e9159e7871fe0e3bc6123a4851d8a2dda72b8995","sha":"e9159e7871fe0e3bc6123a4851d8a2dda72b8995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/e9159e7871fe0e3bc6123a4851d8a2dda72b8995"}],"sha":"2c674a51a4b58300cbf7908d31508a540f085cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/2c674a51a4b58300cbf7908d31508a540f085cea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/e9159e7871fe0e3bc6123a4851d8a2dda72b8995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T13:36:48Z","email":"17649380+calcifux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"calcifux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T13:36:48Z","email":"17649380+calcifux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"calcifux"},"message":"feat: QUEUE_NAMESPACE (ciudadanía en broker compartido) + defaults de layout al usuario\n\nNacido de un incidente real en la mega-red aqua: dos apps en el mismo redis db\nse robaban tasks (KeyError = corrida perdida; mail.send cruzado EN SILENCIO).\nQUEUE_NAMESPACE prefija task_default_queue y toda cola nombrada vía el resolvedor\núnico qualified_queue() (enqueue_mail, Job.dispatch, crons, beat, CLI --queue),\ny namespacea el lock anti-overlap (cron-lock:<ns>:<name>). Default '''' = 100%\nretrocompatible. Sobrevive Redis Cluster (db 0 único), donde db-por-app muere.\n\nDefaults de layout: MODULES_PACKAGE/MODELS_PACKAGE/APP_COMMANDS_PACKAGE pasan\nde tequio.* a app.* — una instalación sin .env ya NO descubre el Demo empaquetado\nni agenda su cron en el broker del usuario (el workspace del framework se\nconfigura solo vía Tests/conftest.py). Demo crons con environments local/dev.","tree":{"sha":"e1fd4dfef4ed9741e6f6d7ea0082d748c7eece94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/trees/e1fd4dfef4ed9741e6f6d7ea0082d748c7eece94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/commits/e9159e7871fe0e3bc6123a4851d8a2dda72b8995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscript