hub.com","name":"calcifux"},"message":"v0.1.3 — paridad con milpa 0.6.0: schedule-file, TEQUIO_ENV_FILE, auto_session y el lock accionable\n\nPrimera cosecha del drift-guard interno (kernel compartido milpa↔tequio): 17\narchivos huérfanos en su primera corrida. A tequio le llegaron --schedule-file,\nTEQUIO_ENV_FILE, auto_session en la fachada y el error accionable del lock store;\na milpa le regresó el --pool de Windows que nunca viajó. El ledger de divergencias\naceptadas (16, cada una con su porqué) quedó como contrato entre hermanos.","tree":{"sha":"775d86eb1c1e96f13938a68b6be0f4c1d4941b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/trees/775d86eb1c1e96f13938a68b6be0f4c1d4941b91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/commits/2f4638d28a99ece89e621d75a91a473ec6feaa31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/2f4638d28a99ece89e621d75a91a473ec6feaa31","node_id":"C_kwDOSzEWKdoA