ng excluye según este archivo).","tree":{"sha":"01ffb0aa89bbe4c39763534f2d451258ef690c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/trees/01ffb0aa89bbe4c39763534f2d451258ef690c2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/commits/74fb8986ccbbbac948044e8de2ab3a7349ee530c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/74fb8986ccbbbac948044e8de2ab3a7349ee530c","node_id":"C_kwDOSzEWKdoAKDc0ZmI4OTg2Y2NiYmJhYzk0ODA0NGU4ZGUyYWIzYTczNDllZTUzMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8","sha":"c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8"}],"sha":"74fb8986ccbbbac948044e8de2ab3a7349ee530c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/74fb8986ccbbbac948044e8de2ab3a7349ee530c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/commits/c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T01:11:39Z","email":"17649380+calcifux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"calcifux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T01:11:39Z","email":"17649380+calcifux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"calcifux"},"message":"v0.1.2 — fachada pública lazy + py.typed; el sdist ya no filtra .idea/ y la metadata de PyPI queda completa\n\n- Fachada raíz perezosa (PEP 562): `from tequio import job, cron_task, celery_app, …`\n  sin efectos colaterales en `import tequio` (eager instanciaría Celery + Settings +\n  logging en import time). Rutas profundas siguen válidas; test de contrato nuevo.\n- py.typed (PEP 561): éramos mypy-strict pero no publicábamos los tipos.\n- Empaquetado: .idea/ al .gitignore (hatchling arma el sdist según él — en 0.1.1 se\n  coló al tar.gz publicado) + allowlist explícita [tool.hatch.build.targets.sdist].\n- Metadata PyPI: classifiers, keywords y project.urls (la página salía sin links).\n- Skeleton: fuera la nota obsoleta \"aún no publicado en PyPI\" del pyproject.toml.tmpl.\n\nOrigen: análisis externo de 0.1.1 verificado contra el repo y milpa — se aplicó lo\nconfirmado (py.typed, fachada, higiene) y se rechazó lo refutado (Demo fuera del\nwheel rompería `tequio new --demo`; el pin de redis es legítimo: se importa directo).","tree":{"sha":"03c685014cd12ba11a6fa9b483754ddcdf035677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/trees/03c685014cd12ba11a6fa9b483754ddcdf035677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/calcifux/tequio-core/git/commits/c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17649380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux","id":17649380,"login":"calcifux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ5Mzgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calcifux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/c4dee886dfaf34345c900497c8b1104ece1346e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSzEWKdoAKGM0ZGVlODg2ZGZhZjM0MzQ1YzkwMDQ5N2M4YjExMDRlY2UxMzQ2ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/calcifux/tequio-core/commit/9eb8251f280fb838e5ab3568691ad6ac48c383aa","sha":"9eb8251f280fb838e