erCell, LiveSection\n\nHooks:\n- Extracted all logic from LiveDashboard''s 397-line useEffect into\n  reusable hooks: useLiveSession, useDriverFallback, useFastestLap,\n  usePositionChanges, usePitDetection, useRetirements, useTyres,\n  usePenalties\n\nConstants:\n- Extracted shared constants into constants/f1.ts: compound colours,\n  polling intervals, stale timeouts, session labels, points system,\n  countryFlag utility\n- Updated MeetingDetail and MeetingCalendar to use shared utilities\n  instead of local duplicates","tree":{"sha":"60c20298a1c7c041f20263b89ecc5af91f6147fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/trees/60c20298a1c7c041f20263b89ecc5af91f6147fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/commits/51b62b45061aead1831c4f32652250f1d8ddcfd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tombell","id":129327,"login":"tombell","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTMyNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tombell/f1-dashboard/commit/51b62b45061aead1831c4f32652250f1d8ddcfd3","node_id":"C_kwDOSzJABdoAKDUxYjYyYjQ1MDYxYWVhZDE4MzFjNGYzM