"name":"Tom Bell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:28:16Z","email":"tomb@tombell.dev","name":"Tom Bell"},"message":"Add live track map, location API endpoint, and fix location DB indexes\n\n- New TrackMap component: Monaco circuit SVG rendered from coordinate\n  data, with coloured dots for each driver''s latest position.\n- New /api/location/current endpoint on the dashboard server that\n  queries MongoDB directly (bypassing the slow OpenF1 aggregation\n  pipeline) for the latest X/Y/Z per driver.\n- Fixed location API performance: added session_key_1, _key_1,\n  session_key_1_date_-1, and session_key_1_dn_1_date_-1 indexes\n  to the location collection.\n- Dashboard server now runs under the openf1 venv (has pymongo).\n- Track map data (monaco-track.ts) generated from NOR''s lap data.","tree":{"sha":"1c66b864eda2ff720ee2f22594a74a3f6c52a2f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/trees/1c66b864eda2ff720ee2f22594a74a3f6c52a2f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/commits/e2c513712ca81e1b129758c32a975de33e619baa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tombell","id":129327,"login":"tombell","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTMyNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http