OUT badge.\n- Red flag handling: detects RED FLAG from race control messages. During\n  red flag, uses stint lap counts instead of timestamps — drivers 3+ laps\n  behind the leader are genuinely retired, regardless of flag duration.\n- Penalty indicators: parses race control messages for UNDER INVESTIGATION\n  (yellow INV badge) and active PENALTY (orange PEN badge). Extracts driver\n  number from message text via CAR (\\d+) regex since steward messages have\n  null driver_number field.\n- PIT badge fix: skips pit detection on first data load to prevent\n  flagging all historical pit stops as new.","tree":{"sha":"0093425fe8bacc017e9863b48d8134869c5f3421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/trees/0093425fe8bacc017e9863b48d8134869c5f3421"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tombell/f1-dashboard/git/commits/9ccb7ba3919c51ff0be6e43b69d57e26a5e47d4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tombell","id":129327,"login":"tombell","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTMyNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tombell","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tombell/f1-dashboard/commit/9ccb7ba3919c51ff0be6e