nejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/commits/bef322130acf7c903e0b6a1e7753b27009cf6cf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T04:00:26Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T04:00:26Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"UI overhaul with performance and layout fixes\n\nFrontend performance:\n- Parallelize home page API calls (was a sequential waterfall)\n- Add 30s TTL cache to video-service with invalidation on mutations\n- Replace 411-line hardcoded recentViews array with empty fallback;\n  home recently-watched now reads real history via RecentViewsService\n  (DynamoDB), matching the /recent page\n\nLayout and visual:\n- Responsive video/model grids (6/4/3/2 columns) replacing fixed vw widths\n- track-card: display block + min-width:0 on :host and .card-info so\n  grid 1fr tracks don''t expand to nowrap title min-content width\n- Card hover lift/shadow/zoom effects, loading skeletons, empty states,\n  smooth expand animation, sticky toolbar, domain filter chips\n- Toolbar: w-100 on wrapper so the flex spacer pushes search box right\n- Thumbnail menu: restore slide-in from right (transform-based) with\n  gradient backdrop styling\n\nBug fixes:\n- Guard getVideoKeys calls when the recently-watched list is empty\n  (backend built invalid \"WHERE ID IN ()\" SQL and returned 500)\n- Remove stale searchbox.html (component uses inline template)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016EXNz7cxWWxn3MvZxwFhRN","tree":{"sha":"89bbb9e52c6e597cc134ae690d5290f6ac457012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/git/trees/89bbb9e52c6e597cc134ae690d5290f6ac457012"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/git/commits/bef322130acf7c903e0b6a1e7753b27009cf6cf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/commit/bef322130acf7c903e0b6a1e7753b27009cf6cf8","node_id":"C_kwDOSzJJX9oAKGJlZjMyMjEzMGFjZjdjOTAzZTBiNmExZTc3NTNiMjcwMDljZjZjZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/commit/bc86a451abc3631dc6754275d3e10b621b59dd70","sha":"bc86a451abc3631dc6754275d3e10b621b59dd70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/ng-sploosh/commits/bc86a451abc3631dc6754275d3e10b621b59dd