/users/ScriptedAlchemy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy","id":25274700,"login":"ScriptedAlchemy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjc0NzAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/tracedecay/commits/23daccbaac6e7649696bb41aff3373bf913a4c6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:06:44Z","email":"zackary.l.jackson@gmail.com","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:06:44Z","email":"zackary.l.jackson@gmail.com","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"message":"build(bazel): preserve host tool lookup before HOME isolation\n\nBazel starts tests with HOME already pointing at scratch. When RUSTUP_HOME and CARGO_HOME are unset, the launcher therefore looked for rust-analyzer in scratch and the real LSP capability-negotiation test failed.\n\nPass the client HOME into the launcher, which captures the installed toolchain locations before unconditionally replacing HOME and CARGO_HOME with private test directories. All 133 runtime-acceptance tests pass with the default local environment.","tree":{"sha":"564168cebedce39df34af6c01c6431d64f38f18f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/tracedecay/git/trees/564168cebedce39df34af6c01c6431d64f38f18f"},"url