"date":"2026-10-07T08:20:29Z","email":"zackary.l.jackson@gmail.com","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"message":"fix(bazel): bound Windows Rust dependency search paths\n\nRust prepends dependency and native search directories to PATH before loading proc macros. The failing Windows LSP action had 396 search directories totaling 35,817 characters, exceeding the 32,767-character environment-variable limit and producing LoadLibraryExW error 8 followed by misleading E0463 errors.\n\nConsolidate selected Rust artifacts through shared native Bazel symlinks on Windows execution hosts. Preserve basenames, metadata selection, direct externs, native paths, and declared original inputs. Exact-action replay succeeds after replacing only the 338 Rust dependency directories with one directory. Full Linux Clippy and native Windows compilation/Clippy graph analyses pass.","tree":{"sha":"ba57bf444118dd134814d6071754c614a8ff317a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/tracedecay/git/trees/ba57bf444118dd134814d6071754c614a8ff317a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/tracedecay/git/commits/7879be1ced10b762fee3aa8c696ca234a3642def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25274700?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy","id":25274700,"login":"ScriptedAlchemy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjc0NzAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy