d on enterprise-review and review-ddd-architecture\n(membership now lives at the file), and read-only tool allowlists on the\nfindings-only agents — reviewer/pr-reviewer/enterprise-reviewer/\nfrontend-reviewer: Read, Grep, Glob, Bash; pattern-analyst adds WebFetch;\nresearcher adds WebFetch, WebSearch. planner and frontend-planner stay\nunrestricted.\n\nRegenerated packages: every description loses the old trailing-space artifact;\nthe six restricted agents gain a tools: line in the Claude package only\n(Cursor output stays name/description). Verified: sync idempotent, validation\nfails naming the file on missing frontmatter/description and warns on unknown\nkeys, both cross-namespace commands still emit to all four targets, shellcheck\nclean, hook tests 31/31, scratch bootstrap shows tools in .claude/agents/ and\nnot in .cursor/agents/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8f57c0a66da9495949ebb3bb663dc4d752ba0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/3b8f57c0a66da9495949ebb3bb663dc4d752ba0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/213c115532730593a513e7188410255767b31131","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"sta