"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T09:07:13Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"sync.sh: parse flat YAML frontmatter instead of the HTML-comment marker.\n\nAuthored shared/ files now start with a standard frontmatter block (the format\nboth harnesses define natively) instead of the line-1 <!-- description --> house\ndialect. New awk-based helpers (fm_get/fm_keys/body_of/validate_fm) replace the\nsed extraction: missing/invalid frontmatter fails the build naming the file,\nunknown keys warn, and values are whitespace-trimmed (fixing the trailing space\nthe old sed capture left on every generated description).\n\nField mapping per harness: Claude gets full passthrough (agents: tools/model;\ncommands: argument-hint), Cursor gets name/description only. Cross-namespace\nmembership moves from a hardcoded list in this script onto the files themselves\nvia \"namespaces: engineer, frontend\" (closes finding 2 of\nplan/feat-design-sync.enterprise-review.md).\n\nNote: sync fails between this commit and the 29-file migration that follows —\nthe two are split for reviewability; the branch head is consistent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b03dcf6a3ed9e5e6be8f73b85e5f2c9408985fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/b03dcf6a3ed9e5e6be8f73b85e5f2c9408985fe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/5d52787c9a2b5e888751ff46a62cd88df5d42303","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"