 Spittel"},"message":"Add /review-ddd-architecture: whole-codebase DDD/OO alignment review.\n\nConverts the user''s draft review-ddd-architecture skill (SKILL.md + plan/PR\ntemplates under test/) into a native command shipped to both harnesses and\nboth namespaces via the cross-namespace list: /engineer:review-ddd-architecture\n+ /frontend:review-ddd-architecture in Claude Code, /review-ddd-architecture +\n/frontend-review-ddd-architecture in Cursor.\n\nThe methodology is preserved as authored: three-mode operation (review only /\nplan / decompose), parallel read-only discovery, DDD tactical-pattern mapping\nthat respects functional/anemic style choices, OO principles pass, severity-\nclassified boundary violations, preserve-what-works target structure, a\nlightweight pattern menu with explicit what-not-to-do, risk-first phasing with\noperator gates, and stacked-PR decomposition rules. The companion plan and\nstacked-PR templates are inlined into the command body (house style), with\nskill-pack frontmatter, dead cross-repo references, and npm-specific\nacceptance wording generalized. Complements /enterprise-review (change-scoped\naudit) with the whole-codebase assessment + migration plan.\n\nWith a second cross-namespace command the SC2043 single-item-loop directive\nin sync.sh is no longer needed and is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8f37009346998a080ceffb2b8bfd7e5fc06f38d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/a8f37009346998a080ceffb2b8bfd7e5fc06f38d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/72208cd79edfe919a10a650310fe7db122548236","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","