0:45:56Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add the frontend design round-trip tutorial.\n\ndocs/frontend-design-roundtrip.md walks the full loop on a dummy workspace\n(jam/education Ruby backend + spa, library at localhost:5600, swagger.yaml):\nbootstrap + project map, first catalog push, designing enrolments on\nclaude.ai/design from real cards, manifest approval, spec-grounded\nanalyze-patterns (with a drift-flag example), stacked story decomposition,\nreview, and the push-back that grows the catalog. Includes Cursor differences\nand a troubleshooting table. Linked from the README frontend section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cdffe1b7ef36ea5a6c14f90cc75a280ae1d860d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/1cdffe1b7ef36ea5a6c14f90cc75a280ae1d860d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/ab74f032dbbc06036327caaabe4f4adc2b1edf1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/ab74f032dbbc06036327caaabe4f4adc2b1edf1a","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKGFiNzRmMDMyZGJiYzA2MDM2MzI3Y2FhYWJlNGY0YWRjMmIxZWRmMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/482025d3ab2cdedc13758f41942892eaddb668f0","sha":"482025d3ab2cdedc13758f41942892eaddb668f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/482025d3ab2cdedc13758f41942892eaddb668f0"}],"sha":"ab74f032dbbc06036327caaabe4f4adc2b1edf1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/ab74f032dbbc06036327caaabe4f4adc2b1edf1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/482025d3ab2cdedc13758f41942892eaddb668f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:45:56Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:45:56Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add Claude Design round trip + OpenAPI-first backend contracts.\n\nNew /frontend:design-sync publishes the component library to a claude.ai/design\ndesign-system project via the DesignSync tool: Storybook static build -> one\nself-contained preview per variant with @dsCard group markers (story IDs are\nthe card identities), structural diff, incremental approval-gated push, never\nwholesale-replace. Also pushes CONVENTIONS.md so design sessions compose from\nexisting cards and record feature designs as designs/<feature>/manifest.json\n(uses / new_components / status). Claude Code only; Cursor gets an explanatory\nstop.\n\nPull side: analyze-patterns, discover, plan-feature, and pattern-analyst now\ntreat an approved manifest as the implementation contract - uses pre-seeds\ncomponent choices, new_components pre-seeds gaps, the design becomes acceptance\ncriteria for views. Drafts are context, never contracts.\n\nBackend contract is now resolved spec-first: an OpenAPI/Swagger document\ndeclared in the project map (path or URL) is the published contract (endpoints\nrecorded by operationId, schemas drive domain-type mapping); routes/controllers\nremain the fallback and the cross-check, with spec-vs-code drift flagged as a\ngap instead of silently picking a side.\n\nProject map gains two rows (Backend API spec, Claude Design project). All\nfetch paths (design project, remote specs, Storybook index) now carry a\ntreat-as-data guard - closes finding 1 of\nplan/feat-frontend-workflow.enterprise-review.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f503233c39f5742899aa3881d63be6721f3b0d66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/f503233c39f5742899aa3881d63be6721f3b0d66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/482025d3ab2cdedc13758f41942892eaddb668f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"ht