p/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/c504ca87b6fea2db30a003a410ed1e78b3453b5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:47:14Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:47:14Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add enterprise review report for the frontend-workflow branch.\n\nFirst dogfood run of /enterprise-review on its own branch: 2 ALIGNED,\n3 CONCERNS, no violations. Introduced findings (all medium): fetched\nStorybook catalog lacks a treat-as-data guard (prompt-injection surface),\ncross-namespace command membership declared in sync.sh instead of at the\nfile, and a second generated artifact in authored bootstrap/ without a\nprovenance marker. Fixes deferred: finding 3''s remediation already exists\non feat/hooks-ci-cursor and reconciles at merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"351c4e6f6246647ef69127ad798ad265d68a1737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/351c4e6f6246647ef69127ad798ad265d68a1737"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/c504ca87b6fea2db30a003a410ed1e78b3453b5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/c504ca87b6fea2db30a003a410ed1e78b3453b5f","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKGM1MDRjYTg3YjZmZWEyZGIzMGEwMDNhNDEwZWQxZTc4YjM0NTNiNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80","sha":"b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80"}],"sha":"c504ca87b6fea2db30a003a410ed1e78b3453b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/c504ca87b6fea2db30a003a410ed1e78b3453b5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:01:36Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T06:01:36Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add /enterprise-review: principles audit with per-dimension verdicts.\n\nDeep, advisory review that audits a change against reference principles —\ncomplementing /review-loop (correctness), /review-pr (merge scoring), and\n/architecture-review (drift vs documented architecture). Five dimensions,\neach verdicted ALIGNED | CONCERNS | VIOLATION:\n\n- Domain-Driven Design (logic placement, aggregates, ubiquitous language, ACLs)\n- Modularity & cohesion (code that changes together lives together; explicit\n  module APIs, no deep reach-ins)\n- Dependency hygiene (direction toward the domain, NO cycles at module or file\n  level, no layer skips) — scope widens beyond the diff to the import graph of\n  affected modules, via project tooling (dependency-cruiser/madge, packwerk,\n  import-linter) or manual tracing\n- OO design (SOLID, encapsulation, composition; over-engineering flagged as\n  readily as under-design)\n- Security (the pr-reviewer checklist)\n\nFindings split Introduced (actionable, drive the verdict) vs Pre-existing\n(debt register, never blocking), each citing the named principle violated.\nReport persists to plan/<slug>.enterprise-review.md. Advisory only — merge\ngating stays with /pr-review-loop.\n\nAuthored once in shared/commands/, served in both namespaces: Claude Code\n/engineer:enterprise-review + /frontend:enterprise-review, Cursor\n/enterprise-review + /frontend-enterprise-review (new cross-namespace pass in\nsync.sh). New enterprise-reviewer agent ships flat in both packages.\nAGENTS.md.tmpl also catches up on the frontend agents missed in 53f8456.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bef98c006a8ab63dd15e7688bb26fa10729d2015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/bef98c006a8ab63dd15e7688bb26fa10729d2015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKGI1ZjI4ZjFjYzhkYTVhYjBmNmEzYWRhNzkyNmJjNDMwZmMxOTFlODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66","sha":"3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66"}],"sha":"b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/b5f28f1cc8da5ab0f6a3ada7926bc430fc191e80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:50:13Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:50:13Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Frontend workflow: per-project locations via a CLAUDE.md project map.\n\nRepo locations and the component library are no longer a fixed sibling-repo\nconvention. Each bootstrapped project declares them in a \"Project map\" table\nin CLAUDE.md: SPA source root (e.g. ./spa/src), backend repo path (e.g.\n./jam/education), and component-library/Storybook URL (e.g.\nhttp://localhost:5600/component-library).\n\nAll frontend commands and agents resolve the map before doing anything else,\nask the operator (and offer to fill the table in) when an entry is missing or\nstill [TODO], and fall back to the old sibling-repo default only when unset.\nanalyze-patterns takes the Storybook base URL from the map instead of\ndefaulting straight to localhost:6006.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"808b3e004f4181561f6d9ebea4f6e3ffaa990d3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/808b3e004f4181561f6d9ebea4f6e3ffaa990d3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKDNlOTc4N2I4OWFhZDE1MzY2YTg0NzBjNTg0ODQwYTc1Mzk0MWNkNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/53f8456cb5bfdc7914d9db510366473488be8fc5","sha":"53f8456cb5bfdc7914d9db510366473488be8fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/53f8456cb5bfdc7914d9db510366473488be8fc5"}],"sha":"3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/3e9787b89aad15366a8470c584840a753941cd66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/53f8456cb5bfdc7914d9db510366473488be8fc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:39:41Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:39:41Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add frontend workflow: Vue/Vite SPA commands, agents, and standards.\n\nParallel command set for SPA repos under the frontend namespace, mirroring the\nengineer workflow''s shape: discover -> analyze-patterns -> plan-feature ->\ndecompose -> code-structure -> review-loop. PR flow and handoff reuse the\nengineer commands.\n\nFrontend-specific: DDD module structure (src/modules/<domain>/), component-\nlibrary-first (on-disk source + Storybook index.json catalog), service/ACL\nlayer against the Ruby backend living in a sibling repo at the same folder\nlevel (commands read ../<backend> routes/controllers for the real API\ncontract), stacked story branches per plan, Vitest as definition of done.\n\nNew /frontend:analyze-patterns extracts existing CRUD/component/store/service\npatterns per plan, asks the author which to adopt, and writes\nplan/<feature>.patterns.md to feed planning.\n\nPackaging: Claude Code namespaces by subdirectory\n(plugins/.../commands/frontend/ -> /frontend:discover); Cursor''s command model\nis flat, so filenames carry the prefix (cursor/commands/frontend-*.md ->\n/frontend-discover). Agents (frontend-planner, frontend-reviewer,\npattern-analyst) ship flat in both. frontend-standards.mdc is glob-scoped to\nfrontend files rather than alwaysApply so backend repos aren''t polluted.\nbootstrap/install.sh links .claude/commands/frontend/ and copies the rule;\nCursor picks the flat files up via the existing globs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5f1151edbe742dbea11d479f77341201903fc2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/e5f1151edbe742dbea11d479f77341201903fc2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/53f8456cb5bfdc7914d9db510366473488be8fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"htt