6c6e92006bae2c79f9f3abb6f744965819c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:40:45Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:40:45Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Make Cursor hooks actually fire: project hooks.json wiring + JSON-verdict adapters.\n\nCursor loads hooks only from enterprise/team/project/user hooks.json — never\nfrom plugins — so the plugin-shipped hooks/hooks.json was dead config and none\nof the three hooks ever ran in Cursor. HOOKS.md gave the inverted guidance.\n\nbootstrap/install.sh now writes a project-level .cursor/hooks.json (never\noverwrites; prunes the old dead .cursor/hooks/hooks.json symlink on re-run),\nwiring the symlinked scripts in .cursor/hooks/. sync.sh no longer emits a\nhooks.json into the Cursor package.\n\nNew Cursor-only adapters in shared/hooks/cursor/ translate the shared scripts''\nexit codes into Cursor''s JSON hook responses:\n- cursor-shell-guard.sh: dep-age-guard exit 2 -> {\"permission\":\"deny\"} with the\n  block reason as user_message/agent_message (stderr fate on bare exit 2 is\n  unspecified in Cursor''s docs).\n- cursor-stop-tests.sh: Cursor''s stop hook cannot block, so a failing suite\n  returns followup_message (auto-continues the agent, capped by loop_limit 5);\n  fires only on status \"completed\" and honours RUN_TESTS_SKIP.\n\ntest-hooks.sh grows to 31 cases covering both adapters in the authored and\ngenerated layouts; CI shellcheck now lints shared/hooks/cursor/. Verified\nend-to-end through a bootstrapped scratch project: live-registry deny verdict\nfor npm install @types/node and followup_message on a red suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83d8075ee449bd76da2654cf6f11037e540cd40e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/83d8075ee449bd76da2654cf6f11037e540cd40e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/ea9376c6e92006bae2c79f9f3abb6f744965819c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/ea9376c6e92006bae2c79f9f3abb6f744965819c","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKGVhOTM3NmM2ZTkyMDA2YmFlMmM3OWY5ZjNhYmI2Zjc0NDk2NTgxOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915","sha":"c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915"}],"sha":"ea9376c6e92006bae2c79f9f3abb6f744965819c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/ea9376c6e92006bae2c79f9f3abb6f744965819c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:19:59Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:19:59Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Add CI (drift check, shellcheck, hook tests) and sync.sh hygiene.\n\nCI workflow regenerates from shared/ and fails on any diff, lints all shell\nscripts, and runs build/test-hooks.sh — 23 hermetic behavioral tests of the\nthree hooks against a fake curl serving canned registry responses (the two\ndep-age-guard regressions are covered and proven to fail on the pre-fix code).\n\nsync.sh: marketplace owner is now deterministic (AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_OWNER\noverride) instead of git config user.name, so CI regeneration is reproducible;\na missing description marker aborts with an error instead of silently emitting\nan empty description and eating the first content line; the generated\nbootstrap/rules/standards.mdc now carries a provenance comment. Dead\nbuild/frontmatter templates removed; install.sh shellcheck findings fixed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4feb4f775c42caf4080cc9e6cba9969207f9d05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/d4feb4f775c42caf4080cc9e6cba9969207f9d05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKGM3NjM5NTc4YzI0ZDE4YzQzZGE3MjI1MzE1YTRkYmZlNjg3YjM5MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f","sha":"8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f"}],"sha":"c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/c7639578c24d18c43da7225315a4dbfe687b3915"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:19:36Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:19:36Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Fix dep-age-guard bypass/false-positives and enforce run-tests stop gate.\n\ndep-age-guard: scoped packages without a version specifier resolved to an\nempty name and were never age-checked (npm install @scope/pkg bypassed the\nguard); tokens from other commands in a chain (npm install && npm run build)\nwere treated as package names and could false-block. The parser now splits at\nshell operators and only collects tokens after a package manager''s\ninstall/i/add subcommand; scope slashes are URL-encoded for the registry\nlookup, and the shadowed pnpm patterns are reordered ahead of npm.\n\nrun-tests: a failing suite exited 1, which Claude Code treats as non-blocking,\nso \"green before done\" was never enforced. Now exits 2 on failure (blocks the\nstop, feeds the last 40 lines back), honours stop_hook_active to avoid\ninfinite loops, and supports RUN_TESTS_SKIP=1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00658021168a8ffc18d17edaeef8f24ac3a715c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/00658021168a8ffc18d17edaeef8f24ac3a715c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f","node_id":"C_kwDOSzNt8NoAKDhhYjdmN2JhZjA0NDhiYjM0OTRmYzJjZmYxOGMwNjM5ZmQzMzkyNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commit/73ea5bb5264ea62bf512e86b6701e2a25e8283b9","sha":"73ea5bb5264ea62bf512e86b6701e2a25e8283b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/73ea5bb5264ea62bf512e86b6701e2a25e8283b9"}],"sha":"8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0639fd33925f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/8ab7f7baf0448bb3494fc2cff18c0