/fb3rasp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/commits/32543f059da2dd9c32d5e864a93459eb4a75f80a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T01:12:33Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T01:12:33Z","email":"fb3rasp@gmail.com","name":"Rainer Spittel"},"message":"Initial commit: agentic-workflow for Claude Code + Cursor\n\nReusable agentic SDLC workflow packaged for both harnesses from a single\nsource of truth (shared/), built into native plugin packages by build/sync.sh.\n\n- 8 commands: discover, plan-feature, decompose, code-structure, review-loop,\n  document-architecture, architecture-review, handoff\n- 3 subagents: planner, researcher, reviewer\n- 3 hooks: dep-age-guard (block deps <14d), run-tests, format-changed\n- bootstrap/ scaffolds per-project files (CLAUDE.md, Cursor rule, PR template, plan/)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a715d27e302eb651723ab85c4c662a672ba3a2f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/trees/a715d27e302eb651723ab85c4c662a672ba3a2f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fb3rasp/agentic-workflow/git/commits/32543f059da2dd9c32d5e864a93459eb4a75f80a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fb3rasp","id":121368,"login":"fb3rasp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3rasp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fb3ras