.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/c258652d7681dc34bc46565092d2ce1114b36849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:54:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:54:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: policy guard exempted every route containing ''/auth''\n\nThe guard skipped policy checks for `request.path.indexOf(''/auth'') > -1`,\nintended to let the login routes through. But ''/oauth/authorize'' contains\n''/auth'' at position 6, so it was exempt too — which made the admin guard just\nadded to it completely inert, and would have silently exempted any future\nroute with ''/auth'' anywhere in its path.\n\nMatched by prefix now. Only /oauth/* changes behaviour: /auth/* carries no\npolicies at all, and routes with no @CheckPolicies still return true at the\nnext check, so nothing else is newly enforced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a838256cf15f3605493257c7885f12b3d448676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/3a838256cf15f3605493257c7885f12b3d448676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/c258652d7681dc34bc46565092d2ce1114b36849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/c258652d7681dc34bc46565092d2ce1114b36849","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGMyNTg2NTJkNzY4MWRjMzRiYzQ2NTY1MDkyZDJjZTExMTRiMzY4NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b","sha":"b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b"}],"sha":"c258652d7681dc34bc46565092d2ce1114b36849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/c258652d7681dc34bc46565092d2ce1114b36849"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:25:36Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:25:36Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: scope the media library per member\n\nCreatives were visible to everyone in the workspace: Media carried only an\norganizationId, with no record of who uploaded what, so a delegated member\nbrowsing the library saw another client''s material.\n\nMedia now records its uploader (nullable - existing rows predate this). A\nmember with channel assignments sees a creative only if they uploaded it, or\nif an ADMIN/SUPERADMIN did. Members with no assignments - the owner and\nadmins - get the byte-identical query they had before; the scope fragment is\nliterally {} for them. Unattributed media is therefore invisible to a\nrestricted member, which is the intent: the backlog belongs to another client.\n\nEvery path that creates media stamps the uploader (saveFile is the only\nwriter; all 13 call sites audited). Delete and rename are guarded by the same\nrule. Posts keep rendering: Post.image is a self-contained snapshot holding\nthe absolute path, and getMediaById is deliberately left uploader-unscoped so\na member can still open and publish a post built from a creative that is no\nlonger in their library.\n\nAlso closed, found while auditing how a hidden creative could still be\nreached:\n- /posts/old returned post ids for every channel, and those ids pivot into\n  the UNAUTHENTICATED /public/posts/:id preview, which echoes the raw image\n  JSON with full media paths. Now channel-scoped.\n- The approvals queue leaked the same ids, and let a member approve or reject\n  another client''s posts. Now channel-scoped.\n- getMediaById had no organizationId at all - a cross-tenant read, wider than\n  the member-level issue this change is about.\n- POST /oauth/authorize had no admin guard. PublicAuthMiddleware stamps the\n  resulting token as SUPERADMIN with no assignments, so hasChannelRestriction\n  reads false: a restricted member could mint themselves an unrestricted key\n  and step around delegation entirely.\n\nThe scope fragment is typed as Prisma.MediaWhereInput rather than any, which\ncaught a real defect - spreading a where-input over a where-unique widens id\nfrom a string into a filter. Prisma tolerated it at runtime; it is now\nAND-nested and compiler-checked at every use site.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"593c3078576f06f9633a63a423c00f94864fbbf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/593c3078576f06f9633a63a423c00f94864fbbf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGI5NTJhZjQ1ZDM5OWRlNzE4ZmYwMTZiMzFmYzBkNTYwZDZmY2Y2NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb","sha":"35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb"}],"sha":"b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/b952af45d399de718ff016b31fc0d560d6fcf64b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:14:03Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:14:03Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: make the TikTok and video path production ready\n\nHanding a restricted login to a social media team surfaced a run of defects,\nthe worst of which was silent.\n\nTOKEN REFRESH — TikTok channels died roughly daily and nothing said so.\nTiktokProvider declared no refreshCron, so no refresher was ever registered;\nIntegrationsActivity.refreshToken carried no @ActivityMethod, so even the\nproviders that DO declare it could not have refreshed (prod has never run a\nsingle refreshTokenWorkflow); and the workflow ended permanently once a token\nwas already past expiry, so a lapsed channel could never recover. Fixed all\nthree, plus: refresh now wakes 2h early, an expired token gets one immediate\nrecovery attempt, a 1h floor prevents a spin, continueAsNew keeps history\nbounded, and a boot-time backfill re-arms existing channels rather than only\nones connected from now on. A permanent refusal flags the channel instead of\nlooping. NOTE the new activity is named refreshIntegrationToken: the obvious\nname collides with PostActivity.refreshToken, and nestjs-temporal-core merges\nactivities into one flat map, so registering it would have silently replaced\nthe activity that publishing depends on.\n\nTIKTOK COMPOSER — the posting-method dropdown defaulted to direct posting,\nwhich cannot succeed while the app is on sandbox credentials; four real posts\nfailed that way. Upload mode is now the default. The controls TikTok ignores\nin that mode now actually grey out — the shared Checkbox was discarding its\n`disabled` prop entirely, which also fixes a long-broken disabled elsewhere.\nCover timestamp moved into post_info per TikTok''s schema (direct-post only),\nand ''invalid_param'' is matched as TikTok actually spells it, so a parameter\nrejection stops surfacing as \"Unknown Error\".\n\nVIDEO DETECTION — every consumer decided \"is this a video?\" by looking for\n\"mp4\", in six slightly different ways, so a .mov was treated as a photo and\nposted to the wrong endpoint. One shared helper now answers it, and the upload\nallow-lists accept QuickTime, since iPhones record .mov whatever the codec\nsetting and the picker was offering a file the upload then refused. Bytes are\nstill sniffed and the stored name and extension are still server-derived.\n\nSTATUS DISPLAY — a TikTok post waiting in the inbox showed a green \"Live\"\nbadge and a \"View post\" link to TikTok''s messages page; it now reads \"In\ninbox\" and links to the guide. ERROR was called \"Failed\" on the calendar and\n\"Not published\" in the editor; one word now, still distinct from a missed\nschedule. The failure tooltip showed a raw Temporal JSON blob and now shows\nthe message. A retried post no longer keeps the error from its failed attempt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1c418451a79bfab4d4cc46d3cf103618bca65f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/a1c418451a79bfab4d4cc46d3cf103618bca65f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDM1ZjljODA4MzU0MjU2ZDBhNTg3ODhhNTUyYjcxZWRjOTZkYTBkZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd","sha":"1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd"}],"sha":"35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/35f9c808354256d0a58788a552b71edc96da0dfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:28:08Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:28:08Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: in-app TikTok posting guide for the social team\n\nWhile the TikTok app runs on sandbox credentials it cannot publish straight\nto a profile: posts have to go out in upload mode, land in the creator''s\nTikTok inbox and be finished by hand in the TikTok app. That is not\nguessable from the UI, and the composer''s posting-method dropdown defaults\nto the mode that always fails — four posts failed that way this morning.\n\n- New page at /tiktok-guide written for non-technical staff: why the second\n  step exists, the one setting that decides success, the steps in Studio and\n  then on the phone, what looks broken but is normal, the limits, and the\n  real error strings mapped to real fixes.\n- Sidebar entry so it is reachable at any time.\n- A quiet link to it under \"Content posting method\" in the TikTok composer —\n  shown in BOTH modes, since the point is to catch someone who has left the\n  dropdown on the failing default. Opens in a new tab so a half-written post\n  is never lost.\n\nGuide content is drawn only from behaviour verified against the deployed\nprovider and the live database; no TikTok mobile-app buttons are named,\nbecause TikTok does not document its current UI.\n\nNo posting behaviour changed — this is documentation and a link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"138a889fb9564138637db6792c96b5284422a225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/138a889fb9564138637db6792c96b5284422a225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDFhMjVlNzU4MzgzZTkwNzg1YjIzNzNlMmE5OTA2OGJiODVjNzgyY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936","sha":"cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936"}],"sha":"1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/1a25e758383e90785b2373e2a99068bb85c782cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T07:13:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T07:13:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: let a restricted member re-authorize their own channel\n\nThe re-authorize link passes internalId, not our integration id, so the new\nguard compared the wrong value and refused a member access to a channel they\nown — the exact case the guard was meant to allow.\n\nResolves internalId to the channel first (assertChannelInScopeByInternalId),\nstill accepting our own id so no caller can regress on the other shape.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84c13bd3634b93d60205f3a5650a157e01443f34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/84c13bd3634b93d60205f3a5650a157e01443f34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGNjMThjNWMwNTMxM2EzZjU1YWJhMDkwY2ExMDljOWJiN2YyYjc5MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe","sha":"518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe"}],"sha":"cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/cc18c5c05313a3f55aba090ca109c9bb7f2b7936"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:25:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:25:29Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: a channel-restricted member cannot connect new channels\n\nAdding a channel was still open to them. The new channel would not be in\ntheir assignment list, so they would connect it, be billed a slot for it,\nand never see it again.\n\n- GET /integrations/social/:integration now refuses a restricted member\n  unless they are re-authorizing one of their OWN channels (?refresh=).\n- /user/self reports channelRestricted so the sidebar hides \"Add Channel\"\n  rather than offering a button that can only fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71238a17fba757a51ed8e9b2b867773bbddb9ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/71238a17fba757a51ed8e9b2b867773bbddb9ae7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDUxODkzMmJkMzc3OTczZGFhNDBmMGQ5ZjBkMWQwYTZmNGEwMDFmZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5","sha":"bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5"}],"sha":"518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/518932bd377973daa40f0d9f0d1d0a6f4a001ffe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:56:00Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:56:00Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: enforce channel scope on every route that names a channel or post\n\nTesting the new per-channel access on production showed the list was scoped\nbut the routes behind it were not: a member given one channel could still\nrename, reconfigure, read plugs for, and — worst — publish to any other\nchannel in the workspace by passing its id. Only disable/enable/delete were\nguarded.\n\n- integrations: assert scope on GET /:id, nickname, settings, time, group,\n  customer-name, plugs (read + write), /function and /mentions. Plug\n  activation resolves the plug''s channel first (assertPlugInScope).\n- posts: assert every targeted channel on POST / and POST /valid\n  (assertChannelsInScope — a post can name several). generatePostsDraft fans\n  out to all channels, so it now receives the member''s scope instead of the\n  whole workspace.\n- posts by id/group (read, statistics, missing, release-id, comments, date,\n  delete) go through assertPostInScope, which requires every channel behind\n  that post to be inside the member''s set.\n\nUnrestricted members (owner, admins, everyone pre-existing) are unaffected —\neach guard returns immediately when the member has no assignments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71a3d1d31453af635adcc5496a83873f10bcf3cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/71a3d1d31453af635adcc5496a83873f10bcf3cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGJjYmYyZGUzN2JhNzlmMjE3OWM4ODI3N2JjMDRiN2YwYjkwYzJkZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a","sha":"55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a"}],"sha":"bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/bcbf2de37ba79f2179c88277bc04b7f0b90c2dd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:18:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:18:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: assign access per CHANNEL, not just per client\n\nThe owner wants to tick the individual channels a login may use, without\nfirst grouping them into clients. Adds direct channel delegation alongside\nthe existing client shortcut.\n\n- schema: UserOrganizationIntegration join model (member <-> channel).\n- scope: a member with NO assignments of either kind keeps full access;\n  otherwise their reachable set is (ticked channels) OR (channels of an\n  assigned client), expressed as one prisma OR fragment shared by the channel\n  list, the calendar and the post list.\n- assertChannelInScope short-circuits on a directly ticked channel before\n  falling back to the client check.\n- POST /settings/team/:id/channels sets the assignment; POST /settings/team/create\n  accepts integrationIds so access is set at creation time. Every channel id is\n  re-checked against the caller''s org.\n- GET /settings/team returns each member''s channels for the UI.\n- UI: both access pickers now list channels with avatar, name and platform.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"310bb43d62342d6c3a1b40e7c3ce9746b274d1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/310bb43d62342d6c3a1b40e7c3ce9746b274d1e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDU1ZWMxNGJlYjk2ZTc2MmI3OTljZTljODg1MGEzMTcyZGI4NWVmNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc","sha":"6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc"}],"sha":"55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/55ec14beb96e762b799ce9c8850a3172db85ef6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:13:44Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:13:44Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: admin creates team logins directly (email, password, role, client access)\n\nThis instance has no email provider, so the invite-link flow is impractical\nand self-service password resets are impossible. An admin can now mint a\nlogin outright and hand the credentials over.\n\n- POST /settings/team/create { email, password, role, customerIds } creates\n  the user, the membership and the client assignments in one step. Email is\n  lowercased (login lookup is case sensitive), the account is created\n  activated (no activation mail could ever arrive), and a duplicate email is\n  refused with a clear message rather than shadowing an existing login.\n- POST /settings/team/:id/password lets an admin set or rotate a member''s\n  password. Scoped by org id, so it can never touch someone outside the\n  workspace.\n- SUPERADMIN is not accepted by the DTO: that role belongs to the workspace\n  creator and must not be grantable through an API.\n- Passwords are hashed with the app''s own AuthService.hashPassword (bcrypt).\n- UI: \"Create login\" next to the invite button, plus \"Set password\" per\n  member row, both reusing the client checkbox list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb48905e8131ecaa42e619abb833fe7a97915de1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/eb48905e8131ecaa42e619abb833fe7a97915de1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDZkYTM3Nzg3OTBlOWQwOWY5ODg2MjhlZmIxMmYwYzE0OGI2ODJlZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936","sha":"17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936"}],"sha":"6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/6da3778790e9d09f988628efb12f0c148b682edc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T14:22:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T14:22:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: per-client delegation so an agency runs one workspace, not many\n\nPostiz isolates data only per organization, so an agency had to create a\nseparate workspace per client and reconnect the same channel in each one.\nWorse, every member of a workspace (including role USER) could see, disable\nand permanently delete ANY channel plus its posts - those routes carried no\nauthorization at all.\n\nAdds a second boundary inside a workspace: members are assigned to clients\n(the existing Customer model) and only ever see and act on those channels.\n\n- schema: UserOrganizationCustomer join model. No rows = full access, so the\n  owner, admins and every existing member are unaffected.\n- customer.scope.ts: allowedCustomerIds / customerScopeWhere helpers. Returns\n  null (not []) when unrestricted so \"unscoped\" and \"sees nothing\" stay distinct.\n- channels: GET /integrations/list filtered; /disable, /enable and DELETE /\n  now assert the channel is inside the member''s clients.\n- posts: calendar and list queries scoped. A scoped member may narrow to one\n  of their own clients; asking for another falls back to their set.\n- fixes a live bug where the calendar''s customer filter redeclared the\n  `integration` key and silently dropped its deletedAt/organizationId guard.\n- teams: GET /settings/team exposes each member''s clients,\n  POST /settings/team/:id/customers assigns them (membership and every client\n  id re-checked against the caller''s org), plus the Manage access UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e81c23ee0b9ac47e5bad43bc37d6aa9d9418492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/9e81c23ee0b9ac47e5bad43bc37d6aa9d9418492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDE3YzQ1MWQ5MjhmNDYzMzA4YTIwNDk3ZTcwM2IzNGQ3NDlmZTI5MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513","sha":"d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513"}],"sha":"17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/17c451d928f463308a20497e703b34d749fe2936"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T13:14:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T13:14:17Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: fail loudly when a provider has no app credentials configured\n\nEvery provider renders a tile in Add Channel regardless of whether this\nserver has its app credentials. Instagram (Standalone) needs\nINSTAGRAM_APP_ID, which is not set here, so clicking it built an auth URL\nwith client_id=undefined and dumped the user on Instagram''s \"Sorry, this\npage isn''t available\" with no explanation.\n\nDetect the missing client id when generating the auth URL and return a clear\nmessage naming the provider instead of redirecting to a dead page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc1c3ebce6b0ccd2160216d39e36bcdb673d21c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/fc1c3ebce6b0ccd2160216d39e36bcdb673d21c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGQ4ZGE5OWY2Mzk4YTQxNjExOGI0YjBlNTFiYzMwZWRlYjg1MjI1MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/64a21ecece5fd0d2055e67c934dc785a8f557c9d","sha":"64a21ecece5fd0d2055e67c934dc785a8f557c9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/64a21ecece5fd0d2055e67c934dc785a8f557c9d"}],"sha":"d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/d8da99f6398a416118b4b0e51bc30edeb8522513"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/64a21ecece5fd0d2055e67c934dc785a8f557c9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:20:25Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:20:25Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix(meta): allow connecting additional Instagram/Facebook accounts\n\nStudio lists Instagram accounts by asking Meta for the user''s Pages and\nfiltering to those with a linked instagram_business_account. Once a user has\nauthorized once, Meta silently reuses the previously granted Page selection,\nso /me/accounts keeps returning only the original Page - a second Instagram\naccount can never appear, with no error shown anywhere.\n\nAdd auth_type=rerequest to both Meta auth URLs so the dialog is re-displayed\nand the user can grant access to additional Pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76693d9afc850580884c64589a2f45b752fae7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/76693d9afc850580884c64589a2f45b752fae7d4"},"url":"h