url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/18487d5b63c7e4d9d952e4f5c5739ed5808e74a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T11:31:27Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T11:31:27Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix(mobile): kill horizontal overflow (sideways dead space)\n\nRoot cause: the admin impersonation bar (layout/impersonate.tsx) is a hard\nw-[600px] box rendered OUTSIDE the shell''s overflow-hidden frame, so on an\nadmin account it pushed the document to ~608px on a 375px screen - swiping\nsideways revealed bare page background. Everything else on the page is\nclipped by the frame, which is why only this one leaked.\n\n- impersonate: 600px box goes full width on phones, admin row wraps.\n- Modal bodies with a hard min-w-[500px] floor (announcements, admin dialogs)\n  now shrink to the viewport-capped panel.\n- Notification dropdown was 420px (45px wider than the screen) anchored to a\n  bell that stays visible on mobile: viewport-capped and repositioned.\n- Fixed-position dropdowns (customer select, channel context menu) clamp to\n  the viewport instead of opening off the right edge.\n- Week grid: 136px hour gutter left ~27px per weekday; 44px on phones.\n- Calendar item action icons are only force-visible in the full-width views\n  (list/day) - in week/month they blew each cell out sideways; the item''s top\n  bar now clips and truncates tags.\n- Long unbreakable URLs (webhooks, autopost) and AI copy break properly.\n- Plugs / third-party / onboarding: multi-column grids and nested 40px\n  gutters collapse on phones.\n- global.scss: page-level `overflow-x: clip` safety net (clip, not hidden,\n  so position:sticky keeps working).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88302eec3372f6697f46303a99cb7cc91cff04e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/88302eec3372f6697f46303a99cb7cc91cff04e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/18487d5b63c7e4d9d952e4f5c5739ed5808e74a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/18487d5b63c7e4d9d952e4f5c5739ed5808e74a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDE4NDg3ZDViNjNjN2U0ZDlkOTUyZTRmNWM1NzM5ZWQ1ODA4ZTc0YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef","sha":"c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef"}],"sha":"18487d5b63c7e4d9d952e4f5c5739ed5808e74a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/18487d5b63c7e4d9d952e4f5c5739ed5808e74a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:25:42Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:25:42Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix(mobile): AI assistant popup overflowed the phone screen\n\nBelow 640px CopilotKit drops its desktop geometry and relies on inset:0, but\nnothing caps the window width and .copilotKitMessages has no overflow-x guard,\nso long content widened the flex column and clipped text off the right edge.\n\nPin the window to 100vw, guard overflow, wrap bubbles/code/images, trim the\n48px message padding, add header padding so the title clears the close button,\nand set the composer textarea to 16px (below 16px iOS zooms the page on focus,\nwhich itself looked like an overflow). The floating assistant button shrinks\nand lifts clear of the composer action bar.\n\nHeight/top are left alone on purpose: Window.tsx writes them inline from\nvisualViewport to keep the input above the on-screen keyboard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38edd3f55a19bae49ab29cdbbc2d18f78a18b88d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/38edd3f55a19bae49ab29cdbbc2d18f78a18b88d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGMzNWEyNjgwM2ZkYWFkMTNlMGYzMjhkYjJiYzkwZTM2YjI0NjU5ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a","sha":"26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a"}],"sha":"c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/c35a26803fdaad13e0f328db2bc90e36b24659ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:04:57Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:04:57Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: mobile-responsive app shell, calendar, composer, channels and modals\n\nPostiz is desktop-first; at phone widths the fixed 80px rail + 260px channels\nsidebar + week grid + 580px preview pane + min-w-[600px] modals all overflow.\nUnder the existing `mobile:` breakpoint (max-1025px):\n\n- App shell: rail hidden behind a hamburger + slide-over drawer (same\n  Logo/TopMenu); topbar decluttered; content column stacks.\n- Calendar: channels panel becomes a full-width block above the calendar;\n  phones default to the List view on first visit (explicit choices kept);\n  filters lose fixed widths; post action icons are touch-visible.\n- Composer: full-bleed modal, preview pane hidden (close X moved into the\n  editor header), action bar wraps, Post Now is a visible button instead of\n  a hover flyout.\n- Modals: viewport-capped widths (stylesheet !important to beat the inline\n  style width), tighter padding; Add Channel grid drops to 2 columns.\n- Channel context menu clamps horizontally; analytics rail goes full-width\n  with visible inactive channels; media library grid 3-across, settings\n  overlay touch-visible, file input accepts gallery image/video types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8409e8ecb86311040cb9e700fb8997db7b3d79bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/8409e8ecb86311040cb9e700fb8997db7b3d79bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDI2MzgwYjNiNWU1ZGQ4ZTE1NGQ3ZGQxNGFhYzBlMWVhOTRmNDQwNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/a7f60bb435b2c039e2dc0cb7db6ea400461ae421","sha":"a7f60bb435b2c039e2dc0cb7db6ea400461ae421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/a7f60bb435b2c039e2dc0cb7db6ea400461ae421"}],"sha":"26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/26380b3b5e5dd8e154d7dd14aac0e1ea94f4404a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/a7f60bb435b2c039e2dc0cb7db6ea400461ae421/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:44:54Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:44:54Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"feat: honest post status badges, media reorder controls, IG JPEG auto-convert\n\n- Calendar items show a real publish status pill: Live (green) only when\n  actually pushed, Scheduled (blue), Not published (amber) for past-due\n  queued posts, Failed (red, with the error as tooltip), Draft. The edit\n  modal header shows the same status plus a \"View post\" link to the live\n  releaseURL.\n- Ship the post error field to the calendar/list clients (repository selects\n  + minify key map): the existing red \"!\" tooltip finally shows the reason.\n- Media picker: explicit move earlier/later arrows on each thumbnail (the\n  drag handle stays); order is the order platforms receive.\n- Instagram: convertToJPEG=true so the shared updateMedia pipeline converts\n  PNG uploads before publishing (IG rejects PNG with \"Media fetch failed\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b75d67b8f1d6a7b734f72a0ee0e3802e1e4c573c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/b75d67b8f1d6a7b734f72a0ee0e3802e1e4c573c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/sale