ad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/ef2b6ddc19e2f7b7a8be1c9069589c926e19a9e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:36:36Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:36:36Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"gmb: log accounts-list errors instead of silently showing \"no locations\"\n\nA Google-side error on /v1/accounts (quota, disabled API, ungranted\nbusiness.manage scope) produced an empty account list, which the UI renders\nas \"We couldn''t find any business locations\" - indistinguishable from a\ngenuinely empty account. Log the error body so the real cause is visible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54aa516057dc43d55484b2ce37b22ffe2515d942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/54aa516057dc43d55484b2ce37b22ffe2515d942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/ef2b6ddc19e2f7b7a8be1c9069589c926e19a9e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https: