thub.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/48eb56302cab450cd6916090d822d0b0fb07559e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:04:04Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:04:04Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: live-tested Facebook insights metrics + honest analytics empty state\n\nLive bisect against the real page (2026-07-17): page_fan_adds and the\nimpressions family return \"(#100) not a valid insights metric\";\npage_media_view, page_daily_follows_unique, page_video_views and\npage_post_engagements all return data (docs and reality disagree, so the\nlist is now the tested set). Restore post_reactions_by_type_total, which\ntested valid on a real post.\n\nAnalytics empty state: only claim \"this channel needs to be refreshed\"\nwhen the integration is actually flagged refreshNeeded; a healthy channel\nwith an empty period now says \"no analytics data yet\" instead of sending\nthe owner around the reconnect loop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59285adc863f886e14f4b5c7c6de5392fa8362e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/59285adc863f886e14f4b5c7c6de5392fa8362e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/48eb56302cab450cd6916090d822d0b0fb07559e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/48eb56302cab450cd6916090d822d0b0fb07559e","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDQ4ZWI1NjMwMmNhYjQ1MGNkNjkxNjA5MGQ4MjJkMGIwZmIwNzU1OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e","sha":"2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e"}],"sha":"48eb56302cab450cd6916090d822d0b0fb07559e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/48eb56302cab450cd6916090d822d0b0fb07559e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:26:54Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:26:54Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix: break the Facebook \"Refresh Channel\" loop + dead analytics metrics\n\nRoot cause: the reConnect flow dropped expiresIn, so a successful re-auth\nsaved a fresh page token but left tokenExpiration at its old, already-past\nvalue - the next analytics load re-flagged the channel forever.\n\n- Carry auth.expiresIn through the reConnect branch so re-auth actually\n  advances tokenExpiration (the loop breaker).\n- Flag/notify/disconnect only on the FIRST refresh failure; FB/IG have no\n  refresh grant and were spamming \"could not refresh\" on every page load.\n- refreshTokens sweep: continue (not return) so one failing channel no\n  longer aborts refresh for all others.\n- Facebook analytics: Meta removed the impressions family and\n  page_post_engagements on 2025-11-15; request live metrics\n  (page_media_view, page_daily_follows_unique, page_video_views,\n  page_fan_adds) on v23.0 via this.fetch so real errors surface instead\n  of rendering as an empty \"needs refresh\" state.\n- Post analytics: replace removed post_impressions_unique /\n  post_reactions_by_type_total with post_media_view.\n- handleErrors: match \"code\":490 exactly; the bare ''490'' substring was\n  misclassifying arbitrary errors (fbtrace ids) as expired tokens.\n- Instagram analytics: null-guard the second insights response, which\n  threw a TypeError whenever the call errored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"263b74e51d0596fe350e3b4f42b56180daac1ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/263b74e51d0596fe350e3b4f42b56180daac1ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKDJkYWJmOWY4Y2I5MGFlMDlkMzZhYzJiNGEyMWI4ZTdjMGIxMWZjM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48","sha":"a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48"}],"sha":"2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/2dabf9f8cb90ae09d36ac2b4a21b8e7c0b11fc3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:59:56Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:59:56Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"fix(youtube): drop unused youtubepartner scope for OAuth verification\n\nThe YouTube provider requested the youtubepartner content-owner scope but\nnever makes any onBehalfOfContentOwner / partner API calls. That scope is\nheavily scrutinized during Google OAuth app verification, so requesting an\nunused partner scope only risks rejection. The provider''s real calls\n(channels.list, videos.insert, thumbnails.set, youtubeAnalytics) are fully\ncovered by youtube.readonly, youtube.upload, youtube.force-ssl, youtube, and\nyt-analytics.readonly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2800b4ff379cffefe71712a4ad30ffcf86b7aae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/d2800b4ff379cffefe71712a4ad30ffcf86b7aae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commit/a0726ad67d73c474a653933aa6e2f410dfd96f48","node_id":"C_kwDOSzbBftoAKGEwNzI2YWQ2N2Q3M2M