nal LinkedIn provider requested the legacy r_basicprofile\nscope (no longer grantable to new apps) plus *_organization_* scopes that\nrequire the Community Management API.\n\n- Trim personal scopes to the modern set: openid, profile, w_member_social\n- Make the /v2/me (vanityName) call optional with a name/id fallback, since\n  it depended on r_basicprofile; connect now succeeds with OpenID-only scopes\n\nCompany-page posting (linkedin-page provider) is unchanged and remains gated\non Community Management API approval (separate dedicated app required).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34d36355c889ef10516a10a8c39ee195e8febd23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/34d36355c889ef10516a10a8c39ee195e8febd23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/54198f72c98d00da385ffb31f4e6129cf9244295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"html