ction deploy artifacts\n\n- docker-compose.salestrig.yaml: PROD compose that BUILDS the image from this repo''s\n  source (Dockerfile.dev) instead of pulling the upstream ghcr Postiz image, so all\n  Salestrig branding + Phase 4 features ship. Full stack: app + postgres + redis +\n  temporal (+ es + temporal-pg). env_file: .env.production.\n- docs/salestrig/DEPLOY.md: AWS EC2 (t3.large+) deploy guide — provision, install\n  Docker, configure .env.production (incl LIVE Stripe + OAuth at deploy time), build\n  & run, Caddy TLS + studio.salestrig.com DNS, AGPL source-availability, security\n  checklist, cost note.\n\nVerified earlier: /content-score HTTP 401 (mapped). All AI feature routes live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d4fe43de87d1188201ea5caf1d18e236bebc013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/4d4fe43de87d1188201ea5caf1d18e236bebc013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/e21a79f5d40d1654078ddd6be9948a7809c9bb21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://