nt_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:50:40Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"Salestrig feature: Content Confidence Score\n\n- OpenaiService.scoreContent(content, platform, brandVoice): structured (zod) scores\n  for overall/clarity/hook/cta/platformFit/brandVoice (0-100) + suggestions[].\n  Brand-voice-aware.\n- ContentScoreDto + /content-score POST controller; registered api.module.\n  Verified: nest build exit 0.\n- Frontend: (site)/confidence-score page + component (draft + platform chips -> AI ->\n  overall score ring + sub-score bars + suggestions) + nav entry (Score).\n\nAlso verified (headless, real OpenAI key): Repurpose + Launch Planner generate real,\nstructured, brand-voice-aware content. (test-ai.mjs, gitignored.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3f1ae91e674b78ee191371776288329e4d8f97e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/a3f1ae91e674b78ee191371776288329e4d8f97e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/bd14ace73f8b435d3a161dd17e0531f769facecc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git