06-06T15:22:40Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T15:22:40Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"Phase 4 #5: Assistant/VA approval workflow\n\n- Post.approvalStatus (new ApprovalStatus enum: IDEA/DRAFT/NEEDS_REVIEW/APPROVED,\n  default APPROVED so normal posts are unaffected) + index -> DB synced.\n- Approval module: repository (review queue = non-approved posts, org-scoped;\n  setApprovalStatus via updateMany for tenant safety) + service + controller\n  (/approvals GET queue, PUT /:postId). Registered database.module + api.module.\n  Verified: nest build exit 0; /approvals HTTP 401 (mapped).\n- Frontend: (site)/approvals review-queue page + component (status badges,\n  Approve / Needs review / Back to draft; parses Postiz JSON content for display)\n  + nav entry. Assistant invite uses existing team feature.\n\nPHASE 4 COMPLETE: #1 Brand Voice, #2 Content Pillars, #3 Repurposing,\n#4 Launch Planner, #5 VA approval workflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8590b21e65ab9d6fc2001a087a05e4c32515cb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/8590b21e65ab9d6fc2001a087a05e4c32515cb08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/commits/38a8cfd1628a389cf8aaef4934da6b80a022ea8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137478184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanfahad","id":137478184,"login":"jordanfahad","node_id":"U_kgDOCDHAKA