eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordanfahad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/commits/376773b4ebaf98e390c88b6f3d00aa263cc44d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:45:15Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:45:15Z","email":"jordan.fahad@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Fahad"},"message":"Salestrig Studio Phase 2: pricing & entitlements\n\n- Rewrite pricing.ts to Salestrig plan ladder (keys unchanged = stable enum):\n  STANDARD=Starter $15/$150, TEAM=Studio $20/$200, PRO=Growth $25/$250 (recommended),\n  ULTIMATE=Agency $49/$490. Annual = 2 months free. Entitlements (channels, posts,\n  AI images/videos, team, webhooks) set per spec; enforced server-side via this config.\n- Add planDisplay + planDisplayName(): central tier-key -> Salestrig name mapping.\n- Wire display names into billing UI (first.billing + main.billing) without touching\n  the enum-key logic used for checkout/Stripe lookup.\n- Add pricing.spec.ts (8 tests, all passing) + standalone jest.salestrig.config.cjs\n  (root jest.config.ts needs @nx/jest, unavailable here) + test:salestrig script.\n\nNote: Stripe products/prices auto-sync from pricing.ts (dynamic, keyed by tier);\nno manual price IDs needed -- only test keys in .env to run checkout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a971669b6b1b2064f398ff4c46b212c3b99d392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salestrig-studio/git/trees/2a971669b6b1b2064f398ff4c46b212c3b99d392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jordanfahad/salest