Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"quartzo","providerType":"User"},"email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:20:08.905Z","repositoryId":1261998919,"sha":"fdd6c30e3328afad7842a74f92c1fdfbb0f6f67b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"quartzo","providerType":"User"},"email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-01T01:09:14Z","committedDate":"2026-09-01T01:09:14Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"quartzo","providerType":"User"},"email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:20:08.905Z","repositoryId":1261998919,"sha":"cd37e52fb88a7715dee632c41d940aae63b88930"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"quartzo","providerType":"User"},"email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-01T00:59:16Z","committedDate":"2026-09-01T00:59:16Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"quartzo","providerType":"User"},"email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:20:08.905Z","repositoryId":1261998919,"sha":"d91d0c7b27a2aee80ff39ce0f3159a984020447a"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:20:08.905Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/82c1fe6d7058a92a01d6928f1114a19c7bff5413/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:01:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:01:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix(querysrv): fila de respostas com escritor próprio — depth ≥ 16 deixa de travar\n\nLer e escrever o mesmo socket na mesma goroutine acopla os dois sentidos: um\ncliente que ainda está enviando (e não leu as respostas) enche os buffers, a\nescrita trava, o loop de requests para e os dois lados morrem. Medido:\ntests/bench_client_split.py --depth 16 pendurava 5 min (22.447 B de resposta\n× 16 = 359 KB > 208 KB de buffer) — e travava também no Nim, que chega lá por\noutro caminho (o future completa depois do write).\n\nCorreção só no Go (Nim fora de escopo), sem camada de protocolo nova:\n\n- internal/querysrv/writer.go: frameWriter — fila de respostas por conexão +\n  goroutine de escrita própria (um writev por lote, mesmo ótimo do\n  Subscriber da replicação). Abaixo do teto o produtor nunca espera; acima\n  dele bloqueia e o backpressure é o do próprio socket (janela do transporte),\n  com memória limitada. Teto = política: EAVT_CLIENT_QUEUE_MAX (default\n  64 MiB, espelhando BacklogMaxBytes) + logWarn no primeiro bloqueio.\n- server.go: os handlers passam a receber *clientConn em vez de net.Conn —\n  toda resposta vai pela fila, então frames de handlers diferentes nunca se\n  intercalam; serve fecha o writer ao sair.\n- downstream.go: canal de entrega da resposta com buffer\n  (responseQueueSize=4), para o readerLoop — único leitor do link do\n  transactor — nunca depender do ritmo do cliente.\n\nTestes: TestServeKeepsReadingWhileClientIsSilent (705 requests enviados sem\nler = 558 KiB de respostas > buffers do kernel; morte lenta no código antigo)\n+ unitários do writer (framing, bloqueio no teto e destravamento, close\nlibera produtores).\n\nValidação: --depth 16 e --depth 64 completam (estabs 8.664 / 8.585 rows/s;\nantes: hang de 5 min) · go vet / go test ./... / -race verdes · carga real 50k\nsem regressão (empresas 43.879/s vs 43.833 do baseline; estabs 13.286 vs\n13.466) · nenhum backlog/markClosed na réplica · BenchmarkTxUpsertStack\n55,8 → 56,0 µs (ruído; A/B feito via stash do patch).\n\ndocs/perf-receita-carga.md: a seção \"depth ≥ 16\" passa de achado para\nresolvido-no-Go, com a pendência do Nim explícita; DEFERRED.md ganha a\nentrada em Resolvidos e o §Query server aponta a fila.","tree":{"sha":"3d984923b46e777e31fd0839047aefea45d22ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/3d984923b46e777e31fd0839047aefea45d22ee5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/82c1fe6d7058a92a01d6928f1114a19c7bff5413","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/82c1fe6d7058a92a01d6928f1114a19c7bff5413","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDgyYzFmZTZkNzA1OGE5MmEwMWQ2OTI4ZjExMTRhMTljN2JmZjU0MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f","sha":"05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f"}],"sha":"82c1fe6d7058a92a01d6928f1114a19c7bff5413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/82c1fe6d7058a92a01d6928f1114a19c7bff5413"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:20:38Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:20:38Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"doc(perf): depth ≥ 16 trava nas DUAS stacks — é problema de protocolo, não de goroutines\n\nMedido agora: --depth 16 com batch 500 trava também no Nim (timeout de 180 s,\nmesmo estágio estabs), então a doc, que atribuía o travamento ao Go, estava\nerrada. Corpo do diagnóstico por stack:\n\n- Go: serve faz ReadFrame → forward → WriteFrame na mesma goroutine — a\n  escrita presa impede a leitura de novos requests.\n- Nim: já separa o loop de requests do readerLoop, mas request() fica em\n  await fut (downstream.nim:240) e o future só completa DEPOIS de\n  writeFrameAsync(body) (131,136) — escrita presa = leitura parada.\n\nConclusão: duas tasks (leitor/escritor) são a base, mas não bastam — sem teto\nna fila de respostas troca-se deadlock por memória sem limite, e o leitor\nprecisa estar desacoplado da entrega. O padrão correto já existe no repo (o\nSubscriber da replicação: fila + go s.drain() + BacklogMaxBytes = 64 MiB);\npara o lado de cliente o teto é janela/créditos.","tree":{"sha":"fe9833e06bfc5d1c51bba5b1a902650cb7bf8e0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/fe9833e06bfc5d1c51bba5b1a902650cb7bf8e0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDA1ZDI3OGUwYmQxMGFkZTIyNWUyNGJjZjY4M2JlM2ZjYTE1YzkwM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a","sha":"1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a"}],"sha":"05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/05d278e0bd10ade225e24bcf683be3fca15c903f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:09:19Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:09:19Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix(gc): passe de GC sai do e.mu — escritas param de esperar blobstore\n\nadmin gc/gc-dry seguravam e.mu durante o GcFull inteiro (listar roots, ler\ncada root mantido, list completo de blobs, deletes) e o auto-GC pós-flush\nrodava dentro de PublishFlush, chamado por runFlush com o lock: todo passe\nparava a aplicação de tx para operação que é só leitura de blobstore e\nremoção de arquivo imutável.\n\nA garantia que o lock dava era \"nenhum publish durante o passe\" — e publish\nacontece em um lugar só. Agora admin gc e auto-GC enfileiram no runner\nsingle-flight de flush/GC (requestGc/runGC); como o publish também roda ali,\no conjunto de roots fica congelado por construção e as escritas seguem.\n\n- OnFlushPublish só faz broadcast; runFlush enfileira o auto-GC logo após o\n  publish (fire-and-forget com coalescing; era síncrono e sob o lock).\n- Erro do auto-GC passa a ser logado (era _, _ =) + retry no próximo passe.\n- runGC barra ReadOnly / PS nil / FlushActive (nunca sobrepõe kv.Flush()).\n- Runner: um passe + um flush por iteração (flushWant), com o passe auto\n  consumido na mesma iteração do publish que o gerou — senão todo publish\n  reenfileira e o runner nunca idle (livelock).\n- Close() drena o runner antes de fechar o KV.\n- pagestore: contrato do caller documentado (congelar o conjunto de roots por\n  serialização, não por lock global).\n\nTestes: TestGcRunsOffEngineLock (segura e.mu durante o passe e exige o\nrelatório — falharia sob o design antigo), TestAdminGcDryResponse, e\nTestAutoGCPostFlush migrado para o caminho de produção (flushSync). go vet\nlimpo, go test ./... e -race verdes. Carga real 50k com admin gc durante a\ncorrida: gc 21,5 ms / gc-dry 3,2 ms e estabs 13,9k/s (baseline 13,5k/s),\nsem degradação e sem erros no log.","tree":{"sha":"42b9b0f7e93b46f7b693a4577153f7776bf53f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/42b9b0f7e93b46f7b693a4577153f7776bf53f96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDFiYzk4NDFjYWE2ZDc3MzU0MmFhOGRkZjBlZTE0NzIzMjY2NTg5NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca","sha":"f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca"}],"sha":"1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1bc9841caa6d773542aa8ddf0ee147232665894a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:09:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:09:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"perf: instrumenta quem limita o throughput e a distribuição de CPU por processo\n\n- tests/bench_client_split.py: decompõe o pipeline do harness em fases do\n  cliente (read = inflate+CSV · build · to_wire · pack · send · recv =\n  round-trip do servidor · unpack) com o CPU real de cada processo;\n  --data-dir lê os zips REAIS da Receita, --depth N pipelina batches em voo,\n  --clients N roda processos-cliente paralelos.\n- tests/bench_cpu_dist.py: amostra /proc/<pid>/stat a cada 50 ms em\n  transactor, query e cliente durante a carga (CPU-s, % de 1 núcleo com pico\n  por janela, fatia do total); --cmd2 roda um segundo cliente em paralelo\n  para medir o headroom do servidor.\n- loader Go: flag -max-simples (antes 0 = ilimitado, tornava o A/B\n  impossível) e linhas [t] com rows/s por estágio, espelhando o loader\n  Python.\n- docs/perf-receita-carga.md: reprodução da referência oficial com dados\n  reais nesta máquina (Go dentro de −1…−5% da doc) e três seções novas:\n  \"Quem limita o throughput\" — no serial o wall é ~metade round-trip /\n  ~metade cliente Python (Go 59,6% cliente), depth 8 dá +45–61% e 2 clientes\n  +27%; \"Cliente Go × Python\" — matriz 2×2 com contagens idênticas, o\n  cliente Go vale +44% no servidor Go e a extrapolação cai de 4,1 h → 2,9 h;\n  \"Ocupação de CPU — configuração real, tudo Go\" — transactor 106%, query\n  69%, cliente 23% de um núcleo (2 cores de 12 em uso): a restrição é o\n  caminho serial de tx + o hop do query (~22% do tempo), não o cliente nem a\n  máquina.","tree":{"sha":"456452aeedc166c136ffaf38e25838a6fc035e57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/456452aeedc166c136ffaf38e25838a6fc035e57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGYzZDgxNWNjN2NlYTVjZDViYzJjM2EwMjEyYWNjMGRkZjRlYWQ5Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656","sha":"979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656"}],"sha":"f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f3d815cc7cea5cd5bc2c3a0212acc0ddf4ead9ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:05:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:05:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"perf: latência do upsert — writev + drain coalesced (82,6 → 57,1 µs no 2-hop)\n\nA sonda upsert(tx) era 1,55× mais lenta que o Nim. Diagnóstico com\nbenchmarks pontuais (EAVT_PROBE_SOCK apontando para o transactor [1 hop] ou\no query server [2 hops]) e profiles (EAVT_PPROF / EAVT_PPROF_QUERY):\n\n- o custo NÃO é compute (execTx ≈ 4,5 µs) — é latência de round-trip\n  (espera em syscall ~50%, futex ~12%);\n- 1-hop o Go já emparelha com o Nim (22,3 vs 20,5 µs); o gap está no hop do\n  query server (57,1 vs 40,3 µs).\n\nCorreções:\n- downstream.WriteFrame e client.sendFrame escrevem frame num ÚNICO writev\n  (antes: 2 syscalls, o leitor acordava 2× por frame — hdr e corpo);\n- Subscriber.drain escreve toda a fila num writev (WAL + resposta juntos na\n  mesma escrita → um wakeup de leitura em vez de dois).\n\n2-hop: 82,6 → 57,1 µs (-31%).\n\nTentativas descartadas (medidas): resposta numa conexão dedicada\n(RequestSync) e \"flush do WAL imediato na fila\" — ambos quebram a ordem\n[WAL][resposta] e o read-your-writes (parity da stack quebrou). O gap\nresidual (+15 µs) é custo de handoff do runtime Go, não compute.\n\nNovo: benchmarks BenchmarkTxUpsert{,UDS,Stack,Remote} e\nBenchmarkAdminForwardRemote (EAVT_PROBE_SOCK), flags de pprof\n(EAVT_PPROF / EAVT_PPROF_QUERY). docs/perf-receita-carga.md ganha a\nmedição de hop-a-hop e as taxas re-roneadas; DEFERRED registra o estado.\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (22 pacotes); restart_recovery, crash2,\nparity_repl, parity_stack, parity_front todos OK.","tree":{"sha":"5bf903349ceb4d7f88f99f42ad97bfca1e2bde37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/5bf903349ceb4d7f88f99f42ad97bfca1e2bde37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDk3OWU2YWVmYjJjZDRkYjBiOThlNjM5NGViODEwNzY2MDMyOTM2NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9","sha":"78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9"}],"sha":"979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/979e6aefb2cd4db0b98e6394eb81076603293656"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:17:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:17:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"perf: benchmark de carga Go equivalente à referência Nim + docs\n\n- scripts/start.sh|stop.sh: EAVT_STACK=nim|go seleciona os binários (um\n  mesmo harness dá o A/B da stack); a guarda ulimit -v 3GB agora vale só\n  para o Nim (o Go fica abaixo dela e precisa de folga para as arenas).\n- tests/bench_receita_hydrated.py: --stack {nim,go} (default nim) exporta\n  EAVT_STACK e grava em meta.stack.\n\ndocs/perf-receita-carga.md ganha a seção \"Referência Go (port, 2026-10-03)\"\ncom a mesma metodologia (mesmo cliente Python, mesmos tamanhos 10k/25k/50k,\nmesmo host):\n\n  taxas @25k   empresas 27.102/s (−4%) · estabs 7.450/s (+20%)\n               simples 29.070/s (−3%) · socios 14.232/s (+22%)\n  probes p50   eid_lookup 36,7µs (2,1×) · attr_by_eid 41,3µs (2,6×)\n               attrs_x3 85,8µs (2,6×) · upsert 80,6µs (1,55× mais lento)\n  extrapolação TOTAL ≈ 4,1 h (Nim: 4,9 h)\n\nJSON: /tmp/opencode/receita_bench/go.json.","tree":{"sha":"63ffacccf2dc6d2ee4fac39cf5fda8b549d49fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/63ffacccf2dc6d2ee4fac39cf5fda8b549d49fb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDc4NTkxZDNhZWVjZTZlZDhjZDQ1YjY1NjdkNWIxNzM2NDAxODMyZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6","sha":"f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6"}],"sha":"78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/78591d3aeece6ed8cd45b6567d5b1736401832d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:03:28Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:03:28Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"replication: credita o backlog ao escrever (bug achado na carga real)\n\nO Subscriber incrementava backlog por byte enfileirado e nunca decrementava\nao escrever — acumulado total, não pendente. Qualquer carga >64 MiB de\ntráfego de replicação fechava o subscriber (BacklogMaxBytes) e o cliente\nrecebia \"transactor disconnected\". Reproduzido com load_receita Go em\n50k empresas+estabs+socios.\n\nO Nim credita o frame ao escrevê-lo (sendFrame: backlogBytes -= frame.len,\nclamp em 0). O Go agora faz o mesmo no drain().\n\nTeste: TestBacklogCreditsOnWrite — 70 MiB de tráfego via net.Pipe; sem o\ncrédito falha (backlog=67 MiB > 64 MiB → fechado), com crédito passa.\n\nValidado: carga de 50k empresas + 50k estabs + 50k socios (1,5M datoms) em\n8,5s sem desconexão; go test -race ./... verde (23 pacotes).","tree":{"sha":"69ce05a49c5e4e4faef44e456a38b1aba91fcd27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/69ce05a49c5e4e4faef44e456a38b1aba91fcd27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGY2MTI2ZjhmNjc2M2U3ZWUxOTA4NzYwMzYwZDNlYjRmNTcxZDVjZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7fa652d24674e17ea45ec8187ce4df78ce8723e5","sha":"7fa652d24674e17ea45ec8187ce4df78ce8723e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7fa652d24674e17ea45ec8187ce4df78ce8723e5"}],"sha":"f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f6126f8f6763e7ee1908760360d3eb4f571d5ce6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7fa652d24674e17ea45ec8187ce4df78ce8723e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:57:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:57:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"loader: aceita o layout real dos zips (sem __) + help explícito do --max-estabs\n\nO findZip do loader herdava o padrão `Name__*.zip` do OCaml/Python, mas o\ndiretório real de dados tem `Name.zip` — toda a carga falharia com \"no zip\nmatching\". Agora tenta, em ordem: Name.zip, Name__*.zip, Name*.zip.\n\n--max-estabs deixa explícito no help que 0 = só o primeiro lote (comportamento\nde referência usado pelos benchmarks) e que um valor grande é preciso para\ncarga completa.\n\nDEFERRED: a nota do cache do pagestore estava desatualizada (a arena plana\nFlatLeaf/FlatLeafKV já existe).\n\nSmoke com dados reais (/.../receita_zip): 6 lookups (1359 cnaes, 5572\nmunicipios), 2000 empresas, 2000 estabs, 2001 socios em 0,4s; queries de\ncnpj/razao_social/cnae/municipio corretas.","tree":{"sha":"8e6961d89eec972524b4c87cbafe54c7e35dc02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/8e6961d89eec972524b4c87cbafe54c7e35dc02d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/7fa652d24674e17ea45ec8187ce4df78ce8723e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VX