Nim usa symval \":ranges\" como símbolo).\n\nCorrigido para cabeças keyword (o dispatch do VM Go) + isRangesMarker que\naceita Keyword(\"ranges\") e Symbol(\":ranges\").\n\nTeste TestScannerIterateSpecialForm cobre o caminho simples, o :ranges e o\niterador esgotado. DEFERRED: entrada do scheme VM e a de edn maps/sets\n(mesma rejeição do Nim, já coberta por TestRejectMapsAndSets) atualizadas.\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (22 pacotes); restart_recovery, parity_repl,\nparity_front e parity_stack todos OK (52 linhas).","tree":{"sha":"c942daf2312321cce4a597f18b0570c776183eb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/c942daf2312321cce4a597f18b0570c776183eb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/93c8514ced0213f782704b1f8e7c84ddd1a69b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/93c8514ced0213f782704b1f8e7c84ddd1a69b4f","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDkzYzg1MTRjZWQwMjEzZjc4MjcwNGIxZjhlN2M4NGRkZDFhNjliNGY"