 valida a paridade byte-a-byte de storage+execução\n(tipos float, erros, dump, kv), não só de formato de REPL.\n\nResultado: STACK PARITY OK (52 linhas).\nDEFERRED: item de paridade A/B marcado como resolvido (registra os três\nharnesses: repl, front, stack).","tree":{"sha":"595ac8e1f3689f6fa2c0860e222a7712fc2cf578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/595ac8e1f3689f6fa2c0860e222a7712fc2cf578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/946076e80d6fe7d697dee8a0750041fcbde13850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/946076e80d6fe7d697dee8a0750041fcbde13850","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDk0NjA3NmU4MGQ2ZmU3ZDY5N2RlZThhMDc1MDA0MWZjYmRlMTM4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf","sha":"7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf"}],"sha":"946076e80d6fe7d697dee8a0750041fcbde13850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/946076e80d6fe7d697dee8a0750041fcbde13850"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:34:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:34:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: drain do flush fora do lock + fatiado em 256 KiB (fairness)\n\nAchado: o CaptureFlush do Go incluía o materializar do ladder congelado\n(DrainSorted/DrainKvSorted) e rodava DENTRO de e.mu — todo o drain travava\nos writes do transactor.\n\n- CaptureFlush agora só congela (freeze + seal + BaseTrees, curto, sob lock)\n  e estampa as runs em FlushBatch.captured.\n- PrepareFlush (sempre fora do lock) chama drainBatch: o k-way drain roda\n  off-lock, com runtime.Gosched() a cada DrainChunkBytes (256 KiB, igual ao\n  Nim) e no fim de cada CF; MaxT calculado lá e as referências das runs\n  soltas em seguida. Imutabilidade das runs após freeze torna o acesso\n  off-lock seguro enquanto writers seguem na escada ativa.\n- internal/memtable: DrainSorted/DrainKvSorted ganham o parâmetro yield\n  (callback a cada 256 KiB emitido); DrainChunkBytes exportado.\n\nTestes: TestDrainSortedYields (yield chamado >= total/DrainChunkBytes, nil\nyield ok). go test -race ./... verde (22 pacotes); restart_recovery OK;\nE2E unique OK; parity_repl/parity_front 52 linhas.","tree":{"sha":"1251d28086d74ecdaa8149e5fcefe5a7f1c0cb75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/1251d28086d74ecdaa8149e5fcefe5a7f1c0cb75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7ed69b785d9e07a6d0fe217ff81e6ac8fd16eeaf","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDdlZDY5Yjc4NWQ5ZTA3YTZkMGZlMjE3ZmY4MWU2YWM4ZmQxNmVlYWY","parents":[{"html_url"