jectID usa-o: os bytes do payload\n  ficam verbatim e o custo vira O(id) em vez de O(payload) com re-ordenação\n  de chaves. Testes: TestInjectTopPair{RoundTrip,TwiceAndPromotion,\n  RejectsNonMap}.\n- parity_session: a query com predicado em padrão posterior divergiu das\n  fronts APÓS a blindagem do planner — as duas concordavam num plano\n  quebrado (back: \"unbound: n\") e agora o Go corrige. A linha virou\n  [:find ?a :where [?e :person/age ?a] [(> ?a 20)]] (mesmo predicado,\n  forma não-patológica); o caso original passou para\n  TestBlindFirstTinyCardinality (caso \"predicate-in-later-pattern\").\n- DEFERRED: itens de framing/frames e o mapa por arquivo atualizados.\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (22 pacotes); parity_repl e parity_front 52 linhas.","tree":{"sha":"b90c3e4ff86d2697f5f2a0284df4d0839fdb5da8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/b90c3e4ff86d2697f5f2a0284df4d0839fdb5da8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/db31d9bdffb9351c389b6716ae5db640ffef8ad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h