\ninternal/pagestore/flat.go: cada folha decodificada vira uma arena + offsets\nn+1 (uma alocação por troca de folha em vez de uma por chave — o churn do\nNim era ~270µs/seek) com Key(i)/Pair(i) em vista zero-copy; páginas são\nimutáveis sob COW e o GC mantém a arena viva.\n\n- cache: entrada guarda *FlatLeaf/*FlatLeafKV; Bytes() conta arena+offs.\n- loadLeafKeys/loadLeafPairs retornam as formas planas; scans de prefixo e\n  GetKeysInPrefix/GetPairsInPrefix iteram .Count()/.Key(i)/.Pair(i).\n- cursor: leaf/leafKV no lugar de [][]byte (Count() nil-safe).\n- DeserializePage/DeserializePageKv ficam para o caminho de escrita\n  (mergeLeaf, validação de página).\n\nTestes: TestFlatLeafRoundTrip, TestFlatLeafKvRoundTrip. go test -race ./...\nverde (22 pacotes); restart_recovery OK; E2E unique OK.","tree":{"sha":"ff14ec291a83d8cccd385f7c674e17fee496bdb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/ff14ec291a83d8cccd385f7c674e17fee496bdb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/4509cb5959acce5206f71f1a977db770b22d2468","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/4509cb5959acce5206f71f1a977db770b22d2468","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDQ1MDljYjU5NTlhY2NlNTIwNmY3MWYxYTk3N2RiNzcwYjIyZDI0Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b","sha":"52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b"}],"sha":"4509cb5959acce5206f71f1a977db770b22d2468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4509cb5959acce5206f71f1a977db770b22d2468"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:58:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:58:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: testes E2E de replicação, concorrência do transactor e auto-GC\n\n- internal/e2e.TestReplicationE2E: transactor real num socket unix +\n  Gateway/réplica consumindo o stream de replicação; tx volátil (o WAL é\n  descarregado pela resposta encaminhada) e pós-flush (adoção de root).\n- internal/e2e.TestTransactorConcurrentClients: 8 conexões × 25 txs em\n  paralelo sob -race; todos os datoms presentes.\n- internal/transactor.TestAutoGCPostFlush: 5 flushes, roots ≤ GcMaxRootCount.\n\nShutdown limpo: downstream.Conn ganhou stop/evDone/closeOnce; eventLoop\ndrena antes de retornar; Gateway.Close() fecha o downstream e espera o apply\nem voo antes de liberar a réplica (evita corrida de teardown com -race).\nGateway.Forward expõe o envio pela conexão de replicação; pagestore.Store\nganhou ListRoots().\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (22 pacotes); restart_recovery OK; parity_repl 51 linhas.","tree":{"sha":"f68b653c9bee565cdfaa1e1c3ce15ae5275f8ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/f68b653c9bee565cdfaa1e1c3ce15ae5275f8ecd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDUyZjA5MDg2ZTVjM2NiYzg5ZjljNTI0NzI2ZGMxN2NhMjU3MjYyOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d","sha":"a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d"}],"sha":"52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/52f09086e5c3cbc89f9c524726dc17ca2572628b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:29:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:29:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: snapshot do WAL consistente (sem leitura torn / ordem garantida)\n\nwal.SnapshotLocked captura sob o lock do writer: drena o buffer, inclui todos\nos segmentos do disco EXCETO o corrente, e lê os bytes do corrente sob o\nlock. O transactor faz Register+SendSnapshot dentro do mesmo lock, então um\nOnWal concorrente não escapa na frente do snapshot na fila do subscriber.\n\nFix também inclui os segmentos de sessões anteriores: no restart o Attach\nabre um segmento novo, e os datoms de um crash só vivem no segmento antigo\n(era isso que quebrava a recuperação do Bob). listSegments(jdir) extraído.\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (21 pacotes); restart_recovery OK; E2E unique e S3 OK.","tree":{"sha":"90ea214b57e65229cacd35a2a13dd2da20963d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/90ea214b57e65229cacd35a2a13dd2da20963d3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGE0YzA0MTY3M2E1YzBmZTE0MDhlMTk5MWMzNTdiNjViOWYwNzI0NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c","sha":"8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c"}],"sha":"a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4c041673a5c0fe1408e1991c357b65b9f07244d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:26:25Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:26:25Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: desacopla leitura de eventos de replicação da aplicação\n\nO reader do downstream chamava onEvent sincronamente; um ApplySnapshot grande\n(leitura dos segmentos selados) bloqueava a leitura do socket. Agora o reader\nenfileira os eventos (evCh, buffer 256) e uma goroutine eventLoop aplica em\nordem — o reader segue drenando o socket. A fila é limpa no disconnect (o\nreconnect re-snapshota).\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (21 pacotes); restart_recovery OK; E2E tx/query\n(unique) OK.","tree":{"sha":"05903e235e986fb9778b663c172a85c37d24a621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/05903e235e986fb9778b663c172a85c37d24a621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDhmZGE5OTBhYjg3NjllNTU5YWJkZTdkNzAzZjI0ZmFmMzAzOWI5N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f","sha":"e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f"}],"sha":"8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8fda990ab8769e559abde7d703f24faf3039b97c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:25:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:25:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: blinda o planner contra blind-first com cardinalidade minúscula\n\nCom total_eavt minúsculo a busca de custo escolhia uma var \"blind\" (sem\nclause ativa) primeiro — p.ex. [m n e] para\n[:find ?n ?m :where [?e :person/name ?n] [?e :person/email ?m]] — e os\nscanners ficavam sem bind das vars de valor → query vazia.\n\nFix: mantém a busca idêntica à referência (preserva golden wire/explain\n25/25) e, se o plano escolhido for insoundável (alguma var de OrderedVars\nsem scanner no seu depth), re-roda a busca preferindo passos não-blind.\n`exploreOrderingDepth` ganhou a flag preferNonBlind.\n\nTestes: TestBlindFirstTinyCardinality (planner) e TestDatalogQueryTinyStore\n(E2E engine: store de 1 datom, join retorna linha). go test -race ./...\nverde (21 pacotes); parity_repl e parity_front 51 linhas.","tree":{"sha":"6013eac793901d7e3c17647a4bd37e06de442085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/6013eac793901d7e3c17647a4bd37e06de442085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGUzNzQxZThmY2EyZjk2Yjg2MWJjMzlkNzhhZjAyYzlkNzQ5OGM2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/fa73bcfecdb4be57fad5106e964808fdbee6b965","sha":"fa73bcfecdb4be57fad5106e964808fdbee6b965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fa73bcfecdb4be57fad5106e964808fdbee6b965"}],"sha":"e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e3741e8fca2f96b861bc39d78af02c9d7498c63f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fa73bcfecdb4be57fad5106e964808fdbee6b965/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:40:05Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:40:05Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix: não chama time.Now() no decode quando perf está off\n\nexecTx/execScheme liam o relógio incondicionalmente (só o AddDecode era\nguardado). Agora o time.Now() também fica atrás de perf.Enabled(), então o\ncusto de medição (clock reads) não é pago com EAVT_PERF_COUNTERS desligado.","tree":{"sha":"a63a7a784000a8353bf66a7db975f47c6521a3c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/a63a7a784000a8353bf66a7db975f47c6521a3c4"}