lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/c80f4344855afaac49d3f3c1f72080f3a67460c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:48:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:48:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: buckets de nanossegundos + eavtScanDiag\n\nGate EAVT_PERF_COUNTERS (default off, como perfCounters=false):\n- internal/perf: flag de habilitação (counts sempre; clock reads só quando on).\n- internal/engine (QueryStore): lookupAttr/typeCheck/encode, retractScan +\n  prefix/seek/apply/retracted/scans, buildEntries, batchWrite, lookup/\n  lookupScan, execWall, decode; SavePerf() + AddDecode.\n- internal/eavt: scan open/seek/iterate ns + ScanPerf; eavtScanDiag\n  (EAVT_SCAN_DIAG=true) conta scans cf!=0 e loga a cada 2000 (calls/seekUs/\n  iterUs/keys); ScanDiag().\n- internal/kvstore: batchWrite journal/memtable/total ns + WritePerf.\n- transactor: decode timing em execTx/execScheme; admin `perf`/`perf-reset`\n  (renderiza os três blocos do Nim); REPL `.perf`/`.perf-reset` (help\n  inalterado para parity).\n\nTestes: TestPerfBuckets (transactor), TestScanDiagCounts (eavt). E2E com\nEAVT_PERF_COUNTERS=true: `.perf` mostra saveWithT/scanPrefix/batchWrite.\ngo test -race ./... verde (21 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"36803448aea6ebd12c8c75673d67892c8f69531d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/36803448aea6ebd12c8c75673d67892c8f69531d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/c80f4344855afaac49d3f3c1f72080f3a67460c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/c80f4344855afaac49d3f3c1f72080f3a67460c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGM4MGY0MzQ0ODU1YWZhYWM0OWQzZjNjMWY3MjA4MGYzYTY3NDYwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655","sha":"733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655"}],"sha":"c80f4344855afaac49d3f3c1f72080f3a67460c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/c80f4344855afaac49d3f3c1f72080f3a67460c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:37:23Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:37:23Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: backend S3 do blobstore (+ Journal)\n\n- internal/blobstore: interface BlobStore + Close; factory Open(file|s3).\n- S3BlobStore + SigV4 (crypto/hmac+sha256 da stdlib): put/putAt/get/delete/\n  list (ListObjectsV2 paginado), putRoot/getRoot/listRoots/deleteRoot; path\n  style/virtual host; prefix; read-only guard. Port fiel de\n  nim_blobstore/s3 (incluindo assinar sempre a URI path-style).\n- Journal (primitiva sequencial do page store) portada como tipo testado,\n  não fiada ao commit do page store (WAL+journal legacy já cobrem).\n- Wire: pagestore.Store.blobs vira blobstore.BlobStore; pagestore.Open\n  seleciona o backend; kvstore/replica/transactor e query server carregam\n  as chaves S3 (EAVT_BACKEND + EAVT_S3_* / flags --backend --s3-*). O WAL\n  continua local; blobs vão para o bucket.\n\nTestes: vetor de signing key da AWS, HMAC-SHA256, SHA-256, round-trip S3\ncontra S3 in-process (blobstore + pagestore), journal, factory, read-only e\nconfig faltando. E2E transactor+query ambos em S3 (write->flush->query Alice)\nOK. go test -race ./... verde (21 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"2003658e6017dd16819c16725319ba03011f2eae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/2003658e6017dd16819c16725319ba03011f2eae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/733cda219d804dee04c140b46540fd1ecc2ee655","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDczM2NkYTIxOWQ4MDRkZWUwNGMxNDBiNDY1NDBmZDFlY2MyZWU2NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290","sha":"9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290","url":"http