Go\n  (eavt-sql-query-front-go, golden em go/testdata/golden/) no lugar do\n  OCaml; item de dívida marcado como resolvido.\n- comentários (eavt_query_nim/server.nim, connection.nim, tools/dump_wire.nim,\n  go/internal/{front,datalog,client,loader}) sem referências ao tree apagado.\n\ngo test -race ./... verde (20 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK;\nbash -n dev.sh OK.","tree":{"sha":"8249ee3a1ac91030677010b5194cdf9f419f6fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/8249ee3a1ac91030677010b5194cdf9f419f6fba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDljNTg4Yzc0Y2U0MWU3MWIzYjE3MWRhNzM4MzY3NDVlZWM3MmUyOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85","sha":"fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85"}],"sha":"9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9c588c74ce41e71b3b171da73836745eec72e290"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:23:08Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:23:08Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: loader de receita (load_receita)\n\n- internal/loader: porta de ocaml/load/load_receita.ml — schema como tx-data\n  (eids 1000+i), lookups/empresas/simples/estabelecimentos/socios em lotes\n  de tx pelo socket do query server, com tempids negativos + upsert de attr\n  unico para get-or-create. Le os zips (archive/zip + encoding/csv com '';''),\n  converte latin-1->UTF-8, e reproduz a chave de socio (cpf visivel + 6\n  chars base64url de sha256 do nome normalizado).\n- cmd/eavt-load: CLI (--n/--data-dir/--sock/--batch/--demo-only/--skip-*/\n  --max-estabs/--max-socios) + demo probe por datalog.\n- client.TxData: envia ops de tx e propaga erro (Tx dobra erro em string).\n- interface loader.Txer para testes com fake.\n\nnimble dist passa a buildar build/eavt-sql-load-go.\n\nTestes: zips sinteticos + fake Txer (TestLoadLookupsSynthetic,\nTestLoadEmpresasSynthetic, TestSocioChaveStable, TestLatin1ToUTF8). E2E\ncontra a stack Go: schema+lookups+empresa+simples+estab+socio carregam e as\nqueries retornam 12345678/ACME LTDA, cnpj completo, JOHN DOE, optante.\ngo test -race ./... verde (20 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"28b8097e9a64235c67df905d4ac474e23fed8879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/28b8097e9a64235c67df905d4ac474e23fed8879"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGZjNDhlMWE0NzE4MjI1MGZiNzM1Y2MzMGFmY2EwZDM0ZWYyZTNiODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c","sha":"110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c"}],"sha":"fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fc48e1a47182250fb735cc30afca0d34ef2e3b85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:29:14Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:29:14Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: corrige keyword-como-valor + implementa admin tree\n\n- SlotToValueForType/slotToPackedValue agora recebem o symtab: um slot\n  TskKw guarda só o símbolo internado, então keyword usada como valor de\n  datom codificava \"\" (o Nim tem o mesmo bug latente). O Go resolve o nome\n  via symtab (divergência deliberada). Regressão:\n  TestKeywordValueEncodesName.\n- admin `tree`: o REPL já anunciava `.tree`, mas o handler respondia\n  `unknown`. Agora reporta por CF (height/leaves/root). `status` segue\n  igual ao Nim; o detalhe fica em `.stats`.\n\nE2E: `:person/status :active` volta `active`; `.tree` lista cf=0..3.\ngo test -race ./... verde (19 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"5ea836b388255f45beda2d079943f7087a65139e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/5ea836b388255f45beda2d079943f7087a65139e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDExMGE4ZTZlNWRlMWVmNGM3ZWJmZjYxY2E4MWU5YTFhYzIyYWQ0MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a","sha":"a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a"}],"sha":"110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/110a8e6e5de1ef4c7ebff61ca81e9a1ac22ad42c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:23:44Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:23:44Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: não usa cursor hidratado em queries as-of/history\n\nO modo hid do MergedCursor guarda só chaves ATIVAS; um seek CF-0 ancorado\nnum eid hidratado serviria o estado atual e esconderia versões antigas\nnecessárias para reconstruir o valor as-of. Agora EngineOps.OpenCursor\nrecebe `history bool`; QueryStore.OpenCursor só seta mc.Hyd para CF-0\nquando !history, e scannerOpen passa `history || HasAsOfTx`.\n\nMais estrito que o Nim (lá o cursor hidratado também é active-only).\nRegressão: TestOpenCursorHydGuard.\ngo test -race ./... verde (19 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"4a055f8ff4f43d5b94190efad362074c04094b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/4a055f8ff4f43d5b94190efad362074c04094b23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGEyYWI0NjljZmNjZWNlMTAwOWQwZWE0OGZhZjgyNWNlYjcwYmZkMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859","sha":"a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859"}],"sha":"a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a2ab469cfccece1009d0ea48faf825ceb70bfd2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:04:17Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:04:17Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: logutil + memledger + contadores/stats (observabilidade)\n\n- internal/logutil: logger do Nim (DEBUG<INFO<WARN<ERROR, threshold\n  EAVT_LOG, linha timestamped no stderr, concorrência-safe). WAL e flush\n  passam a logar por ele.\n- transactor: memledger periódico (10s, EAVT_MEM_LEDGER!=0) logando RSS\n  (/proc/self/statm) + hyd bytes/eids + anchor bytes/eids + memtable bytes\n  + runs ativos/draining + gen + flushActive (instrumento M9 no Go).\n- contadores de volume: eavt scans/scanKeys, engine saves/lookups/execs,\n  kvstore batchWrites/writtenKeys; expostos por admin `.stats` e zerados\n  por `.stats-reset`. `.help` fica idêntico ao Nim (parity).\n- memtable.RunCounts; StopOnce no Close do transactor (mata o memledger\n  sem corrida).\n\nTestes: TestEngineCounters, TestWriteCounters, TestScanStats, e o\nTestAutoFlushOnThreshold agora checa o texto do stats. go test -race ./...\nverde (19 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; restart_recovery OK.","tree":{"sha":"50b11bd81586d12ceb0a65ee84ef65ff8e1089e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/50b11bd81586d12ceb0a65ee84ef65ff8e1089e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGEwZGNlNWIyMzg5ZDU5ODlmMzllZmJiYWYzN2EzZGQyMDVlMDM4NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14","sha":"de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14"}],"sha":"a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a0dce5b2389d5989f39efbbaf37a3dd205e03859"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:51:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:51:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: lê EAVT_FLUSH_THRESHOLD (paridade com o Nim)\n\nO transactor Go ignorava a env de threshold de flush do Nim; agora\nNewEngine lê EAVT_FLUSH_THRESHOLD e a aplica em Config.FlushThreshold.\nValidado E2E: com threshold=1, writes disparam o auto-flush (1 root) e a\nquery pós-flush segue retornando os dados (lidos do pagestore/réplica).","tree":{"sha":"eee12589f250e13b4edf08ae5c71625e7f7621e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/eee12589f250e13b4edf08ae5c71625e7f7621e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGRlODY2ZmYzMzBjMGRjNmQzMWM2N2UwY2I1NmZkMTZhZjQyYmVhMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881","sha":"19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881"}],"sha":"de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/de866ff330c0dc6d31c67e0cb56fd16af42bea14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:46:54Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:46:54Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: flush com blob pool + auto-flush single-flight\n\npagestore:\n- blobPutPages: compressão zstd + escrita de blobs em paralelo num pool\n  limitado (2-4 workers, por CPU), preservando a ordem dos UUIDs.\n- putPageList/putIndexPages aplicados em PrepareMerge, PrepareMergeKv,\n  buildIndexTree e writeIndexLevel — todo o caminho de página do flush passa\n  pelo pool.\n- yieldPageWork (Gosched) nas fronteiras de CF (análogo Go do sleepAsync(0)\n  do event loop Nim).\n\ntransactor:\n- auto-flush por threshold agora ARMADO (OnFlushRequest = requestFlush), com\n  driver single-flight que coalesce pedidos (porta do AsyncFlusher).\n- .flush enfileira; .flush-sync espera o driver (flushSync).\n- runFlush, em falha de prepare, libera a captura via AbortFlush (antes o\n  flushActive ficava preso para sempre) e loga no stderr.\n\nkvstore: AbortFlush.\n\nTestes: TestPooledMergeIntoExistingTree (merge grande com pool),\nTestAbortFlushReleasesCapture, TestAutoFlushOnThreshold. go test -race ./...\nverde (19 pacotes); parity_repl 51 linhas; restart_recovery OK; E2E unique OK.","tree":{"sha":"4e8a94c19b0c1177a91dac370886d880547b6dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/4e8a94c19b0c1177a91dac370886d880547b6dfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDE5ZDc3YjEwMjkxNDZjNzY1YTM4YTBhNzQ0NGUxNzkxN2ExOWQ4ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e","sha":"e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e"}],"sha":"19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/19d77b1029146c765a38a0a7444e17917a19d881"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:46:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T02:46:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: hydrated (M6) + anchor index (M7) + fix CF-2 unique na réplica\n\nM6 — cache de leitura por eid:\n- internal/hydrated: buffer plano por entrada + offs, LRU com orçamento,\n  applyKey write-through, hydrate/hydrateEmpty, hasAttrKey/lookupRange/\n  keysFrom. Mutex interno; cada método devolve cópias (o Nim é single-threaded\n  e empresta a entrada ao cursor).\n- eavt: BatchWrite espelha CF-0; ScanPrefixActive serve seek CF-0 ancorado em\n  eid hidratado; HydrateEID; Allocate* hidrata entidades novas.\n- engine: HasDatomW (\"skip provado\") e LookupValue hidratam.\n- cursor MergedCursor: modo hid (snapshot de chaves no seek, seguro sob\n  concorrência).\n- Config: EAVT_HYDRATED_ENABLED / EAVT_HYDRATED_MAX_BYTES (default 256 MiB).\n\nM7 — hash AV→eid para attrs UNIQUE:\n- internal/anchor: hash empacotado (arena + recs de índice estável), FNV-1a,\n  LRU/eviction, rehash com compactação, mutex interno.\n- eavt: BatchWrite espelha CF-2 (put/del); RecoverWriteState reconstrói o\n  hash do resíduo CF-0; BatchLookupAvet/LookupEntityByValue fazem probe antes\n  do scan CF-2.\n- engine: lookupEntity/lookupEntityW/batchLookupAvet fazem probe primeiro.\n- Config: EAVT_ANCHOR_INDEX_MAX_BYTES.\n\nFix (bug real, pré-M6): a réplica atualizava o resolver ANTES de gravar o\nchunk de schema, então um :db/unique do próprio chunk não era visível a\nIsIndexed e as chaves CF-2 (AVET) nunca eram derivadas — queries em attr\nunique voltavam vazias até um flush/adoção de root. applyRecords agora grava\nos CF-0 primeiro, atualiza o resolver e só então deriva os índices.\nRegressão: TestWalSchemaRefreshBeforeDerive.\n\nTestes: internal/hydrated e internal/anchor; integração (mirror, recovery de\nanchors, concorrência, scanner hidratado); réplica. go test -race ./... verde\n(18 pacotes); scripts/parity_repl.sh 51 linhas; restart_recovery.sh OK.","tree":{"sha":"16a651785762ef6cafe3e1990b90f936955a80b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/16a651785762ef6cafe3e1990b90f936955a80b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGUxYmI4MTk4YTU4YWJkYWY1NzczYWZjNTg3NzQwOTI1NjhmOTI5NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23","sha":"1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23"}],"sha":"e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e1bb8198a58abdaf5773afc58774092568f9296e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:17:44Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:17:44Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: alinha journal de KV ao Nim (WAL CF-0-only)\n\n- PutKv/DeleteKv com WAL sink instalado não journalam mais: o WAL é CF-0-only\n  por design. Antes, PutKv emitia um record WAL só-chave (valor descartado) e\n  DeleteKv ignorava o sink (divergências do Nim).\n- Sem sink, caem no arquivo legacy com o valor/tombstone, agora no formato\n  exato do parser: `journalRecord` corrigido (key-only vlen=1/value=0x00;\n  valor vlen=len(value)); o formato antigo tinha um byte a mais e não batia\n  com `journalRecordLenAt`.\n- Testes: TestKvNotJournaledThroughSink + round-trip de tamanho do record e\n  rejeição de tombstone pelo parser.\n\nValidado: go test -race ./... verde (15 pacotes).","tree":{"sha":"4f16de30f29653b7d52be048fb0c51bb57906e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/4f16de30f29653b7d52be048fb0c51bb57906e6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDFlZWNmNjViNjUwMjBhNmIzZTY5YWEyMTBhYzdhYmZkOWVkNjBjMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2","sha":"3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2"}],"sha":"1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1eecf65b65020a6b3e69aa210ac7abfd9ed60c23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:14:18Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:14:18Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: WAL process-crash safe + bootstrap no WAL + teste de recuperação\n\n- wal.Sink descarrega o buffer para o arquivo (page cache do OS) imediatamente,\n  mantendo o fsync no tick de 100 ms → kill -9 não perde writes; crash de\n  máquina perde ≤ ~100 ms.\n- transactor.NewEngine instala o WAL sink ANTES do bootstrap, para os datoms de\n  schema do sistema irem para os segmentos do WAL (duráveis e replicados), e\n  não para o arquivo legacy journal.\n- scripts/restart_recovery.sh: boot → schema+Alice+flush → Bob (não flushado)\n  → kill -9 → reboot → Alice (pagestore) + Bob (WAL replay); falha se o legacy\n  journal aparecer.\n\nValidado: scripts/restart_recovery.sh OK; go test -race ./... verde.","tree":{"sha":"dd4a2b9445473eef9ffc680734d9da0843deb946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/dd4a2b9445473eef9ffc680734d9da0843deb946"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDNjYTk1ZGJhMzA1YjBkMDQ5MjY2YTUxOWJlMjViZDEyNDAwMGYxYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd","sha":"56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd"}],"sha":"3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3ca95dba305b0d049266a519be25bd124000f1a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T00:52:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T00:52:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: transactor sem stop-the-world (ativa/congelada) + atômicos no KVStore\n\nO transactor passa a usar a mesma semântica de snapshot do query server:\ntx/exec escrevem na memtable ATIVA enquanto o flush drena a CONGELADA\n(draining), liberada só no publish. `e.mu` fica restrito a serializar tx/exec\n(como o single-loop do Nim) e as janelas curtas de capture/publish do flush e\nGC; leituras (scheme query, kv get/scan, dump, schema) e o PrepareFlush (blob\nI/O) rodam sem ele.\n\nCorrige races encontradas pelo -race nos testes de flush concorrente:\n- KVStore.memSize e flushActive passam a atômicos (uint64/atomic.Bool), com\n  CompareAndSwap no single-flight do CaptureFlush.\n\nValidação: go test -race ./... verde; E2E com transactor+query server em\n-race sob writer + flusher (.flush) + 4 readers concorrentes => sem data\nraces. TestConcurrentWriteAndFlush cobre write+flush+scan.","tree":{"sha":"0f61dfd0e9ec4b3cd57149c19c82cfda68d70661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/0f61dfd0e9ec4b3cd57149c19c82cfda68d70661"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDU2ZDBiZTAwNTg2ZTk3NzBiZWMxMTMyNTI4ZTI5Y2ZkN2Y5Y2U4ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6","sha":"02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6"}],"sha":"56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/56d0be00586e9770bec1132528e29cfd7f9ce8dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:57:16Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:57:16Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: snapshot isolation real (memtable/kvstore) — remove lock do query server\n\nSubstitui o lock global do query server (e o soft-yield que eu tinha\nintroduzido) pela lógica de snapshot do Nim, de verdade:\n\n- memtable: mutex interno na escada; SnapshotRuns(cf) materializa e devolve os\n  *Run IMUTÁVEIS (draining + ativos); FreezeAllCapture congela e devolve as\n  runs capturadas. Runs nunca são mutadas após criadas.\n- pagestore: treeMu (RWMutex) guarda trees/currentRoot; cache de páginas com\n  mutex próprio; Tree(cf)/BaseTrees snapshot, PublishTrees/LoadRoot swap.\n- kvstore: snapshotMu (RWMutex) torna atômico \"capturar runs + root\" (open do\n  cursor) contra \"trocar root + limpar draining\" (publish) — sem isso um\n  cursor aberto no meio do publish contava o dado duas vezes.\n- resolver: RWMutex (RLock nas leituras, Lock em WAL/schema) + AttrsSnapshot.\n- eavt.Engine: statsMu no cache de CompileStats.\n- query server: sem lock de engine; cada query pina o snapshot no open e\n  conclui lock-free; WAL apply e outras queries em paralelo.\n- VM: reverte o budget de passos (NextBatch volta a rodar até maxRows/done,\n  como o Nim; sem soft-yield).\n\nValidado: go test -race ./... verde; query server + transactor com -race sob\n4 clientes lendo enquanto um writer faz tx (WAL→réplica) => sem data races;\nTestSnapshotIsolation (cursor sobrevive a um flush) e testes de concorrência\nde memtable/scan e resolver.","tree":{"sha":"59d6427be5f2b54441936f52077932d215c3f960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/59d6427be5f2b54441936f52077932d215c3f960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDAyYmJkMmZjZjEyNDZiODE0Yzk1YzRiNmZhMGE1YzRjMDM0NzliYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3","sha":"03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3"}],"sha":"02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/02bbd2fcf1246b814c95c4b6fa0a5c4c03479bc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:29:46Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:29:46Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"port Go: flush faseado (capture/prepare/publish) — não bloqueia o engine\n\nAntes o flush rodava inteiro sob o mutex do engine (I/O de blobs incluso):\num flush grande pausava todas as requests (stop-the-world). Agora:\n- pagestore: PrepareMerge/PrepareMergeKv montam as novas trees e o root SEM\n  mutar o store; PublishTrees faz o swap; BaseTrees snapshot.\n- kvstore: CaptureFlush (freezeAll + coleta + seal do WAL, sob o lock),\n  PrepareFlush (I/O de blobs, fora do lock), PublishFlush (swap + mt.publish\n  + watermark + onFlushPublish, sob o lock). Flush() vira o wrapper síncrono.\n- transactor: runFlush (capture/prepare/publish) usado por flush e flush-sync;\n  gc recusa se um flush está em andamento (evita apagar blobs in-flight).\n\nO que segue ausente vs Nim: drain fatiado (~256 KiB) e blob pool (zstd em\nworkers) — PrepareFlush é uma passada única, mas fora do lock.","tree":{"sha":"e5e987ed8581dda5cc5a6830a4d8861b1306589a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/e5e987ed8581dda5cc5a6830a4d8861b1306589a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDAzODU5NDk1YmU3MGFlYWI1NmQxZjEwODhmZTQzOTc5YTdkZGFhZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/02dce1d27bb9baa5a6e0ead3d6207d18c1341b84","sha":"02dce1d27bb9baa5a6e0ead3d6207d18c1341b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/02dce1d27bb9baa5a6e0ead3d6207d18c1341b84"}],"sha":"03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/03859495be70aeab56d1f1088fe43979a7ddaad3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""