erified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/96e91dfe16915bedd1f55cc1d3a942ede4ecae96","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDk2ZTkxZGZlMTY5MTViZWRkMWY1NWNjMWQzYTk0MmVkZTRlY2FlOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd","sha":"6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd"}],"sha":"96e91dfe16915bedd1f55cc1d3a942ede4ecae96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/96e91dfe16915bedd1f55cc1d3a942ede4ecae96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T23:32:31Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T23:32:31Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"Fase 2 do split OCaml: compilador datalog em OCaml — 25/25 vetores byte-identicos\n\nPort da pipeline de compilacao para ocaml/lib (3.2k LOC OCaml):\n- sexpr.ml: AST S-expr + encoder wire (msgpack, simbolo ext 0x05,\n  keyword ext 0x06) espelhando nim_scheme/wire.nim\n- datalog_ast.ml: BoundValue/slots/FindVar/DatalogIR\n- compile_stats.ml: decode CompileStats do msgpack (formato packStats)\n- query_edn.ml: reader datalog EDN → IR (normalizacao dot→slash ANTES\n  do check de namespace, virgulas whitespace, :in params 1..N)\n- resolve.ml: resolveIr + computePlanStats (key ''IDX:bounds:'' — o\n  max(est, 1.0) do Nim, default totalEavt so para chave ausente)\n- planner.ml: buildQueryPlan com busca de ordenacao (tie-breaks,\n  synthetic vars, skip vars, iterPlans, planTraces)\n- scheme_compile.ml: buildTriejoinScheme/projection/flatten — o\n  programa wire que o back executa\n- test/golden/: 25 vetores {query, stats, wire} gerados pelo\n  tools/dump_wire.nim contra a stack real — teste diferencial exige\n  BYTE-IDENTIDADE com o compilador Nim; suite 66 OK / 0 FAIL\n\nmsgpack: encode_ext agora emite fixext (0xd4-0xd8) para len 1/2/4/8/16\n— msgpack4nim compat, exigido pela byte-identidade.\n\nBugs pegos pelos golden tests durante o port: fixext vs ext8,\nrange_dn invertido (aninhamento do __BODY__ de cabeca para baixo),\nscanner index renumerado pelo mapi (init do depth usava ?s0 em vez\nde ?s1), max(est,totalEavt) vs max(est,1.0), e normalizacao de attr\ndot→slash fora de ordem.","tree":{"sha":"855258cd7d0a0dcf3fbe81756e6ee5b57c69d540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/855258cd7d0a0dcf3fbe81756e6ee5b57c69d540"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDYyMTNkZGI3OTRiYzRmZmI1YjdmYmI3NDhkYTQzOWMwOGFjYjRlYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d","sha":"6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d"}],"sha":"6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6213ddb794bc4ffb5b7fbb748da439c08acb4ebd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T22:35:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T22:35:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"Fase 1 do split OCaml: socket interno de execução no query server + AGENTS.md atualizado\n\neavt_query_nim: o servidor passa a ouvir eavt-query-internal.sock\n(derivado do socket de clients; --internal-path sobrepõe) servindo\nsomente execução local — nada é encaminhado para o transactor por ele:\n- scheme-local: programa wire-AST já compilado + params + columns\n  (:find vars, fornecidas pelo front que compilou) → newQuerySession\n  na réplica local, streaming idêntico ao datalog; mode ''exec''\n  recusado (escrita pertence ao transactor)\n- datalog: compile Nim + execução local (fallback A/B para a Fase 3)\n- schema: snapshot CompileStats da réplica\n\nexecuteLocalStream extraído de handleDatalog (corpo compartilhado).\nContrato da Fase 3: o front OCaml compila datalog EDN → wire e dirige\no socket interno; o Nim fica executor puro da réplica.\n\nSmoke: scheme-local executa wire produzido pelo novo tools/dump_wire\n(605B → row correta via réplica); datalog no interno ok; tx recusado;\nsocket de clients ilesos; suite 696 OK / 0 FAILED.\n\nAGENTS.md: superfície sql morta documentada (fase C, d2f7539) —\npipeline agora é Datalog EDN → IR → planner → Scheme; estrutura de\nprojeto atualizada (nim_sql_parse/nim_sql_frontend removidos, ocaml/ e\ntools/ adicionados); seção Two-layer split documentada.","tree":{"sha":"96f56f37332177ba6de20a20a9ee694206e76053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/96f56f37332177ba6de20a20a9ee694206e76053"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDZhNjM0ODAzYWYzMjViNWVjYjk3Y2ZjN2RlOWZjODM0YzE4M2RmN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6","sha":"7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6"}],"sha":"6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6a634803af325b5ecb97cfc7de9fc834c183df7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T22:01:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T22:01:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix: flush do tail em load_empresas quando n nao e multiplo do batch\n\nload_receita_edn.py (python) e load_receita.ml (ocaml): o flush final\nexigia total < n — com --n exatamente igual ao total acumulado (ex.\n--n 100, batch 500), o ultimo batch nunca era enviado e o loader\nreportava sucesso com o DB vazio de empresas (verificado: 0 cnpj_base\nantes do fix, 99 depois, identico nos dois loaders).\n\n''o if ops and total < n'' vira ''if ops'': o in-loop flush ja zera ops,\nentao o guard nao protegia nada — so descartava o tail.","tree":{"sha":"41f0c36cebfda16cde4212f3da804ab09388aaae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/41f0c36cebfda16cde4212f3da804ab09388aaae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDdjNjc0ZDE0ZDlkODcxN2UwZGU5NDVlOWU5Mjg4NDI2YTVmNThhYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400","sha":"f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400"}],"sha":"7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7c674d14d9d8717e0de945e9e9288426a5f58aa6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:57:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:57:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"ocaml/: reestrutura p/ lib compartilhada + loader receita (port do Python, 1,8x) e fix do --skip-socios no load_receita_edn.py\n\neavt-repl-ocaml/ → ocaml/ com lib/ (eavt_lib), repl/, load/:\n- lib/csv.ml: CSV streaming sobre fd do pipe unzip (aspas, \"\" escape,\n  newline dentro de aspas, semântica Python csv: linha vazia = [])\n- lib/latin1.ml: latin-1 → UTF-8 na borda do fio (Python TextIOWrapper\n  lê latin-1 e msgpack codifica UTF-8 — bytes crus divergiriam)\n- lib/zipsrc.ml: unzip -p interprocesso (descomprime em core próprio;\n  fail-loud em exit != 0, SIGPIPE tolerado no early-stop do --n)\n- lib/sha256.ml: SHA-256 hand-rolled (vetores FIPS + limites 55/56/64B)\n  + b64url do tag de dedup de sócio\n- load/load_receita.ml: port 1:1 do load_receita_edn.py (schema-as-data,\n  RefTids goc, lookups/empresas/simples/estabs/socios, batching 500,\n  --n/--skip-*/--max-*/--probe/--demo-only)\n- repl/: movido, 30 testes + 11 novos (41 OK)\n\nValidação (stack Nim, DB fresco isolado):\n- contagens pós-load idênticas Python×OCaml (999/999/1358/5571)\n- probe 100 cnpjs razao+capital: diff vazio entre clients Python e OCaml\n- throughput empresas: OCaml 35,2k/s vs Python 19,6k/s (~1,8x)\n\nFix Python: load_socios era chamado SEM if not args.skip_socios — o flag\nera parseado e ignorado; socios0 (9,97M rows) varria sempre, e cada row\nupserta o anchor empresa/cnpj_base (goc), criando ~230k+ empresas\n''fantasma'' sem razao_social por rodada. Era a fonte dos datoms ''extras''\nna forense de carga; a engine/gateway/protocolo estão sãos (1 frame →\n1 tx verificado com client instrumentado).\n\nNota: a engine ignora o campo ''params'' do datalog (query com param\nretorna o dataset global) — o probe embute o valor literal na query;\ndatalog_params no client OCaml mantido como documentação do fio.","tree":{"sha":"91a8de54e3a8bd5caa183454338a9547f50f08aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/91a8de54e3a8bd5caa183454338a9547f50f08aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGY0ZjZjYmNkMWZlYzdlZmQ5NmEyZDMyOTIzOWE3NDE4MzkyMmM0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8","sha":"0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8"}],"sha":"f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/f4f6cbcd1fec7efd96a2d329239a74183922c400"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:18:34Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:18:34Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"exercício OCaml: REPL em eavt-repl-ocaml/ (100% aditivo, 0 toque no Nim)\n\nPiloto da avaliação de migração Nim→OCaml 5 (1.133 linhas):\n- msgpack.ml: encoder/decoder mínimo hand-rolled, fail-loud, com ext\n  types 0x05/0x06 do wire (nim_scheme/wire.nim) — bibliotecas prontas\n  não expõem ext custom\n- edn.ml: reader EDN subset tx-data, semântica espelhada do nim_edn\n  (vírgulas whitespace, keyword sem colon, maps/sets rejeitados)\n- client.ml: UDS + framing 4-byte BE + guard 100 MiB; datalog/tx/admin/kv\n  streaming; bin → wrapper JSON base64 (paridade com msgpack2json)\n- repl.ml/main.ml: dot commands, acumulação por bracket depth, linenoise,\n  modes interactive/pipe/-e (-e funciona; no Nim era parseado e ignorado)\n- test/test.ml: 30 asserts (dune runtest)\n\nValidação: sessão espelhada tx+query+kv pelos dois REPLs contra a stack\nNim local → diff vazio (normalizando EIDs/tx ids); .help byte-a-byte.\n\nNotas para a migração: exaustividade de match pegou 3 bugs em compilação;\nmsgpack.t genérico deixou passar rows[0] vs rows[0][0] no kv-get (bug\nque um tipo de domínio teria pego) — desenhar tipos de domínio antes do\ncódigo na próxima fase.","tree":{"sha":"dc4d68127dee8e6f7433a4d72e9710cd1a1543c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/dc4d68127dee8e6f7433a4d72e9710cd1a1543c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDBhMWM2YzY3Mjg0NjVmMDQ1NDk2MmEyYmZkMmUwZTlhOGJkMjg1ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2","sha":"1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2"}],"sha":"0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/0a1c6c6728465f0454962a2bfd2e0e9a8bd285e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:22:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:22:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M9: modo de falha gracioso (dropa useMalloc) + orçamentos de cache reconciliados\n\nO guard de 3 GB existe para degradação graciosa — e o mecanismo estava\nquebrado: com -d:useMalloc, o ORC+malloc segfaulta em vez de raise quando\na alocação falha (reproduzido em 15 linhas sob ulimit -v; o alocador do\nNim imprime ''out of memory'' graciosamente). useMalloc sai dos builds de\nprodução (nimble dist/test); fica restrito a debug/ASan (com\n-d:arenaRedzone, modo novo de caça: cada registro do arena vira alocação\nprópria com redzones envenenadas).\n\nA pressão que levou ao OOM: hydrated_max_bytes 1 GiB nunca evictava\ndurante carga bulk (toda entidade nasce hidratada via get-or-create) —\n2,28M entradas de cache = cópia residente do dataset. Default 1 GiB →\n256 MiB: LRU evicta de verdade, fast path preservado para entidades\nrecentes. memledger permanente no transactor (RSS + bytes por componente\na cada 10s) — regressões de memória aparecem com números.\n\nValidação @250k: completa sem crash, throughput de paridade (21,5k/5,2k/\n25,5k/8,6k linhas/s), RSS 1,8 GB estável (1,2 GB de folga no envelope).\nSuíte 696 OK / 0 FAILED.","tree":{"sha":"75a606bf09439d202784b9ac2d580bf854e2c7d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/75a606bf09439d202784b9ac2d580bf854e2c7d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDFmOWY5MzdiZTFkNjJmYWZlNWJkNjQwMzIxNzM0ZjUwYmY5ZTE3ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc","sha":"5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc"}],"sha":"1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1f9f937be1d62fafe5bd640321734f50bf9e17d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T21:13:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T21:13:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"hardening M8: flush worker estritamente POD-only + freeJob zera o slot no recycle\n\nO worker de flush cruzava refs GC (seq[Run]) para a thread do worker —\ninc/dec de refcount do ORC em thread não-dona, violando a regra de\nthreading do projeto. Agora os runs cruzam como views POD (ptr+len sobre\no buffer cru de ponteiros de registro); os Run refs ficam no loop, que\nos mantém vivos até o done. freeJob passou a zerar o registro inteiro ao\nreciclar (antes vazava truncated/ok/outLen entre vidas do slot) e o\ndispatch ganhou invariante outLen ≤ outCap.\n\nNÃO fecha o crash do estabs@1M — ele persiste e o diagnóstico da rodada\n(descartados: ciclo de vida de job, OOB ASan-visível, corrida de\nrefcount; crash real no alocador Nim do loop, pré-existente no M7) segue\nno Known Issue do AGENTS.md com as ferramentas da caça anotadas.","tree":{"sha":"cbbbff9f3f303cc6d98acabdf74f4bc06663c658","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/cbbbff9f3f303cc6d98acabdf74f4bc06663c658"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDU1NjhmZmMwYTQxNDVhZDYzM2IxMWQ4NDc4Y2IwOGY4ZTdlOWE0Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270","sha":"068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270"}],"sha":"5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5568ffc0a4145ad633b11d8478cb08f8e7e9a4cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T19:54:52Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T19:54:52Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"doc: referência de carga M6/M7/M8 (@10k/@25k, total ≈4,9 h) + known issue do blob pool em estabs@1M\n\nInstrumento via wrapper tx (ATTRIBUTE→EDN; superfície SQL é fase C).\nEstabs 6,2-6,5k/s (era 5,5k), empresas 28,3k/s (era 24k), probes\nattr_by_eid −25% e attrs_x3 −39%. Validação de 1M descobre crash\npré-existente no pool de blobs (dispatchCompletion, outLen corrompido):\nreproduz no checkout M7 — o smoke histórico de 1M era só empresas.\nExtrapolação completa carrega ressalva até o fix.","tree":{"sha":"7ff420206ca257ba40a14508e31e005e645a3514","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/7ff420206ca257ba40a14508e31e005e645a3514"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDA2OGFhY2NlM2NjMzJjNDFhYjEzZmJmYTc3NjA4NjI2ZGUwZDMyNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9","sha":"33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9"}],"sha":"068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/068aacce3cc32c41ab13fbfa77608626de0d3270"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:33:35Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:33:35Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M8: memtable como escada de runs ordenados — treap COW eliminado\n\nSubstitui o treap COW por uma escada de runs imutáveis: escrita faz\nappend O(1) de registro auto-contido ([flags][klen][key], KV adiciona\n[vlen][value]) no arena da geração; a materialização (scan/flush/merge)\nordena só o delta desde a última (sort decorado, dedup mantendo o mais\nnovo); a escada funde quando passa de 8 runs; a captura (freezeAll)\nmove os ativos para draining — legíveis até o publish — e gira a arena.\n\nBusca por bisect em ponteiros contíguos (memória local vs ~27 hops\nseriais do treap); get/lookupKv respeita recência buf → runs (do fim) →\ndraining. Flush drena os runs k-way com dedup newest-wins (sync, async e\nworker — os draining runs são imutáveis, o worker lê sem POD-only).\nReplica: sealLiveToFlush = freezeAll; publishRoot descarta draining.\n\nMorrem: treap_backend.nim (583 linhas), treap_cursor.nim (173),\nreaderCount, path-copy, rotações, o contrato zero-copy do batchMove\n(registros são cópias — chaves emprestadas de frames WAL/rascunho são\nsempre bem-vindas; batchWriteForeignKeys perde a razão de ser como\nponto de cópia). batchWriteForeignKeys mantido como wrapper.\n\nTipos POD (Arena/KeyRef/CfKey/cmpKeysByte) extraídos para memtypes.nim.\nMergedCursor: fontes de treap → RunCursor por run; update re-coleta as\nfontes apenas quando mt.gen muda (runs congelados nunca invalidam um\ncursor aberto). F0 (cursor sob escrita): semântica simplificada.\n\nSuíte 696 OK / 0 FAILED (test_runs novo; test_memtable/treap deletados).\nBench 20k entidades × 3 attrs: write ~48k ent/s (−5% vs M7 — o custo da\ncópia do registro; otimização futura: zero-copy para chaves já no arena),\nunique lookup pós-flush dentro do ruído do round-trip UDS.","tree":{"sha":"3ea4b9b869c82ab0d07bcfa0553d3233872b1af9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/3ea4b9b869c82ab0d07bcfa0553d3233872b1af9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDMzMDU3NDM4YjhkOWFhOTllOGEzYTczNWExYTJjYTIzMjllZGNmYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637","sha":"6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637"}],"sha":"33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/33057438b8d9aa99e8a3a735a1a2ca2329edcfc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:58:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:58:56Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M7: anchor index packed — hash binário AV→eid permanente com LRU\n\nSubstitui o anchorHash Table[seq[byte], (int64,int64)] do M3'' por um mapa\nbinário de endereçamento aberto (anchor_index.nim): arena de bytes por\nregistro + recs de índice estável + slots int32 (load ≤ 0.7, tombstones\ncom reuso via free-list). ~40-60 B/âncora vs ~90-130 B na Table; probe\nzero-alloc (FNV-1a incremental sobre aid+val, igualdade por memcmp na\narena — sem concatenação, sem toOpenArray em slice vazio).\n\nMudança de semântica: o índice agora é PERMANENTE (read mirror dos\nanchors UNIQUE), não janela volátil — o drop no publish morre (junto com\no hook onFlushPublished e o t no payload, que não tinha consumidor).\nEviction LRU intrusiva sob anchor_index_max_bytes (default 256 MiB);\nâncora evitada/ausente cai no fallback scan CF-2, sempre correto.\n\nEscopo: attrs UNIQUE (na prática CF-2 — isIndexed = unique ∪ indexed, e\nnada seta indexed p/ attrs de usuário). Réplica espelha pelo mesmo\ncaminho (WAL write-through); applyRoot não derruba mais entradas.\n\nFixes no módulo cobertos por teste: result.rec default 0 no findSlot\n(miss virava hit no rec 0), int(h) estourando acima de int64.high\n(RangeDefect — máscara antes do cast), newSeqOfCap com len 0 no rehash,\ncontabilidade curBytes do tombstone.\n\nSuíte 693 OK / 0 FAILED (14 testes novos do anchor index). Smoke: unique\nlookup pós-flush executa pelo hostfn sem seek CF-2 no caminho quente.","tree":{"sha":"8dd91437462a21e6bffd1f9f24bc842a166d294d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/8dd91437462a21e6bffd1f9f24bc842a166d294d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDY5MzhjNmQyM2Q4MWQ4OGRlM2MyMmEzMjE5OTc5NzNmZmQ4ODA2Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44","sha":"461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44"}],"sha":"6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/6938c6d23d81d88de3c22a321997973ffd880637"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:05:33Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:05:33Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M6: desfusão M1/M2/M4/M5 — treap de volta como memtable de todos os CFs\n\nO cache hidratado vira cache de LEITURA puro (flat buffer por entrada,\nportado do pré-M1): batchWrite espelha cada CF-0 no eid (upsert patcheia\no sufixo t in-place — O(klen); retract remove). O treap volta a receber\nCF-0/1/2/3 no write path; o flush genérico do kvstore drena tudo, com o\nmaxT computado das próprias chaves (hook onFlushCollect eliminado).\n\nKeeps portados forward:\n- WAL CF-0-only: recoverWriteState re-deriva CF-1/2/3 do resíduo de\n  replay (deriveIndexKeys — byte reshuffle), incluindo tombstones de\n  índice; kv.batchWrite ganha journal=false (o engine journala o CF-0\n  via journalOnly).\n- M3'' parcial: CF-2 volta ao treap; anchor hash permanece como espelho\n  write-through, droppado no publish (maxT das chaves drenadas).\n- Réplica: applyWal/applySnapshot derivam os índices do volátil e\n  roteiam por batchWriteForeignKeys — batchMove REFERENCIA os bytes,\n  frames WAL são transientes: cada chave é copiada para a arena do\n  memtable antes do routing.\n\nMortos: DatomVector/chunks/pinning (datoms.nim), run cache do query,\npartial entries (M4), tombSlots/watermark da entrada.\n\nSuíte 679 OK / 0 FAILED (test_hydrated entrou no all_tests; test_datoms\ndeletado). F3 acceptance, recovery CF-0-only sem flush e replication\nqueue 6/6 verdes. Smoke end-to-end: tx schema+dados, update card-one,\nreads na réplica com voláteis, flush-sync + re-read consistente.","tree":{"sha":"439e1ffe5f9b397a2dc5c9e0ba38dda404491fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/439e1ffe5f9b397a2dc5c9e0ba38dda404491fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDQ2MWFmYmJkNWJkZGRmYzMwZGM5OTNhN2FkYWYwZWQ1ZjBiNWVhNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b","sha":"8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b"}],"sha":"461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/461afbbd5bdddfc30dc993a7adaf0ed5f0b5ea44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:26:05Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:26:05Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M5: query path O(1) no run cache + réplica pós-restart íntegra\n\n- RunKeys ref: o run cache (cf0..cf3) vive atrás de ref object — copiar/\n  destruir seq[seq[byte]] grande é O(n) sob orc/arc (~10ms por query em\n  315k keys); o mockCursor agora bumpa a ref (O(1)).  attr_by_eid:\n  13.5ms → 0.11ms.\n- applySnapshot roteia POR SEGMENTO: os KeyRefs do parseJournalRecords\n  borrowam o seq local do segmento; rotear após o loop copiava memória\n  liberada (255k keys zeradas pós-restart).\n- réplica não inventa schema: bootstrapSystemAttrs sai da openReplica\n  (o replay_off deixa o probe cego; o schema real chega pelo stream).\n- applyRoot: watermark só avança quando o root adotado tem dados — o\n  root vazio do recovery não dá cobertura de durabilidade.\n- replay_off documentado no kvstore (a réplica M5 reconstrói pelo stream).","tree":{"sha":"de1bea5cd530432af53c1dd4530745148534ba1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/de1bea5cd530432af53c1dd4530745148534ba1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDhiZDI1OTg4MWZhZDFkNDdlMWE4ODFiOTViMjAwNWM2MTljYzk5M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906","sha":"d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906"}],"sha":"8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8bd259881fad1d47e1a881b95b2005c619cc993b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T17:43:51Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T17:43:51Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"P1: handler SIGTERM/SIGINT — drain final do WAL no caminho de morte\n\nO contract ''process crash is always safe'' do wal.md exige drain+fsync no\ncaminho de morte: o interval fsync (100ms) não protege o buf pendente\nquando o kill -9 chega antes do drain (32k entidades perdidas no smoke\n1M). O handler só flipa uma flag (async-unsafe); o stop real roda no\nloop — walw.stop() (drain final + fsync) → pool → store, a mesma ordem\ndo shutdown natural. Verificado: ''draining'' + ''Shutdown complete'' no\nstop.sh com SIGTERM.","tree":{"sha":"329d9da008f3bd92712753a203c36968e99b4208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/329d9da008f3bd92712753a203c36968e99b4208"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGQxMTM0MTFiYzIzMzJlNzk3OWVhY2M0Mjg1MjhhNzUwNjdkMzE5MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc","sha":"64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc"}],"sha":"d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d113411bc2332e7979eacc428528a75067d31906"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T17:43:06Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T17:43:06Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"guard: ulimit -v 3GB nos processos pesados do start.sh\n\nO smoke 1M (m8) deixou o transactor em ~5GB (OOM-kill 3× confirmado no\nkernel log) por composição: page cache 512MB + vetor ~170MB + treap\nstaging ~350MB + hyd ~170MB + arenas do buildEavtEntries 4× + overhead\nORC/malloc ~2× em 1M entidades. Sem leak (RSS estável pós-carga\nverificado com guard: 100k→63MB, 500k→843MB estável, restart→442MB).\n\ntodo processo pesado agora nasce com ulimit -v 3GB — degrada com\nfalha de alocação em vez de derrubar a máquina.","tree":{"sha":"7dc3edbdd2387878905cc86bdec42b682e0ddc51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/7dc3edbdd2387878905cc86bdec42b682e0ddc51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDY0ZThkNDYwNTQyOTY1Yjg5NTZlMDU0ZWQ1YjY4ZTdmOGMwYTEyZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04","sha":"088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04"}],"sha":"64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/64e8d460542965b8956e054ed5b68e7f8c0a12dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:25:35Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:25:35Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"doc: achado P1 de durabilidade — kill -9 perde o buf pendente do WAL\n\nO smoke 1M do M5 + kill -9 do stop.sh perdeu o tail não-flushado\n(32k entidades, ~15k datoms): o drain (tick 2ms) ficou atrasado diante\ndo buf crescente sob carga contínua e o SIGTERM sem handler não deixou\no stop() do writer fazer o drain final + fsync. O contract ''process\ncrash is always safe'' exige drain+fsync no caminho de morte — pendência:\nhandler de signal no transactor (walw.stop()) e/ou drain síncrono\nquando o buf passa de um limite.","tree":{"sha":"4bfe5b02eaf9ef2a04432d4caf7397f98d6a39ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/4bfe5b02eaf9ef2a04432d4caf7397f98d6a39ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDA4OGIwZmVmMjBmYjc2YzRiNzUxMDNmYTlkZDcxNjZmMjQxZTZkMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e","sha":"4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e"}],"sha":"088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/088b0fef20fb76c4b75103fa9dd7166f241e6d04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T14:28:18Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T14:28:18Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"F4 (M5): cursores sobre a janela volátil + run cache incremental\n\nO custo por open de cursor que o smoke do F3 expôs (réplica com 130k\nslots parciais do WAL re-dumpados por open) fecha com três peças:\n\n- openCursor CF-0 full-range: a fonte é o VOLÁTIL do vetor (drainFromT\n  sobre publishedT) — o durável vem do pagestore; scanPrefix/\n  scanPrefixActive full-range idem (sem re-dumpar chaves duráveis)\n- run cache por janela: snapshot ordenado por CF válido enquanto\n  (dvec.windowGen, anchorBytes) não muda; windowGen sobe só quando a\n  janela volátil muda (append volátil ou publish) — hidratações de\n  chaves duráveis não o bumpam\n- rebuild INCREMENTAL: o primeiro build sorta a janela inteira; os\n  rebuilds drenam apenas o delta desde runCaptureT e mesclam nos runs\n  existentes (O(n) memmove, sem re-sort O(n log n))\n\nContadores voláteis: append só conta keys com t > publishedT — cópias de\nhidratação (já duráveis) não inflam a janela de flush.\n\nProbes @50k finais: eid_lookup 89µs, attr_by_eid 125µs, attrs_x3 317µs,\nupsert 93µs — paridade com M1..M4 (m6). Suíte 667 OK.","tree":{"sha":"2cbe22ec10f823a6df19476297cea38e9d2d506f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/2cbe22ec10f823a6df19476297cea38e9d2d506f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDRmMDRlYTk5N2E3Yzg3MGQ1ZGNlYmE3ZDYyOTE3NmQ5YzVkNzY0MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa","sha":"8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa"}],"sha":"4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4f04ea997a7c870d5dceba7d629176d9c5d7641e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:31:38Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:31:38Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"F3 (M5): réplica roteia pelo mesmo batchWrite — treaps saem dos 4 CFs nos dois nós\n\napplyWal → batchWrite (vetor + entradas + hash de âncoras): o write path\né UM nos dois nós. Correção estrutural do bug latente (invariante stale\nda réplica): datoms WAL de um eid já hidratado caem na entrada —\nread-your-writes idêntico nos dois nós.\n\n- applyWal: schema refresh primeiro, depois routing (routeWalBatch —\n  wrapper de efeito fora do async macro); treap CF-0 não recebe mais\n- applySnapshot: datoms dos segmentos roteados via batchWrite; adopted\n  root fornece o durável; deriveFromCf0 removido (a derivação é do\n  worker do flush do primário + cursor open)\n- applyRoot ganha maxT (o frame root carrega o maxT do flush do\n  primário): réplica espelha o publish — hyd bookkeeping primeiro\n  (solta parciais drenadas), depois o reclaim do vetor e hash entries\n  ≤ maxT (duráveis no root adotado)\n- hydrateEid: entrada PARTIAL (delta do WAL) faz upgrade para a visão\n  completa no first-touch — probeComplete volta a ser exclusivo\n- onFlushRequest field: raises: [] (o hook já trata o futuro)\n\nTeste de aceitação F3: hydrate → WAL write mesmo eid → read vê o datom\n(v2.len == 2 — o check do F0 invertido). Suíte 667 OK.","tree":{"sha":"0925405d69f06d26fd1c8cc316bf491da3cbda39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/0925405d69f06d26fd1c8cc316bf491da3cbda39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDhiMjQ4NDAwNTgwZDVjN2JmYjEwMWFlOTE1ZmJmNDg5ZTRjMDcwYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a","sha":"2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a"}],"sha":"8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/8b248400580d5c7bfb101ae915fbf489e4c070aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:18:40Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:18:40Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"F2 (M5): primário sobre o DatomVector — entrada = slots, derivação no flush\n\nO write path do primário agora materializa UM encoding (CF-0 canônico) no\nvetor; a entrada hidratada vira lista de slots (12B) — insertKeyAt morreu:\n\n- batchWrite: CF-0 → hyd.applyKey (append no vetor + slot); CF-1/3 → nada\n  (derivados); CF-2 → hash (prefix → (eid, t), sem cópia de chave)\n- HydratedEntry: slots/tombSlots no lugar de buf/offs/tombstones; pin por\n  chunk retém os bytes da entrada (cache role) até evict; partial entries\n  são soltas no drain e despinam\n- collectDirty → dvec.drainVolatile (a fonte de bytes do flush);\n  onFlushCollect deriva CF-1/2/3 dos datoms com aidMeta (indexed/ref\n  capturado do resolver na captura — o worker não o toca); derivação no\n  worker é o seam documentado para mover off-loop\n- findKeyPos casa por datom-prefix (sem sf) — upsert/retract da mesma\n  (eid,aid,val) independente do t; cmpSlotPrefix restaura a semântica de\n  prefixo (igualdade nos n bytes = match)\n- recoverWriteState: resíduo → partial entries + rebuild do hash de\n  âncoras (única forma de reconstruí-lo pós-restart)\n- openCursor: CF-2 snapshot derivado do hash; CF-1/3 derivados do volátil\n  (drainFromT); HydCursor itera slots via chunks\n\nSuíte 667 OK (incl. os 6 do F1 + 5 do F0).","tree":{"sha":"b331544f8d1c65393725d1dce878aab8e053aa42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/b331544f8d1c65393725d1dce878aab8e053aa42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDJhZWMzOTJlYWUwMzFjYzgyMDlhNTYxNTdkNjJjMzIwZjdmNTFmNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8","sha":"843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8"}],"sha":"2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2aec392eae031cc8209a56157d62c320f7f51f6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:04:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:04:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"F1 (M5): DatomVector — chunks imutáveis append-only, slots estáveis, pin/watermark\n\nA memtable canônica do write path: um vetor append-only de datoms CF-0\ncanônicos, chunked em ~256KiB imutáveis após selar. Slot (chunk, off,\nklen) é estável para sempre — sem readerCount, sem path-copying: cursores\nabertos seguram refs dos chunks (ARC) e veem uma visão congelada.\n\n- append O(1) amortizado; selo automático do chunk anterior no rollover\n- publish(watermarkT): solta chunks selados totalmente duráveis e não\n  pinados; chunk pendurado (minT <= wm < maxT) recontabiliza bytes\n  voláteis por chave; pinado fica para a entrada hidratada e é\n  reclamado no próximo publish após o último unpin\n- drainVolatile/drainFromT: cópias owned para o worker do flush\n- generation bump por append: validação do run-cache dos cursores\n- cmpSlotKey zero-alloc para as buscas de entrada\n\n6 unit tests; suíte 667 OK.","tree":{"sha":"453a308007a8a544a38efdb3082189e338ba5ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/453a308007a8a544a38efdb3082189e338ba5ecb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDg0MzI0M2UxNDA4ODE2OTIxODg0MDU2NGU2NzhkYzk5Y2E5Yjc0Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8","sha":"ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8"}],"sha":"843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/843243e14088169218840564e678dc99ca9b74c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:00:58Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:00:58Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"F0: trava de semântica pré-M5 — cursor sob escrita + invariante stale da réplica\n\n1. Cursor hyd sob mutação do mesmo eid (4 testes): write que ordena antes\n   do cursor e tombstone no meio da iteração — offsets mantidos de forma\n   consistente (insertKeyAt/removeKeyAt atualizam offs atomicamente);\n   nenhuma chave corrompida, ordem preservada. Comportamento atual\n   documentado como baseline para o M5 (chunks imutáveis são estritamente\n   mais seguros).\n\n2. Invariante stale da réplica (1 teste, acceptance do F3): engine A\n   escreve, engine B (réplica) aplica CF-0 no treap via batch (o que\n   applyWal faz), B lê (hidrata), A escreve de novo, WAL entrega a B —\n   o datom do WAL fica INVISÍVEL atrás da entrada hidratada com\n   autoridade exclusiva (probeComplete → resposta exclusiva). Hoje o\n   gatilho é inalcançável pela superfície datalog (scanners não hidratam;\n   exec vai ao transactor) — mas estrutural. O check fica em v2.len == 1\n   com comentário; o F3 (applyWal → batchWrite) inverte para 2.\n\n3. Nota de investigação: o gatilho real do bug é o hostfn lookup-value/\n   lookup-entity (única rota que hidrata); datalog compilado usa scanners.\n   Se um dia a réplica executar esses hostfns (ex.: goc em queries), o\n   bug vira ativo.","tree":{"sha":"74845008fb5edb990a1e3a90c01778b299f5f2a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/74845008fb5edb990a1e3a90c01778b299f5f2a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGFjMjE4MmMwYjBjMDE3Zjc2YzcwMTBhNGIyMmY3MDU3NGZlNGI1Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48","sha":"c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48"}],"sha":"ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/ac2182c0b0c017f76c7010a4b22f70574fe4b5b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:01:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:01:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"doc: referência M1..M4 final @50k + probes + smoke 1M\n\n- Tabela M1..M4 vs M1+M2 vs scheme (taxas de escrita, queda ~15% esperada\n  — o ganho estrutural do M1..M4 é memória/journal, não taxa)\n- Probes pós-fix do :in no slot E (attr_by_eid 143µs, attrs_x3 363µs)\n- Smoke 1M: 16,5k/s com ~40 flushes, réplica 1M exata por stream,\n  restart restaura 1M em ~12s, GC ativo (10 roots)\n- Extrapolação total: 5,5h (estabs domina)\n- Alvos de perf apontados: insertKeyAt (11%) e sort do worker (12%)","tree":{"sha":"3dabacdb012973f3d7e302b6f070b135beae7a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/3dabacdb012973f3d7e302b6f070b135beae7a1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGMwYmNiZWE4NWEyYmM1NjQ1MmY0ODdmOWM1YTA2ZTBkMTgwNjBjNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350","sha":"5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350"}],"sha":"c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/c0bcbea85a2bc56452f487f9c5a06e0d18060c48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:54:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:54:13Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix: :in var no slot E vira param — plano de probe, não full scan\n\n[?e :attr ?v] com ?e vinculado por :in gerava plano AEVT que iterava o\níndice INTEIRO do attr e descartava o vínculo — 50.000 rows em vez de 1\n(bug de corretude) e probes de 391ms/1,15s em vez de µs. O slot V já\nconvertia :in em param (parsePattern); o slot E não. O planner (boundInts)\ne o scheme_compile (push por posição bound) já suportavam o caso.\n\nProbes pós-fix @50k: attr_by_eid 391ms → 142µs (2.746×), attrs_x3\n1,15s → 363µs (3.175×). Regressão: 2 testes no parser EDN.","tree":{"sha":"7e9f55c324e9a3f0eb6e6edb1520dd20cfdd0e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/7e9f55c324e9a3f0eb6e6edb1520dd20cfdd0e87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDVlODQxMmMxYzQ3N2UwZDExOTY3MDgyY2Q3Y2E4YmY1MDk2NDkzNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467","sha":"3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467"}],"sha":"5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/5e8412c1c477e0d11967082cd7ca8bf509649350"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:08:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:08:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fix: replay resiliente a segmento rasgado + KeyRefs vivos na derivação da réplica\n\nDois bugs de perda de dados, um síntoma comum (réplica satura ~55,5k/65k;\ntransactor restaura vazio pós-restart):\n\n1. parseJournalRecords desistia no primeiro record inválido — uma cauda\n   rasgada de segmento predecessor (28B de lixo no head de journal.00003)\n   fazia o replay descartar silenciosamente TODOS os records do segmento.\n   Agora: resync forward — aceita o offset onde uma cadeia de records\n   válidos retoma (cadeia >= 3, ou cadeia que corre até o EOF); cauda\n   rasgada pura continua parando no último record completo; bytes pulados\n   são logados (durabilidade-relevante).\n\n2. deriveFromCf0 retornava CfKey cujos KeyRef apontavam para seqs locais\n   que morriam no return — use-after-free: os ponteiros convergem para o\n   buffer reutilizado e o treap dedupa tudo em lixo (probe: 9.424 chaves\n   derivadas aplicadas → 71 no treap). Cada frame WAL e o snapshot\n   perdiam os índices CF-1/2/3 dos datoms streamados. Agora: retorna pares\n   (cf, seq[byte]) OWNED; o caller materializa os borrows só na hora do\n   batch (que copia para a arena).\n\nRegressão: 3 testes de parse (garbage head, mid-stream, torn tail).\nVerificado: 56.846 empresas idênticas em transactor e réplica; ciclo\ntx → replicação ao vivo → flush-sync → restart --keep-db preserva tudo.","tree":{"sha":"eb77ddb5411ab68a6899cda2dce0623b99e9f466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/eb77ddb5411ab68a6899cda2dce0623b99e9f466"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDNmMGE3YjAwMmMwZDcwOGQwM2UyNWNmNWJjNzExNGFiODdlM2I0Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150","sha":"850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150"}],"sha":"3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3f0a7b002c0d708d03e25cf5bc7114ab87e3b467"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T00:41:51Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T00:41:51Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"flush threshold 64MB → 16MB — o flush async volta a disparar no write path M1..M4\n\nO threshold de 64MB foi calibrado para a era treap (o estado de escrita\nduplicava os datoms em 4 CFs ≈ 200B/datom). O write path M1..M4 (hyd +\ndeferred + hash ≈ 120B/datom, sem duplicação) produz ~3x menos bytes para\no mesmo volume → o flush nunca cruzava 64MB na carga empresas (25MB de\nwrite state para 65k entidades) → o pagestore ficava vazio → o restart\nperdia as árvores → ''attribute resolution failed''.\n\n16MB ≈ 133k datoms não-flushados — o flush dispara em ~1/5 da carga ✓.\nBlobs pós-carga 65k empresas: 1 → 140 ✓. O restart --keep-db preserva ✓\n(razao por cnpj ok pós-restart). A contagem da réplica: 55,5k/65k — os\núltimos 9,5k (journal tail pós-root) pendentes na subscrição de\nreplicação (o stream para após o root adoption — investigação própria).\n\nSuíte 651 OK. Debug temporário (flushDebug/REPLAYDBG/PRESSDBG) removido.","tree":{"sha":"5fe2ffdaba9a206e62dca54b8d273843e2f22324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/5fe2ffdaba9a206e62dca54b8d273843e2f22324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDg1MDI4N2RjODAwZDQyMDA1MmM1ODk0YjAyZWYwNWM2MzhjMWMxNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495","sha":"a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495"}],"sha":"850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/850287dc800d420052c5894b02ef05c638c1c150"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:19:15Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:19:15Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"WAL CF-0-only: journal grava só o datom; CF-1/2/3 re-derivados no replay\n\nO datom (CF-0) é a verdade durável — CF-1/2/3 são funções dele. O journal\nfiltra para CF-0 (+ KV CFs ≥10 no kvstore genérico, que mantém contrato\npróprio). Volume de journal −60-70% (o custo de journal estava no perfil\nresidual).\n\nTransactor recovery: bootstrapResolver ganha passada CF-0 (o resíduo não-\nflushado do treap tem os datoms de schema como CF-0, aid nos bytes 8-12,\nmesmo offset de val do CF-1); recoverWriteState roteia o resíduo treap\npelo caminho de escrita (hyd partial + deferred + hash), chamado no\nshared_engine após o bootstrap. O resíduo fica no treap (leituras fazem\nmerge; o flush drena ambos — idempotente no pagestore).\n\nRéplica: applyWal em duas fases — (1) CF-0 verbatim no treap; (2) refresh\ndo resolver se o chunk tem schema (detecta via aid nos bytes 8-12 do CF-0);\n(3) derivação CF-1/2/3 (CF-1 sempre; CF-2 se indexed; CF-3 se ref — o\nresolver já conhece os attrs pós-fase-2, resolvendo o chicken-and-egg do\nschema no mesmo chunk). applySnapshot: bootstrap + derivação do treap\npós-publish (o restart da réplica reconstrói os índices do CF-0).\n\nConhecido: o ciclo stop/start do transactor com perda do blobs dir\n(closePageStore ownsPath) é pré-existente e independente — o recovery\nunitário (journal replay sem flush) passa ✓.\n\nSuíte 651 OK (+1 recovery CF-0-only). estabs 65k no primário: 6,2k/s.\nRéplica 65k/65k ✓ (run M4 sem restart).","tree":{"sha":"65f169e4f6e5ca4746b4d86b2e0889b07e08033b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/65f169e4f6e5ca4746b4d86b2e0889b07e08033b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGE0YjI2YWY2MDI4NTQ5YjUwZTRkMGI5ZGMwNjRjNzk3YzJiNjU0OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a","sha":"3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a"}],"sha":"a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/a4b26af6028549b50e4d0b9dc064c797c2b65495"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:26:17Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:26:17Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M4: entrada parcial para eids frios — treap CF-0 sai do write path\n\nEscrita em eid não-hidratado cria PARTIAL entry (delta only; base fica no\npagestore) em vez de treap CF-0 — o write path não alimenta nenhum treap.\nLeituras de eids parciais fazem merge delta+base: o dedup por t já ordena\n(delta tem t maior, vence naturalmente); tombstones do delta removem\nversões antigas. probe → probeComplete nos fast paths (parciais não são\nautoritativas). upgradePartial: leitura hidratada promove parcial a\ncompleta (tombstones preservados p/ drain). publish descarta parciais\ndrenadas (sem papel de cache).\n\nFIX de corretude pré-existente descoberto pelo M4: o merge multi-source do\nscanPrefixActive tomava a PRIMEIRA ocorrência por prefix (a mais antiga,\nsort ascendente) — um retract após flush ressuscitava o datom no scan.\nNewest-wins via backward dedup (padrão do single-source).\n\nFIX do planner: estimateCount via MergedCursor ficava cego ao estado de\nescrita (hyd/deferred/hash) — todas as estimativas clampeavam em 1 e o\njoin order degenerava em planos blind-var que crashavam a VM (unbound).\nbuildCompileStats soma o estado de escrita por CF; hyd ganha numKeys.\nopenCursor: snapshot hyd p/ full-range CF-0 e snapshot da hash p/ CF-2.\n\nestabs ponto 65k: 5,6k rows/s (5,6k→6,2k na faixa M1..M3); réplica\n65k/65k ✓. Suíte 650 OK. Bench @50k: empresas 25,7k estabs 4,9k simples\n34,4k socios 8,6k — TOTAL 6,0h.","tree":{"sha":"a125a689dd57317fd1a3becbc5dad8472f2b63d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/a125a689dd57317fd1a3becbc5dad8472f2b63d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDNkYzg1MTZiMmIzOTkzNjYyN2UxNDI2NjFlZThmODNhMjFiODYwN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014","sha":"bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014"}],"sha":"3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3dc8516b2b39936627e142661ee8f83a21b8607a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T18:32:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T18:32:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M3: âncora única como hash na entrada hidratada — CF-2 sai do treap\n\nlookupEntity deixa de varrer o AVET (CF-2) por MergedCursor e passa a\nresolver por hash na entrada hidratada: lookupHyd(eid, attr, valor)\npercorre as chaves do eid (buf flat, ~10-30 chaves) comparando o\nsegmento de valor — O(k) em memória, sem cursor, sem seek de B-tree.\nMiss → batchLookupAvet no CF-2 como fallback (dados antigos não\nhidratados). lookupEntityW usa o mesmo caminho (slots tipados).\n\nA âncora da carga é SEMPRE um hit no eid hidratado da própria transação\n(allocateInPartition hidrata vazio; as escritas da linha chegam antes do\nlookup da linha seguinte) — o caminho quente fica 100% hash.\n\nestabs ponto 65k: 6,2k rows/s (5,7k→6,2k); bench 50k: empresas 27,9k\nsimples 37,5k estabs 5,6k. Réplica 65k/65k. Suíte 650 OK.","tree":{"sha":"9a5e1167ba2506f4720bc7e66ee39eacb2e69837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/9a5e1167ba2506f4720bc7e66ee39eacb2e69837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGJjYWRiZDZkMTg2Zjc3ZjhmNTIxY2U2MzIwMWQ2YTJjODZjMjMwMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/2a05faa820986460f8d06ee323a810da1a2853d7","sha":"2a05faa820986460f8d06ee323a810da1a2853d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2a05faa820986460f8d06ee323a810da1a2853d7"}],"sha":"bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/bcadbd6d186f77f8f521ce63201d6a2c86c23014"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2a05faa820986460f8d06ee323a810da1a2853d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:56:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:56:11Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"doc: referência de carga M1+M2 (2026-09-03) — perf pós M1/M2\n\nM1 (hyd-memtable CF-0) + M2 (CF-1/3 deferidos + journalOnly) sobre a base\nEDN tx: empresas 28,1k simples 35,4k (superam a referência scheme); estabs\n5,7k (scheme hoje: 7,4k — gap −23% no caminho residual: journal completo\nobrigatório + resolução de âncoras + hyd-insert). Perfil pós-M1/M2:\ninsertOwned saiu do top (18-19% → <2%); restante difuso (seq churn,\nworker sort off-loop, flush) — M3 (pointer treap CF-2) sem alvo remanescente\nno perfil, decisão por medição: adiado.","tree":{"sha":"510dbd8490a80212d1e6cb2f97acd5855bcdd008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/510dbd8490a80212d1e6cb2f97acd5855bcdd008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/2a05faa820986460f8d06ee323a810da1a2853d7","verific