"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/0f3ee3cc4d73dee51ff153cf62890ee7262d2fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:53:30Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:53:30Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"cursor: addSource (heap push pós-construção) + seek binário no mock\n\nO scanner reusa um cursor para os scans externo e interno — o seek do\ninterno volta para trás, exigindo busca binária no mock (o walk linear\nsó-para-frente errava o alvo). addSource empurra a chave corrente para o\nheap quando a fonte entra depois da construção (fonte deferida M2).\nAmbos exercitados pelos testes de filtro/iterate da suíte (650 OK).","tree":{"sha":"63a515a3f83bb562a87268b946d199038ebfdfa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/63a515a3f83bb562a87268b946d199038ebfdfa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/0f3ee3cc4d73dee51ff153cf62890ee7262d2fc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/0f3ee3cc4d73dee51ff153cf62890ee7262d2fc3","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDBmM2VlM2NjNGQ3M2RlZTUxZmYxNTNjZjYyODkwZWU3MjYyZDJmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81","sha":"600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81"}],"sha":"0f3ee3cc4d73dee51ff153cf62890ee7262d2fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/0f3ee3cc4d73dee51ff153cf62890ee7262d2fc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:45:57Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:45:57Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M2: CF-1/CF-3 deferidos — treap de escrita só CF-2; fix de durabilidade do M1\n\nCF-1/CF-3 são write-only no transactor (nenhuma leitura in-tx; bootstrap\nde resolver é startup-only quando os buffers estão vazios) → buffers de\napêndice deferidos, drenados no flush junto com o hyd (commit de todos os\nCFs numa passada; publish filtra por t ≤ maxT). Treap de escrita fica só\ncom CF-2 (âncoras) e CF-0 de eids não-hidratados.\n\nDURABILIDADE (fix do M1): o ramo hyd-primary pulava kv.batchWrite → os\ndatoms CF-0 hidratados nunca chegavam ao WAL — réplica cega e perda em\ncrash entre flushes. journalOnly (kvstore) grava os entries roteados sem\ninserir no treap; recovery replay reconstrói como antes. Integridade\nverificada: réplica 65k/65k estabs pós-carga.\n\nSort off-loop: o collect coleta em ordem bruta (sortar no loop bloqueava\no event loop com buffers de 1M+ keys); worker ordena (concat+sort por CF).\ncmpKeysByte compartilhado no treap_backend (do-lambda dentro do template\nasync quebra a convenção closure). Query cursor: fonte mock ordenada para\nCF-1/3 deferidos (snapshot no open) + seek binário no mock (o scanner\nreusa o cursor para scans externo/interno — o interno busca para trás).\nSort de coleta com CF sem treap root no flush sync (commitMergeCore\nassume entrada ascendente — página corrompida sem isso).\n\nestabs @50k: 5,7k rows/s (ponto 6,2k); empresas 28,1k; simples 35,4k;\nsocios 9,5k. Suíte 650 OK. Réplica 65k/65k, cargo por aresta ✓.","tree":{"sha":"e9a4fcf60ccb7ffe9628233ceb4189fde0203dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/e9a4fcf60ccb7ffe9628233ceb4189fde0203dcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDYwMGRmZGMyZGQxNGQwMDQxNTI4MjRhYWEzZTA1OTVhMDA4ODZlODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3","sha":"fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3"}],"sha":"600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/600dfdc2dd14d004152824aaa3e0595a00886e81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:14:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:14:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"M1: entrada hidratada como memtable do CF-0 (watermark + tombstones)\n\nA entrada por eid (buf flat + offs) vira a memtable do CF-0 para eids\nhidratados: batchWrite roteia CF-0 de eid hidratado direto para a entrada\n(sem treap); leituras eid-ancoradas servem da entrada inclusive sujas\n(read-your-writes). Rastreio de sujezão por CONTEÚDO — o t-suffix da\nprópria chave vs watermark da entrada (estável sob inserção, exato por\nchave, zero bookkeeping no hot path); retracts viram tombstones pendentes\npor entrada. Flush drena as entradas sujas entre capture e commit (hooks\nonFlushCollect/onFlushPublished no KVStore, auto-instalados pelo engine;\nworker mescla treap+hyd por CF); watermarks avançam só após publish.\nEviction pula entradas sujas (pinned até drenar); dirtyBytes arma flush\npor pressão. Cursor de query ganha ckHyd: seek CF-0 com eid completo\nhidratado serve exclusivamente da entrada; fontes base preservadas para\nfallback. mergeSortedKeys no treap_backend compartilhado.\n\nestabs @50k: 5,9k → 6,7k rows/s no ponto (+13%); empresas 27,3k simples\n36,3k. Integridade mantida. Suíte 650 OK (testes de leitura raw adaptados\nao leitor hyd-aware; eviction/lookupValue atualizados ao ciclo de vida\nsujo→drenado→evictável).","tree":{"sha":"801a874213100eede9d49c915ab59c4e96b5ee26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/801a874213100eede9d49c915ab59c4e96b5ee26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGZhNTA3NzBhMzU5NWVmZmQyNThjY2U5MDAyZjdiYTQ1NmY5YWQzYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021","sha":"9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021"}],"sha":"fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/fa50770a3595effd258cce9002f7ba456f9ad3a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:43:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:43:53Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"memtable: diagnóstico interno do treap estendido (-d:eavtTreapDiag)\n\ninsdiag2 imprime cmpCalls, bytes médios por comparação, rotações mut/copy,\nnodes alocados, path-copies por insert e profundidade média/máxima de\ndescida (parametro depth no insertOwned). Medição @estabs 65k: 3,3M inserts\nnovos (existing=0), ~19 comparações/insert de 8B, depthAvg=18 depthMax=46,\nrotMut=5,6M rotCopy=0, copies/node=0 — treap já enxuto: ~0,5µs/insert\n(19,7% do perfil), custo inerente de pointer-chasing.","tree":{"sha":"a87f77b752f5c019e36f4639f04affa724b96cf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/a87f77b752f5c019e36f4639f04affa724b96cf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDlkZWZlMWVkOGY3Mzg5M2QxZjFhMjJiM2U1NmJhMWYyYzQ1ZTAwMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e","sha":"1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e"}],"sha":"9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9defe1ed8f73893d1f1a22b3e56ba1f2c45e0021"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:42:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:42:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: keywords internadas (SymId uint32) na captura + lookups em lote\n\nsymtab.nim: tabela de intern possuída pelo engine (SymTab ref, sem globals\nGC — gcsafe por construção), ids por processo, nunca no wire; consts de\nboot db/add|retract|ident|valueType|cardinality|unique|current-tx. Decoder\n(intern na captura, prática Clojure): ext 0x05/0x06 → uint32; dispatch de\nforma e checks de schema por id; TxWSlot.tskKw e TxWOp.attrSym carregam\nids, strings só em caminhos raros (erros, declare).\n\ntransactTx: lookups de índice único (anchors + lookup refs) coletados e\nresolvidos numa passada batchLookupAvet (ordenada, dedup, positional);\ntempids alocados na própria tx marcados FRESH (hasDatom por construção\nfalse — pulado no bulk); db.txInstant vai no batchWrite principal\n(allocateTDeferred + txInstantEntry — 1 ciclo de armazenamento por tx,\nnão 2); isUniqueById mata o re-lookup do refresh.\n\nestabs @50k: 5,7k rows/s (wall de storage difuso domina — insertOwned);\nintegridade mantida (65k estabs, cargo por aresta). Suíte 650 OK (+4\nsymtab).","tree":{"sha":"b73b4e43c9bc652c47e4b998fd55cf6924e3538c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/b73b4e43c9bc652c47e4b998fd55cf6924e3538c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDE3MjJkZTkxMGYxNWViY2YyNjMyNWQ5YzI5NGIzYzMyNTAxMWMzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e","sha":"e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e"}],"sha":"1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/1722de910f15ebcf26325d9c294b3c325011c30e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:49:10Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:49:10Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"loader scheme: portado para o transporte moderno (Kw heads + client.scheme)\n\nO loader de referência usava o tagged-AST antigo ([3,nome]/[7,[...]]) e\nclient.scheme_wire (passa direto pelo msgpack, sem to_wire) — quebrado\ndesde a EDN-ização da VM (''cannot apply non-keyword as function''). Formas\nagora com cabeça Kw ([:begin ...], [:save ...], [:get-or-create-entity ...]),\nvariáveis E/G como Sym, attrs como strings (normalizeAttr faz dot→slash),\ne dispatch via client.scheme (to_wire aplica ext 0x05/0x06).\n\nPermite re-medir a referência no build atual: estabs 65k scheme = 7.351\nrows/s vs EDN tx 5.914 — gap real de ~20% (overheads por-op do modelo de\ntx: wire 3x, hasDatom, resolução de tempid), não o -35% estimado antes.","tree":{"sha":"f73f5a4dc50c2f2c765dd93364f7b741edc2accb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/f73f5a4dc50c2f2c765dd93364f7b741edc2accb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGU1NzA2MjY4NjM2MjE5YWI0N2RjZWJjOTRlNjE0NjIyZTM0ZDNmMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702","sha":"9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702"}],"sha":"e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e5706268636219ab47dcebc94e614622e34d3f0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:39:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:39:22Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: hasDatomW com skip hidratado + contadores atrás de -d:eavtPerfCounters\n\nhasDatomW usa a invariante complete+current (probe + hasAttrKey + lookupRange\nem memória) antes de cair no scanPrefixActive — mesmo ''skip provado'' do\nretract-scan. Contadores getMonoTime (~5 vdso calls por datom) eliminados\ndo caminho de carga via const perfCounters (default false).\n\nMedições da rodada: hasDatom skip e ordenação de entries não movem o\nestabs (~5,9-6,0k rows/s); batch 4x maior idem. Perfil difuso: insertOwned\n18,5% + churn de alloc/ORC. A referência de 8,7k (doc) não é reproduzível\nno build atual (loader scheme incompatível com a VM EDN-izada; superfície\nSQL removida) — taxas honestas hoje @50k: empresas 24,5k estabs 5,9k\nsimples 33,4k socios 11,8k (grafo) — extrapolação 5,0h. Suíte 645 OK.","tree":{"sha":"f97e1f517b96307c5e5d2be09c6e21e8abe63948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/f97e1f517b96307c5e5d2be09c6e21e8abe63948"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDlhZWRkOWEzZDg5MWRhMTVlZWViZjBmNjI1Mzk2NjU1MTQ5ODY3MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc","sha":"2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc"}],"sha":"9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9aedd9a3d891da15eeebf0f62539665514986702"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:22:34Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:22:34Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: decode msgpack direto para ops planas — SExpr sai do caminho de escrita\n\ntxopsFromMsgpack (wire.nim) decodifica os vetores de op direto para\nTxWOp/TxWSlot (scheme.nim) — sem árvore SExpr intermediária (5+ objetos\nheap por op eliminados, junto com o churn ORC do rememberCycle/eqdestroy).\ntransactTx (edn_tx.nim) consome os ops planos: slots já tipados, classifi-\ncação reduzida a cache de attrs + range de tempids; transactEdn permanece\ncomo wrapper SExpr→flat (testes/REPL). Engine ganha variantes slot\n(encodeSaveValueSlot, saveResolvedSlotInto, lookupEntityW, hasDatomW por\nattrId) e saveResolvedInto refatorado em saveResolvedEncodedInto.\n\ntaxas @50k: empresas 23,3k/s estabs 5,7k/s simples 32,9k/s socios 11,1k/s\n(grafo pessoa+aresta) — extrapolação 5,2h. Integridade verificada: 65k\nestabs, 24,9k pessoas/25k participações, cargo por aresta. Suíte 645 OK.","tree":{"sha":"6be285d0a14d963819e6302899f24838a9718c97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/6be285d0a14d963819e6302899f24838a9718c97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDJhMDRlY2ExOTk3NmRlYWUwNzk4N2I2NGE4ZWE2ZWNjMTM0ODkyY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab","sha":"61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab"}],"sha":"2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/2a04eca19976deae07987b64a8ea6ecc134892cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:03:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:03:02Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: interpretador flat (1 passada) + carga Receita correta (goc, grafo socio)\n\nedn_tx: classificação posicional única em TxOpInfo (types.nim) com scratch\nreusado no EngineOps — mata a re-classificação O(T×N) de isSchemaAdd (45%\ndo CPU na carga); anchor de tempid vira array denso; sem saveOps/retractOps\nintermediários. saveBatchEdn/retractBatch assinaturas flat (attrId, guards\nde no-op e dup (eid,attr) card-one como no bulk do saveManyWithT).\n\nloader EDN: tempid distinto por entidade em TODOS os estágios (lookups\ncolapsava 68 quals em 1 entidade — raiz do 00-vs-22); refs viram eids via\ngoc anchors + tempid chaining (RefTids); socios como grafo: pessoa dedup\npor socio/chave (cpf visível + hash do nome) + aresta de participação\nsocio/chave_rel com cargo/data_entrada próprios — idempotente, cargo fiel\npor empresa; simples ganha max_rows de volta (1,1N — OOM).\n\nbench: probes com :in (param antes ignorado, virava full scan + eid lixo)\ne guardas de amostra vazia.\n\ntaxas @50k honestas: empresas 22,5k/s estabs 4,8k/s simples 30k/s socios\n9,3k/s (2 entidades/linha) — extrapolação 6,1h. Suíte 645 OK.","tree":{"sha":"52f760dec29e09cc5cd53288659b90f2f41dbf81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/52f760dec29e09cc5cd53288659b90f2f41dbf81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDYxYTBkZjQ0MWMzMjBhNWE4OGU1OGUzMzQxNmM5Mjc2MDc1MWRkYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070","sha":"9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070"}],"sha":"61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/61a0df441c320a5a88e58e33416c92760751ddab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:09:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:09:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"bench: Receita migrada para EDN tx + Datalog\n\nload_receita_edn.py substitui load_receita_sql.py:\n- declare_schema: 56 attrs via tx schema-as-data (eids únicos por attr)\n- load_lookups: tx upsert com tempid em :db.unique/identity\n- load_empresas: tx :db/add com tempid upsert em cnpj_base\n- merge_simples: tx upsert por cnpj_base (unique anchor)\n- load_estabs_bulk: tx :db/add com tempid por cnpj_completo\n- _flush_socio_batch: tx :db/add com tempid\n\nbench_receita_hydrated.py: probes via Datalog EDN + tx writes.\nsql_point removido (SQL não existe mais). Probe list:\n- eid_lookup(q): Datalog projection com param\n- attr_by_eid(q): Datalog com eid param\n- attrs_x3(q): multi-projection Datalog\n- upsert(tx): tx :db/add com eid resolvido\n\nReferência @5k (EDN, sem simples):\n  empresas 19,962/s (antes SQL: 26,327/s — tx tem overhead por atomicidade)\n  estabs    3,564/s (antes bulk save-many: 8,747/s — mesmo overhead)\n  socios   16,116/s (antes: 19,598/s)\n  upsert   16,774/s via tx direto no eid (p50=58µs)\n  attrs_x3 Datalog multi-proj p50=1,755µs\n\nA diferença vs SQL: tx protocol tem overhead por tx (uma round-trip\ne um batchWrite por lote de 500 ops) enquanto o SQL path usava\nsave-many storage-batched (um batchWrite com múltiplos datoms).","tree":{"sha":"a65b34a07faf174e4bd8ea86bfb8c2c4be76ce71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/a65b34a07faf174e4bd8ea86bfb8c2c4be76ce71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDliYTA5MjA1ZGZjYjFhNzUxOTljN2E3YmZiODc0MjNjYTM2MTEwNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977","sha":"983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977"}],"sha":"9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/9ba09205dfcb1a75199c7a7bfb87423ca3611070"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:31:47Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:31:47Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"repl: tx-data EDN + roteamento query/tx + terminador por balanceamento\n\nO REPL agora aceita as duas formas sem ponto-e-vírgula:\n- Datalog query:  [:find ?name :where [?e :ns.attr ?name]]\n- EDN tx-data:    [[:db/add -1 :ns.attr \"valor\"]]\n\nStatement completo quando o [ inicial fecha com ] (bracketDepth == 0).\nRoteamento: texto com :db/add/:db/retract → tx protocol; senão →\ndatalog query. tx-data parseado com nim_edn client-side, enviado via\ntxSExpr (keywords ext 0x06 no wire).\n\nclient.nim: txSExpr(ops: seq[SExpr]) method — writeSExprWire direto;\ndatalog() mantém toJsonNode (resposta tem só strings).\n\nE2E: schema via tx + query Datalog + resultado na stack real.","tree":{"sha":"b65115440ad32fccd4123a6ffa8105b48ec7c1f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/b65115440ad32fccd4123a6ffa8105b48ec7c1f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDk4M2E3NDFhOTAwYjlmMGNhMmZkOWQ5NTkwMGE1ZGRlODBiMWY5Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095","sha":"38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095"}],"sha":"983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/983a741a900b9f0ca2fd9d95900a5dde80b1f977"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:59:48Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:59:48Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"repl: migrado de SQL para Datalog EDN\n\n- repl.nim: executeSql → executeDatalog (client.datalog method)\n- prompt eavt-sql> → eavt-dl>, help text atualizado\n- histórico: ~/.eavt_datalog_history\n- entry point: -e e pipe mode usam client.datalog\n- client.nim: datalog() method + txExec() adicionados\n\nQueries: [:find ?name :where [?e :ns.attr ?name]];\nE2E: dados escritos via tx, consultados via REPL Datalog.","tree":{"sha":"211381e1cc70e727cbec296655f79e59843749a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/211381e1cc70e727cbec296655f79e59843749a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDM4ZGQ5N2Y4ODA1NjkzOTE3NWM0MTAyNGIyMzEwNDU3MDY0NDkwOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6","sha":"7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6"}],"sha":"38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/38dd97f88056939175c41024b231045706449095"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:53:41Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:53:41Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fase C final: nim_sql_parse e nim_sql_frontend DELETADOS\n\nMódulos SQL removidos do disco:\n- nim_sql_parse/ (lexer + parser SQL) — DELETADO\n- nim_sql_frontend/ (frontend, explain duplicado) — DELETADO\n- nim_datalog/translate.nim (SQL AST → IR) — DELETADO\n- nim_datalog/test_datalog.nim, nim_compiler/test_compiler.nim,\n  nim_sql_frontend/test_sql_frontend.nim — DELETADOS\n\nCore types limpos de sql_ast:\n- datalog_ast: bvExpr removido do enum/case/newBoundExpr/$\n- planner_ast: pvExpr + skBoundExpr removidos\n- planner: bvExpr→pvExpr → skBoundExpr removidos\n- scheme_compile.nim: reescrito limpo (só compileSelectScheme +\n  buildTriejoinScheme + helpers)\n- compiler.nim: SQL procs removidos\n- explain.nim: skBoundExpr branch removido\n\nTestes migrados para Datalog:\n- TX entity, TX join → transactEdn + readEdnVector\n- position-independent → runDl + runDlWithStats\n- ranges with param refs → runDl\n\n645 testes OK, 0 FAILED. nimble dist: 3 binários. E2E na stack real:\ndatalog query + tx write OK.","tree":{"sha":"9bd21246a75950413352b769acba00162a7ca4c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/9bd21246a75950413352b769acba00162a7ca4c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/7d14fe769eec08ec549814cad63e3e581d975ac6","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDdkMTRmZTc2OWVlYzA4Z