,"signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/271b06e53a7672818194bbe4feea9823abcd4f8a","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDI3MWIwNmU1M2E3NjcyODE4MTk0YmJlNGZlZWE5ODIzYWJjZDRmOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63","sha":"d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63"}],"sha":"271b06e53a7672818194bbe4feea9823abcd4f8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/271b06e53a7672818194bbe4feea9823abcd4f8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T01:49:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T01:49:12Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"fase C: gateway sem SQL — datalog + tx como únicas superfícies\n\nGateway (connection.nim) limpo de SQL:\n- handleSql, handleUpdateMux, handleDeleteMux, of \"sql\" removidos\n- imports de sql_ast/sql_parser/tx_compile/frontend removidos\n- datalog: request EDN nativo (query + params + explain) via o pipeline\n  resolveIr → plan → compileSelectScheme → EDN VM\n- tx: escritas EDN direto (já implementado no passo 1)\n\nCompileResult unificado em nim_compiler/compiler.nim (com isSelect/\nisExplain/selectBody) — frontend.CompileResult removido.\nrenderExplain movido para nim_compiler/explain.nim.\n\nPython client: tx() + Kw() (keyword ext 0x06) adicionados. SQL surface\nretorna erro \"unknown request type\".\n\nnim_sql_parse e nim_sql_frontend mantidos como dependência de TESTE\napenas (não importados pelo código de produção). A deleção completa dos\nmódulos acontece quando os testes forem migrados para Datalog.\n\n nimble test 0 FAILED (687+ testes). E2E: datalog query + tx write +\nsql request rejeitado.","tree":{"sha":"9288a1e1b3bbb4a936c21fa9b4a27aaa909ff517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/9288a1e1b3bbb4a936c21fa9b4a27aaa909ff517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKGQyZjc1Mzk2MzZlNThiYzQyMGVhNTU1MjZjMTE4NTIyZTUxYTVlNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/aeb4611da3612b6126ccdc27d0ec7539fbff2645","sha":"aeb4611da3612b6126ccdc27d0ec7539fbff2645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/aeb4611da3612b6126ccdc27d0ec7539fbff2645"}],"sha":"d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/d2f7539636e58bc420ea55526c118522e51a5e63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.