d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/72e1871be79311648c0c648bad24e994b793171d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:40:14Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:40:14Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: canônico slash para nomes de atributos (F3)\n\nStorage canonical passa a ns/name (tx-protocol.md §8):\n- normalizeAttr: :ns/name, ns.name e ns/name → ns/name (rejeita bare)\n- BootstrapSchema: 26 attrs do sistema em slash (db/ident, db/txInstant, ...)\n- translate.nim: validateAttrName normaliza dot→slash na fronteira SQL —\n  o IR carrega nomes canônicos end-to-end (resolveIr, planner, scanners)\n- safeAttrName gera vars com sufixo _s_ para slash\n- testes de expectativa de nome atualizados (attrName, intern-a, IR)\n\nSuperfície SQL continua aceitando dot notation; keywords EDN :ns/name\nmapeiam direto. DB dev recriada (sem produção, sem migração).\n\nE2E: SQL (dot) e tx (keyword) escrevendo/consultando os mesmos attrs\ncanônicos; schema snapshot em slash; upsert por unique cruzando os dois\ncaminhos. nimble test 0 FAILED.","tree":{"sha":"457b28a397b6430a70870b8402a5bded22e64031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/457b28a397b6430a70870b8402a5bded22e64031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/72e1871be79311648c0c648b