ravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/951438ff15e96f53fff643da14eca84766bed555/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:45:10Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:45:25Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: query server compila escritas SQL para tx-data EDN (F2)\n\nEscritas SQL deixam de compilar para programas Scheme e passam por tx:\n- nim_compiler/tx_compile.nim: gêmeos EDN dos compiladores de escrita —\n  compileUpsertTx (tempids negativos; ueLookup vira tempid ancorado no\n  attr UNIQUE = upsert get-or-create Datomic, com eid no tx-report),\n  compileAttributeTx (schema-as-data), txAdd/txRetract, valueToVal com\n  params substituídos na compilação (§5.4 — tx não tem (param N)).\n- downstream.nim: requestCollect — coleta frames de resposta para\n  inspeção local (tempids → rows), mantendo o leitor/demux existente.\n- handleSql: UPSERT/ATTRIBUTE → tx; rows legadas reconstruídas do report\n  ([[eid, N]], [[attr, tipo]]) — contrato do REPL/Python preservado.\n  Erros de tx (lookup miss, attr desconhecida) viram erros SQL.\n- mixed UPDATE/DELETE: batches de 100 eids → :db/add/:db/retract, uma tx\n  por batch, rows legadas por batch. DELETE por eid-only responde vazio\n  (o caminho compilado também não retraía nada). PARTITION segue no\n  scheme (partições engine-managed, §9).\n\nStreaming de consulta intocado (SELECT na réplica, yield/resume).\n\nE2E: UPSERT/UPSERT-by-lookup/UPDATE/DELETE/ATTRIBUTE via tx com rows\nlegadas; Python client contract intacto (eids, params, unique flow);\nnimble test 0 FAILED.","tree":{"sha":"ec73beff778170f71da7605a39b68d04290864ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/ec73beff778170f71da7605a39b68d04290864ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/951438ff15e96f53fff643da14eca84766bed555","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/951438ff15e96f53fff643da14eca84766bed555","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDk1MTQzOGZmMTVlOTZmNTNmZmY2NDNkYTE0ZWNhODQ3NjZiZWQ1NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061","sha":"4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061"}],"sha":"951438ff15e96f53fff643da14eca84766bed555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/951438ff15e96f53fff643da14eca84766bed555"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:49:01Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:49:01Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"tx: protocolo de transação EDN nativa no transactor (F0+F1)\n\nF0 — base EDN:\n- SExpr ganha sKeyword (aditivo, self-avaliável no VM) + wire ext 0x06\n- nim_edn: reader EDN → SExpr (:kw, symbols, ?vars, vetores, escalares, _;\n  maps/sets rejeitados no wire — fail-loud, sem consumidor)\n- byte-level idêntico ao msgpack-python (fixext d5 06)\n\nF1 — request tx no transactor:\n- edn_tx.nim: interpretador nativo de tx-data Datomic-style, sem VM Scheme\n  no caminho de escrita. Tempids negativos (upsert por :db.unique/identity\n  via anchor lookup), lookup refs in-tx (miss = erro, Datomic-strict),\n  schema-as-data (:db/ident/:db/valueType/:db/cardinality/:db/unique →\n  declareAttrFromSql; schema ops primeiro), :db/current-tx para metadados\n  do usuário no entity da tx, um t por tx, tx-report {tempids, tx}.\n- tx-report via fila única de saída (writeFrameQueued) — ordem wal-antes-da\n  -response estrutural, mesmo contrato do scheme exec.\n\nDois bugs corrigidos:\n1. eavtDeclareAttr persistia o datom db/ident com o nome cru — transactor\n   e réplica discordavam do nome do attr (lookup SQL quebrado na réplica).\n   Agora persiste a forma canônica do resolver.\n2. Re-assert idempotente: :db/add de datom já presente é no-op (Datomic),\n   para cardinality-one E many. Sem isso, retract+reassert no mesmo t\n   somava o datom no scan ativo e quebrava upserts em série (e duplicava\n   valores em many). hasDatom(eid, attr, val) por byte-compare de EAVT.\n\nSuíte: 0 FAILED (20 testes de tx novos; 27 de EDN). E2E no socket real:\nschema-as-data + tempid chaining + :db/current-tx numa tx; upsert reusando\neid; lookup-miss abortando; SQL na réplica enxergando datoms de tx.\n\nDocs: tx-protocol.md §4 (idempotência), scheme-transport.md (request tx).","tree":{"sha":"ea5077c344cd9d6f897551e1f3d8d95e0467f076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/ea5077c344cd9d6f897551e1f3d8d95e0467f076"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061","node_id":"C_kwDOSziTR9oAKDRkMGE4NjBmN2Y2Yzc4ZTIyYWVjOTQ3ZjI5ZjBjODFlMmJiNDQwNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo/eavt-sql/commit/3395205e699bd85f002a7e7afee129bcab7562dc","sha":"3395205e699bd85f002a7e7afee129bcab7562dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3395205e699bd85f002a7e7afee129bcab7562dc"}],"sha":"4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4d0a860f7f6c78e22aec947f29f0c81e2bb44061"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/3395205e699bd85f002a7e7afee129bcab7562dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:29:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:29:20Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"replication: fila única wal-antes-da-response + resolver na réplica — resolve corrida do ATTRIBUTE...UNIQUE\n\n- transactor: Subscriber com fila de saída única (wal/seal/root + responses\n  em conexão com replicate); enqueueResponse descarrega buf wal antes da\n  response — ordem estrutural, read-your-writes sem guard sleeps\n- drain single-flight (pump), sem subscriberLoop/tick de 2ms\n- backlog > 64 MiB fecha o subscriber (fail-fast; reconecta + re-snapshot)\n- snapshot segue direto (fora da fila, não conta no backlog)\n- réplica: frames wal com datoms db.* (journalHasSchemaRecords em kvstore)\n  disparam bootstrapResolver + schemaDirty (bypass do TTL no getSnapshot)\n- eavtDeclareAttr: grava db.unique sempre que unique=true (antes só se\n  isNew — redeclare nunca persistia; réplica não recebia, restart perdia)\n- query server: remove os 3 sleeps de 50ms\n- testes: ordem na fila, backlog drop, WAL→resolver, redeclare+restart;\n  repro end-to-end (ATTRIBUTE UNIQUE + save + SELECT eid imediato) verde","tree":{"sha":"12846dd8dc16841bef02843bc6f381e226679f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/12846dd8dc16841bef02843bc6f381e226679f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/3395205e699bd85f002a7e7afee129bcab7562dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qu