arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/e46f95e605f307d47bfddd1c8cc3dfb8bf547cdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:15:10Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:28:41Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"docs: spec do protocolo de tx EDN (Datomic-style) Q↔T\n\ndocs/tx-protocol.md — transações [:db/add/:db/retract] interpretadas\nnativamente no transactor (sem VM Scheme no caminho de escrita):\ntempids com upsert por UNIQUE, lookup refs in-tx (miss = erro,\nDatomic-strict), schema como dados, :db/current-tx para metadados\ndo usuário no entity da tx, tx-report {tempids, tx}. Modelo de\nconsistência documentado: queries na réplica (eventual), escritas\nunitárias atômicas, bulk duas fases best-effort.\n\nscheme-transport.md ganha o request tx na tabela (§3.1) e o link\nnas referências. Implementação pendente (F0–F4 do próprio doc).","tree":{"sha":"2baa1df10318c3543eea143baeb224e520d2d2df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/2baa1df10318c3543eea143baeb224e520d2d2df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/e46f95e605f307d47bfddd1c8cc3dfb8bf547cdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"