":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/commits/4171929544ff6b934cd0ae8040418d72cc46102c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:32:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:32:04Z","email":"fabio@ferraribr.com","name":"Fabio Ferrari"},"message":"wire: EDN-like — nós nativos msgpack + symbol via ext 0x05\n\nProgramas scheme viajam como valores msgpack nativos (int/float/str/bool/\nnil/array direto, bytes como bin); symbol via ext type 0x05 — substitui o\nencoding [tag, value] e elimina o caminho JSON legacy (sexprToWire/\nwireToSexpr). Decoder fail-loud: maps, ext desconhecido e truncamento\nlevantam WireError. API pública de wire.nim intacta — transactor e query\nserver não mudam.\n\nPython client: Sym → ExtType(0x05), ext_hook no decode; byte-level\nidêntico ao encoder Nim (d4 05 61). Docs §3.3/3.4 atualizadas.\n\nSuite Nim: 0 FAILED (~492 testes, 40 novos de wire). E2E confirmado:\nSQL+params, scheme exec/query/lookup-entity/bytes via stack completa.","tree":{"sha":"2e18211d8ac647f8c18f0985c65a8b8ba55c9dd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/trees/2e18211d8ac647f8c18f0985c65a8b8ba55c9dd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quartzo/eavt-sql/git/commits/4171929544ff6b934cd0ae8040418d72cc46102c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quartzo","id":65745,"login":"quartzo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quartzo/orgs","received_events_url":"https