sform feedback loop toggled --viewport-shift-bottom every frame\nwhen pulling past the bottom edge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ae416027b337c18cd30d6c1ae6b647da2f5d23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/5ae416027b337c18cd30d6c1ae6b647da2f5d23b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/f887077e33e163bc464e8d1733becc55756301a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ae416027b337c18cd30d6c1ae6b647da2f5d23b\nparent 9b8eb361932214af2678a8e892777f0fd6ce7137\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789068994 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789068994 +0000\n\nFix bottom nav flicker during rubber-band overscroll\n\nStop listening to visualViewport scroll events and compute the shift from\nlayout innerHeight instead of the nav bounding rect. The scroll listener\nand transform feedback loop toggled --viewport-shift-bottom every frame\nwhen pulling past the bottom edge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIOjoRXCNswu0j4O8VolnO/hA1/7YtPNEbRgw0DoFhQeHvZ0AejXzhvkD0z2M2E+jE\nJyZxP4ku+j5ygtI/lLVwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T19:36:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user