os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/f844e28b5667517dd2e995be0b08a8ac8d331156","node_id":"C_kwDOSzqkiNoAKGY4NDRlMjhiNTY2NzUxN2RkMmU5OTViZTBiMDhhOGFjOGQzMzExNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870","sha":"55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870"}],"sha":"f844e28b5667517dd2e995be0b08a8ac8d331156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/f844e28b5667517dd2e995be0b08a8ac8d331156"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:48:23Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T19:19:46Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"message":"Nutrition schedules: single feeding time, sorted slots, smarter nudges\n\nReplace from/to window intervals with a single scheduled feeding time per\nentry. Floor times to 10-minute steps and sort windows chronologically on\nsave. Step the cumulative fluid chart schedule line at each feeding time\ninstead of window midpoints. Feeding reminders now fire only when a scheduled\ntime falls in the current 10-minute worker slot and intake is below the\ncumulative projection, rather than on every tick while still behind.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4578881c997902c6a0eba59e2280c336739765e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/4578881c997902c6a0eba59e2280c336739765e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870","node_id":"C_kwDOSzqkiNoAKDU1NzQ1YzlkNzRhMWU1NGZiMWQ4Nzc5NGIzNjlmMGFhZmU0YzM4NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9","sha":"43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9"}],"sha":"55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/55745c9d74a1e54fb1d87794b369f0aafe4c3870"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/b478621ec2af283343e5e0043a341716b0092b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T19:13:56Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T19:13:56Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"Fix iOS PWA bottom nav after OIDC with visualViewport sync\n\nReplace the post-auth full-page reload (insufficient on iOS PWAs) with a\nvisualViewport-based shift that re-anchors the fixed bottom nav, sheet, and\nbackdrop. AuthCallback marks the next Layout mount for an aggressive sync\nburst; listeners keep the offset updated as the viewport changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"86b2519652921a17d89422a698cfa161a731bb5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/86b2519652921a17d89422a698cfa161a731bb5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/b478621ec2af283343e5e0043a341716b0092b33","verification":{"payload":"tree 86b2519652921a17d89422a698cfa161a731bb5c\nparent 43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789067636 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789067636 +0000\n\nFix iOS PWA bottom nav after OIDC with visualViewport sync\n\nReplace the post-auth full-page reload (insufficient on iOS PWAs) with a\nvisualViewport-based shift that re-anchors the fixed bottom nav, sheet, and\nbackdrop. AuthCallback marks the next Layout mount for an aggressive sync\nburst; listeners keep the offset updated as the viewport changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNutgFAmrncVOUcg2IR4PYCpsDT7ye21Angzpgx0zebqAIBoEsGo7M1igGBEQNleZB\n169qoCIbXCSxcGPr4ylgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T19:14:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/b478621ec2af283343e5e0043a341716b0092b33","node_id":"C_kwDOSzqkiNoAKGI0Nzg2MjFlYzJhZjI4MzM0M2U1ZTAwNDNhMzQxNzE2YjAwOTJiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9","sha":"43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9"}],"sha":"b478621ec2af283343e5e0043a341716b0092b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/b478621ec2af283343e5e0043a341716b0092b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:30:14Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:30:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix feeding nudge to compare against chart schedule (#59)\n\n* Fix feeding nudge to use chart schedule projection\n\nCompare today''s intake against schedule_projection_at (midpoint\nstepping, same as the cumulative fluid chart) instead of\nschedule_due_at (window-start stepping). This prevents false nudges\nwhen total exceeds the chart schedule, e.g. 136 ml vs 121 ml at 14:02\nafter the 14:00 window starts but before its 14:30 midpoint.\n\nAlso attach at most one reminder per check to the latest started window\nwhen globally behind, and update schedule UI copy to match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply rustfmt to feeding_nudge_service\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"89d3512bc1be01f644aa457ad47456505a543eaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/89d3512bc1be01f644aa457ad47456505a543eaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/43ab61a0c75cf22c854aec4561f5506813b629c9","verification":{"payload":"tree 89d3512bc1be01f644aa457ad47456505a543eaa\nparent 60f6427b55fbde492ccffc866c833d555e9aac21\nauthor Aleksandr <red.avtovo@gmail.com> 1789050614 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789050614 +0200\n\nFix feeding nudge to compare against chart schedule (#59)\n\n* Fix feeding nudge to use chart schedule projection\n\nCompare today''s intake against schedule_projection_at (midpoint\nstepping, same as the cumulative fluid chart) instead of\nschedule_due_at (window-start stepping). This prevents false nudges\nwhen total exceeds the chart schedule, e.g. 136 ml vs 121 ml at 14:02\nafter the 14:00 window starts but before its 14:30 midpoint.\n\nAlso attach at most one reminder per check to the latest started window\nwhen globally behind, and update schedule UI copy to match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply rustfmt to feeding_nudge_service\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqor73CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnVMQACWHtaj3lrUQGtdS+7PeJWns\nUwN2nbxj4CLoBtcmgShIFo+9b15usfI/x559vzRaNXjqpv+rtgJLT2cO1cWl+xnO\nsfnOefI/Dmc3+qory5otldyWjX1hLBhSpjfcyaXtZZxTYtGsNEYsXqAzJLDZkTg8\nsIjsnghjcwLkRckUjVhYqksRXHohpRmuwi9eM4Xn+rl++9JiZZH/awd/ZZ5ahe/M\n/m5LkIXaEbPmisJ1URQt+pUbyoV4TDB1d8ufuCEFt7jfr8e7QBfu1B84sWeS7b/A\nAOCHuvSJr9UU1jofRBte/uduTRHfcs8wIKy/iqlXp5gV82nm1pusOQpwoqHARj47\nD/wRgKOKsVbKAZVttInnqF//3CMMCOzu2PSq9xIWx1qt4inZkRhzThEgJ8/qyluC\nLIFU6jEKXZQiSG6MdeuGiow5LWtV7ctw7Woje72mUZ/jnEwvyqz60Maz3125YbYV\nUx7BLGUnzho8usAdB1en/tAsrW50sy5V38Zankk3RSilSB1rxiNy3tYASeuphlGs\nHNyJfh1IsADgif3y3ac4eOHf1u686aPtkczBSjsCjJoe6mSYLcPKnfy/9GKEenrk\nQHW28oeyZup914DHQLluGcdHOZEfWF9h11DSaglM1cZcZ3s8d0gVTyhDeZbOhWmN\n4FMMiF76uuZs8ZxTxenR\n=s3TZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T14:30:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/foll