:"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/d86251b4e257c6e74648b253a62eba9c84449ffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:37:30Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:37:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix MCP GET returning SPA HTML for Streamable HTTP clients (#55)\n\n* Fix MCP GET returning SPA HTML for Streamable HTTP clients\n\nReturn 405 JSON on GET /mcp instead of falling through to the SPA shell,\nwhich caused clients to report text/html when expecting text/event-stream.\n\nAlso return HTTP 202 for MCP notifications per Streamable HTTP spec.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Pebble Index MCP compat: protocol negotiation, instructions, coreSchema\n\n- Negotiate initialize protocolVersion (2025-06-18, 2025-03-26, 2024-11-05)\n- Return caregiver instructions on initialize for client system prompt injection\n- Wrap tools/call results with coreSchema structuredContent for Index feed\n- Add arg-free household-* prompts selectable in Pebble Index app\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Format MCP integration tests (cargo fmt)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Set version to 0.21.1 (single patch bump for this PR)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Document one Cargo version bump per PR in CLAUDE.md\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Accept MCP protocol version 2025-11-25 for Pebble Index\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cdbb71bdbfe77e69801e05273cfe0126ba172e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/5cdbb71bdbfe77e69801e05273cfe0126ba172e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/d86251b4e257c6e74648b253a62eba9c84449ffc","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cdbb71bdbfe77e69801e05273cfe0126ba172e9\nparent db10dd704356c3eafea956753568c7f38c4494e1\nauthor Aleksandr <red.avtovo@gmail.com> 1788709050 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788709050 +0200\n\nFix MCP GET returning SPA HTML for Streamable HTTP clients (#55)\n\n* Fix MCP GET returning SPA HTML for Streamable HTTP clients\n\nReturn 405 JSON on GET /mcp instead of falling through to the SPA shell,\nwhich caused clients to report text/html when expecting text/event-stream.\n\nAlso return HTTP 202 for MCP notifications per Streamable HTTP spec.\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Pebble Index MCP compat: protocol negotiation, instructions, coreSchema\n\n- Negotiate initialize protocolVersion (2025-06-18, 2025-03-26, 2024-11-05)\n- Return caregiver instructions on initialize for client system prompt injection\n- Wrap tools/call results with coreSchema structuredContent for Index feed\n- Add arg-free household-* prompts selectable in Pebble Index app\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Format MCP integration tests (cargo fmt)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Set version to 0.21.1 (single patch bump for this PR)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Document one Cargo version bump per PR in CLAUDE.md\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Accept MCP protocol version 2025-11-25 for Pebble Index\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandr <red-avtovo@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnYi6CRC1aQ7uu5Uh