ults, add stories\n\nRoot cause: pet_settings handlers were registered at /api/v1/{id}/settings/{key}\nbut the frontend called /api/v1/pets/{id}/settings/{key} — 404 on every request.\nPartial/empty responses also crashed computeCronHours on undefined.enabled.\n\n- Move pet_settings handlers into the /pets scope (now /pets/{id}/settings/{key})\n- usePetSettings: deep-merge API response with slot-level defaults so an empty\n  or partial response never leaves morning/midday/evening as undefined\n- Add HealthNotificationsPage.stories with EmptyApiResponse and PartialApiResponse\n  stories as regression guards for this class of crash\n\nHow to catch this before runtime: Storybook plays EmptyApiResponse and\nPartialApiResponse with {} and partial objects pre-seeded in the query cache;\nthe vitest/Storybook test suite now fails if the component crashes on bad data.","tree":{"sha":"5f7412a2e2a9c4d0e4e950deb46e5c9efb107181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/5f7412a2e2a9c4d0e4e950deb46e5c9efb107181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/8088071ec7c74306a3658f86c3ac4bf975186e2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github