nts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/e61d1fe0806dc1b940cb44d1b086c901496741c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:16:07Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"red"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T14:05:44Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"message":"feat: internal nudge scheduler + device viewport docs\n\nNudge scheduler:\n- Spawns at startup (nudge_service::spawn), wakes at the top of each hour\n- At each hour H: for every user/pet with an enabled slot at deadline_hour <= H,\n  finds all scheduled meds that should have been taken by now but haven''t,\n  sends push: ''Don''t forget to give <meds> to <pet> in time''\n- Evening check also catches untaken morning/midday doses\n- No HTTP endpoint — entirely server-side; no external cron needed\n\nHealthNotificationsPage: shows ''Server checks at: HH:MM, ...'' summary\n  updated live as slots are toggled\n\nCLAUDE.md: add target device viewport specs (Galaxy Z Flip 4, iPhone 16 Pro,\n  iPhone 15 Pro Max, desktop 800 px / 1400 px) with CSS px, DPR, safe area notes","tree":{"sha":"8c4a33907753441681f95e08d74bda5f62333c31","