ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/42b582e320ae74180af016babe226786b750960d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:03:46Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"red"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T14:05:44Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"message":"feat: bundle shortcut, meal wait timer, assignment edit, medication description\n\n- Apple Shortcut: bundles appear as a single entry (kind=bundle), taken via\n  new POST /shortcuts/meds/intake/take-bundle; member meds excluded from\n  individual choices when their bundle is due\n- Apple Shortcut: after each successful take (individual or bundle), starts\n  an iOS countdown timer if meal_wait_minutes is set on the assignment\n- Today''s meds sorted: bundles → scheduled → optional, alpha within each;\n  bundle members no longer duplicated in individual sections\n- Assignments: add meal_wait_minutes field; editable inline on the assignment\n  card (PATCH /health/meds/assignments/{id}) without creating a new revision\n- Medications: add description field; shown in card view, editable in edit mode\n- New migrations: 021 (meal_wait_minutes on assignments), 022 (description on medications)\n- Updated iCloud shortcut link","tree":{"sha":"7f873298818ec170ae35eda5022698c7adb713a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/7f873298818ec170ae35eda5022698c7adb713a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/42b582e320ae74180af016babe226786b750960d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g