lol + Prednisolone) were silently excluded from\nthe shortcut intake menu. Since the take endpoint handles individual meds,\nthey can simply appear as separate choices — the user selects each one and\nthe shortcut takes them in the same loop it uses for standalone meds.\n\nRemove bundled_medication_ids and the bundled.contains filter.","tree":{"sha":"568a7ff09bdc88895c78754ad5bd6af4961c3de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/568a7ff09bdc88895c78754ad5bd6af4961c3de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/9421ee7eee402d00ee5d93b0ae0235f233767b05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/9421ee7eee402d00ee5d93b0ae0235f233767b05","node_id":"C_kwDOSzqkiNoAKDk0MjFlZTdlZWU0MDJkMDBlZTVkOTNiMGFlMDIzNWYyMzM3NjdiMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0rsa/petmon/commit/c72c4529e4870e4b8e0478ec6be9f7d621452b96","sha":"c72c4529e4870e4b8e0478ec6be9f7d621452b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/c72c4529e4870e4b8e0478ec6be9f7d621452b96"}],"sha":"9421ee7eee402d00ee5d93b0ae0235f233767b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/9421ee7eee402d00ee5d93b0ae0235f233767b05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/commits/c72c4529e4870e4b8e0478ec6be9f7d621452b96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T09:33:52Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"red"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T09:54:53Z","email":"red.avtovo@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr"},"message":"fix: allow API token to create new tokens, show creation errors in UI\n\nBackend (src/api/settings.rs):\n- Remove the blanket block that rejected token creation when authenticated\n  via an API token. identity.subject for an API token is already the\n  owner_subject from the original OIDC session, so the new token is\n  correctly attributed to the same user.\n- Narrow the ''OIDC must be configured'' guard to OIDC sessions only;\n  API token sessions carry an owner_subject already and do not need OIDC\n  to be live at creation time.\n\nFrontend (src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx):\n- Import ApiError and add error display below the Create button in the\n  API tokens section. Shows the server''s message when available, or a\n  generic fallback. Previously the mutation silently failed with no\n  feedback.\n\nTests:\n- api_token_can_create_another_token_inheriting_owner: verifies that a\n  request authenticated with an existing API token can create a second\n  token, and that the new token''s owner_subject matches the seeded\n  owner_subject of the authenticating token.","tree":{"sha":"9472cc18650e4c0321e17cbaae794a192d64c46f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/trees/9472cc18650e4c0321e17cbaae794a192d64c46f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0rsa/petmon/git/commits/c72c4529e4870e4b8e0478ec6be9f7d621452b96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red-avtovo","id":10682826,"login":"red-avtovo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgyODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-avtovo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c